<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id">Isaiah</book>
  <para style="h">Isaiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Isaiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Isaiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Isaiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amoz fapa Isaiah in, Judah siangpahrang Uzziah, Jotham, Ahaz le Hezekiah pawl san ah, Judah le Jerusalem hrangih Pathian ṭongkam a theih mi cu hiti in a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw lei le van, ka ṭongmi hi thei uh. Ka cawm mi ka faate pawl in in dodal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Caw in a neitu an thei; laak khalin an bawipa ih rawl peknak kuang an thei. Asinain ka minung Israel cun cutluk hman an thei lo. Zianghman an thei bembem lo a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Israel, nannih misual, mimawh, thilṭha lo lawnglawng a tuah ih nawhthuh a ei mi minung pawl, nan cemthla a si. Nan sualnak in a lo dirhthlak a si. Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian thianghlim cu nan dungtun a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ziangruangah ral nan tho ringring? Nasa sinsin ih hrem nan duh maw si? Maw Israel, na lu cu hma in a khatih na thin le na lung cu natnak a tuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na kezim ihsin na luthlung tiang a dam mi khui hmanah a um lo. A pem mi le a dup mi le a bauh mi hlir in a khat a si. Na hma pawl cu kholhfai mi a si lo, tuam mi khal a si lo. Sii hnih mi khal a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nan ram cu siatsuah ṭheh a si ih a ṭhing reprep; nan khua pawl cu meisa in a kaangṭheh zo. Nan mithmuh rori ah miphundang pawl in nan ram cu an lakih an siatsuah ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem khua lawnglawng a taang ih anih khal cu ral ih kulh ṭheh mi khawpi a si; sabit hmuan ih hmuan kiltu deu le fanghma hmuan ih sak mi thlam vekin bawmtu le ṭantu neilo khawpi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in mi hrekkhat pawl zuah hlah sehla, Sodom le Gomorrah khua vekin a hloral ta mi khawpi a si zo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem, na minung le na uktu pawl cu Sodom le Gomorrah minung le uktu bangtuk an si. Na hnenih Bawipa ṭongkam hi ngai ṭha hnik. Kan Pathian ih a lo zirh mi hi ruat ṭha hnik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in, “In pek ringring mi thawinak pawl hi ka duhzet ah maw nan ruat? Thawinak ih nan ur mi tuu pawl le nan ṭilva thau zetzet pawl hi ka khop zo. Nan caw, nan tuu le nan me thisen pawl hi ka ningtuk zo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In biak tikah hipawl rak keng dingah zoso a lo fial? Ka Biakinn sung ra hnaihnok tu dingah zoso a lo sawm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nan thil pek mi pawl hi zianghman ah a ṭhahnem lo. Rimhmui nan pek mi pawl hi ka fih a si. Nan Thla Thar Puai pawl, nan Sabbath pawl le nan pumkhawmnak pawl hi ka tuar thei nawn lo. Nan sualnak in a siatsuah ṭheh zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nan Thla Thar Puai le nan ulh mi nan puai pawl hi ka hua. Ka hrangah thilrit an si ih ka tuar thei nawn lo a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Baan pharh in thla nan cam hman ah ka lo zoh lo ding. Ziangtluk tam ih nan cam khalle ka lo ngaisak lo ding; ziangahtile nan kut cu thisen in a khat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thiangfai in kholh aw uh; ka mithmuh ih nan tuah rero mi thilsual pawl hi tuah nawn hlah uh. A si, thilṭha lo tuah cu baang thlang uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thilṭha tuah zir uh. A dikmi hawl uhla, hremnak a tuartu pawl bawm uh. Nu le pa neilo ngakṭah pawl bawm uhla nuhmei pawl ṭan uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ra uhla kan ruat tlang hnik pei. Nan sualnak cu sen-eu bangin sen hmansehla, vur bangin ka lo thiangfai ter ding; sendup bangin dup hmansehla tuuhmul bangin ka lo vaar ter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thu nan ngai a si ahcun hi ram ih a suah mi thilṭha nan ei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asinain ka thu nan eel ih in dodal a si ahcun nan thi rori ding. Bawipa keimah in ka ṭong zo a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rintlakzet a si mi khawpi cu hlawhhlang ah a cang. Khuahlan ahcun miding pawl umnak khawpi a si; atu ahcun mithat pawl lawnglawng an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem, khuahlan ahcun ngun bangtuk na rak si; atu ahcun man neilo na si. Khuahlan ahcun sabit zu thawzet bangtuk na rak si; atu ahcun tidai lawng na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na hotu pawl cu ralthotu le rukru pawl ih rualpi hlir an si. Thu an rel tikah nu le pa neilo farah pawl an ṭan dah lo ih nuhmei pawl ih thu cu an ngaisak dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Curuangah, cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian, a maksak mi ih a sim mi hi ngaiṭha aw; Bawipa in, “Ka ral ih a cang zo mi na parah hin phu ka la ding; cuticun hnaihnawhnak in pe nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na parah ka thinhengnak a thleng sal ding. Thir an ser vekin somei ah ka lo ser dingih na balhnak hmuahhmuah cu ka hlon thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khuahlan ih hotu le remruattu pawl vekin hotu le remruattu a thar in ka lo pe ding. Cuticun Jerusalem cu a dingmi le rinsantlak khawpi ti ih kawh a si ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bawipa cu a ding mi a si ruangah Jerusalem cu a hum dingih sual a sirtu hmuahhmuah a run ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Asinain a sualtu le amah a dotu hmuahhmuah cu dip ṭheh in a rial dingih amah a hnongtu pawl cu a that ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thingkung nan biak ruangah le hmuan thianghlim sungih milem nan biakmi ruangah ningzak in nan um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A thi mi sasua kung vekin nan vuai dingih zohman ih tidai toih lo hmuan vek nan si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hramro cu meici fate in a kang thei vekin micak le mi nasa pawl khal anmah ih thilsual tuahnak in a siatsuah dingih cuih siatsuahnak cu zohman in an mit thei nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian in Amoz fapa Isaiah hnenah Judah le Jerusalem thu thawn peh aw in hi ti hin a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hmailam caanah Biakinn a dinnak tlang cu tlangdang hnakin a saangbik a si ding. Miphun tampi cuih tlang ahcun cat loin an ra dingih
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />an minung pawl in, “ Bawipaió tlang ah hung feh uhsi; Israel Pathian in Biakinn ahcun. Thlun dingih in duh mi cu in zirh dingih A hrilzo mi a lamzin ihsin kan feh ding. Bawipaió thuzirhmi cu Jerusalem ihsin a ra; Zion ihsin a mi pawl hnenah a sim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ram tumzetzet karlakih thutam mi cu a daiter ding. Cuticun an ralnam cu leilehnak tuhmui ah an ser dingih an feipi cu thingrah kung thenfainak namte ah an tuah ding. Ramkhat le ramkhat an do aw nawn lo dingih, raldo khal an tum nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Jakob ih tefa sin pawl, Bawipaió in pek mi tleunak sungah tlangleng uhsi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Pathian, na minung Jakob ih tefa sin pawl cu na dungtun a si. Curuangah an ram cu nisuahnak lam le Filistin ramih mitkher le dawithiam pawl an khat. Mi phundang ih thlun mi daan an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An ram cu sui le ngun in a khatih an sumsaw cu cem ti a nei lo. An ram cu rang in a khatih an rangleng pawl cu siarcawk lo an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An ram cu milem in a khatih anmah ih kut ih an tuahcop mi an biak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An zate in hmuhsuam le nautat mi an si dingih ningzak le hmaisia in an um ding. Maw Bawipa , zohman ngaidam hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipaió thinhengnak ihsin luat dingah le a sunlawinak le a cahnak huham hrial duh ah leilung ah khur lai tahrat in an lut dingih tlangpar lungpuk sungah an relh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Milai ih hngalnak cu a cem dingih milai ih puarthaunak cu siatsuah ṭheh a si ni a thleng ding. Cule Bawipa lawnglawng cawi mawi a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cui ni ahcun Cungnungbik Bawipa in mi lianngan hmuahhmuah a niam ter ding; mihngal le mi puarthau hmuahhmuah a namthla ṭheh ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lebanon ih sidar thing sang zetzet pawl le Bashan ramih sasua kung hmuahhmuah cu a siatsuah ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tlang sang siseh, tlang niam siseh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ral vennak inn sang zetzet siseh khua kulhnak ralhruang sang zetzet siseh rualraan in a thlakcim ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A tumbik le a mawibik tipithuanthum ih feh thei Tarshish khua ih lawng pawl hman a pil ter ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Milai ih hngalnak le puarthaunak hmuahhmuah a cemter ṭheh ding. Cui ni ahcun Bawipa lawnglawng a saangbik ih cawimawi mi a si dingih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />milem hmuahhmuah khal an hloral ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leilungpi hnin dingih Bawipa a rat tikah cun a thinhengnak ihsin luat dingah le a sunlawinak le a cahnak huham hrial duh ah leilung lai tahrat in an lut dingih tlangpar ih lungpuk sungah an relh ciamco ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cui ni a thlen ngaingai tikah cun sui le ngun in an tuah mi milem pawl cu an tlansan dingih duum le palap hnenah an hlon ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Leilungpi hnin dingih Bawipa a ra thlen tikah cun a thinhengnak tlansan dingah le a sunlawinak le a cahnak huham hrialin tlangpar ih lei kua le lungpuk ah an relh ciamco ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Curuangah milai cu rinsan hlah uh. Rinsantlak an sinak ziangso a um?
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Atu ihsin Bawipa , Cungnungbik Bawipa in, minung ih rinsan bik mi milai siseh thilri siseh Jerusalem le Judah ihsin a lak ṭheh ding. An rinsan bik mi an rawl le an tidai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />an micak le an ralkap pawl, an thuṭhentu le an profet pawl, an thusim thiam le an kutzoh thiam pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />an ram uktu bawi le ralkap bawi pawl, an ram hruaitu pawl le mitkher thiam pawl a lak ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in an ram cu nauhak tualleng pawl a uk ter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah in anmah ih miatnak hrangah cun mihmaisong an neilo ding. Mino pawl in an upa pawl an upat lo dingih mi nauta pawl in an tlunih bawi pawl an hmaisong lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Caan a rathleng dingih innsang pakhat sungah an unau pakhat cu, “Nang cu hruk ding hnipuan tal na neih ruangah hi bangtuk kan harsat caan ah hin in hotubik si hram aw,” an ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asinain anih in, “Sihlah e, nan hotu ka si lo ding. Ka lo bawm thei lo ding. Ka inn sungah rawl a um lo, hnipuan khal a um lo. Nan hotu ah in tuah hlah uh,” a ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A si, Jerusalem cu a cem a si! Judah khal a sawn ruairo a si! Ziang hmuahhmuah an sim mi le an tuah mi cu Bawipaió duhlo zawng hlir an si. Langhngan in Pathian rori an hmuhsuam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi thleidan an neihnak cu an hrangah siatsuahtu a si ding. Sodom khua mi bangtuk in ningzah neiloin an sual. An cem a si; ci an tuh mi an khawm sal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Asinain miding pawl cu milungawi an si dingih an lamzin hmuahhmuah a tluang ding. An hlawhman cu lungawizet in an ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asinain miṭha lo pawl cu an cem a si; midang parih an tuah mi cu an parah a thleng sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka minung pawl cu tangka cawihtu pawl in an hremih tangka kilsaktu pawl in an bum a si. Maw ka minung pawl, nan hotu pawl in an lo hruaisual ih khuilam zawh ding ti nan thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa cu a minung pawl thurel dingah tim a tuah. A tim a tuah ṭheh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />an uktu pawl le an hotu pawl cu thurelnak hmunah a suahpi. An hnenah, “Mi sabit hmuan nan long ṭheh ih nan inn cu mi farah hnen ihsin nan lak mi thilri in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka minung palcih theinak le mi farah pawl ih covo lon theinak thu zianghman nan nei lo. Keimah Cungnungbik Bawipa in ka sim zo a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Jerusalem nunau pawl an hngalzia hi zohhnik uh. An puarthau tukah vantau eu-eu in an feh. Ningzah neiloin mipa par lawnglawngah an mit an meng. Duh awzet le zum awzet in an feh ih an ke ih an khih mi khiingte cu an awnter sulso.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ka hrem hai ding-an sam ka meet dingih lukolh in ka thlah ṭheh hai ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jerusalem nunau hnenih sin an uar bikmi hlawnthil pawl Bawipa ih a lonnak tikcu a ra thleng ding. An lu le an ke ih an thlaih mi khiingte, an hngawng le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />an kut ih an khih mi faute pawl a lak ṭheh ding. An hmai khuhnak puanpaate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />an lukhum pawl, an baan le an taai ih an khih mi ai-camnak an thlaih aw mi baan thlaih le taikhap pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />an kutzung ih an hruk mi zunghruk le an hnar ih an thlaih mi hnarthlaih pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />an hnipuan ṭhaṭha, an puan le an korfual le paisa bawm pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a paa zet mi an hnipuan pawl, an pavua pawl, an hngawngngerh pawl le an lukhuhnak puan paate sau zetzet pawl cu a long ṭheh ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zihmui an hmang nawn lo ding, an rim a siazet sawn ding; taikhap ṭhaṭha ai ah hridai siava an khap ding; sam mawizetzet ai ah an lu a kolh ṭheh ding; hnipuan mawizetzet ai ah puansia an hruk ding; an mawinak cu an ningzahnak ah a cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khawsung mipa pawl, micak bik pawl hman ral kutah an thi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khawpi kotka pawl an ṭap an rak ding. An khawpi cu hnipuan neilo leilung ih a to nunau bangtuk a si ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cui caan a kim tikah nunau pasarih in mipa pakhat an kai dingih, “Kanmah teón kan cawm aw ko ding; hnipuan tla in holh a ṭul lo ding; pasal nei theilo ih um ningzahnak ihsin kan luatnak ding ah kan pasal a si kan lo ti hram pei,” tiah an ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tikcu caan a rathleng dingih ramsung thingkung le rawlkung pawl cu Bawipa in a tum ter dingih a mawiter ding. Israel mi sungin a taangmi pawl in an ramih a suak mi rawl an hmuh tikah an thin a nuam dingih an mithmai a ṭha saal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem ih a taangmi, a nung dingah Pathian ih hrilmi pawl cu mithianghlim tiah kawh an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in a cahnak huham thawn thu a ṭhen dingih ram a thianter ding. Cun Jerusalem sualnak le thisen thletnak cu a kholhfai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Zion Tlang par le cutawkih a ra khawm mi pawl ih tlunah Bawipa in sun ah khawdur a umter dingih zanah meikhu le meisa tleu a umter ding. Pathian ih sunlawinak huham in khawpi pumpi cu a khuh dingih a hum ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipaió sunlawinak in khawpi cu sun nisatnak ihsin a hneem dingih ruah a sur ih thlipi a hran hmanah beunak le himnak hmun a si ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngaihnik uh, hla ka lo sak sak ding, Ka rualpa le a sabit hmuan hla cu: Ka rualpa in sabit hmuan a nei, Leilung ṭhazet tlangpar ram ṭhazet ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leilung a ceek ih lungto pawl a hrilfai ṭheh, Sabit kuang ṭhabik pawl a phun. Hmuan kilnak ah thlaam a sak ih, Sabit rialnak ah khur a lai. Cule sabit rah hmin ding a hngak, Asinain a sabit rah cu a zate in a thur thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka rualpa in, “Jerusalem le Judah ih a um mi pawl, ka sabit hmuan le keimah thu hi in ruat sak hnik uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka sabit hmuan hrangah ka tuah lo mi ziangso a um. Asinain ziangah so ka ruah vekih sabit rah thaw suak loin sabit rah thur a suah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka sabit hmuan parah hi bangtuk in ka tuah ding. A hauhruang ka bauhṭheh dingih a kulhnak ka bal ṭheh ding; ramsa in an duh le ei in palsiat ṭheh hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hrampi kho in khat ṭheh seh. Sabit kuang cu ka thianfai nawn lo dingih a thlawh khal ka thlo nawn lo ding. Hling le so khat ṭheh seh. Khawdur khal ruah surter hlah aw tiah ka kham ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel cu Cungnungbik Bawipaió ih sabit hmuan a si; Judah mi cu a ciin mi sabit kuang ṭhazet an si. Ṭhatnak an tuah ding tiah a zum; Asinain mi an that ih thisen an luangter. A dikmi an tuah ding tiah a zum; Asinain an ṭhatlonak a tuartu pawl an ṭap an ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nan cem a si! Inn le lo nan neih cia mi tlunah inn dang le lo dang na beet vivo. A rei hlanah zohrang hmanah hmun le ram a um nawn lo dingih ram sungah nanmah lawng nan um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in, “Hi inn tumpipi le inn mawizetzet hi a lawng ṭheh dingih a siat ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Rawl han nga hmuan ih ciin mi sabit in sabitti cuai hnih lawng a suah ding. Thlaici han hra tuh mi in rawl han khat lawng a suah ding,” a ti mi ka thei zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nan cem a si! Zingpit nan thawh vete in zu nan in ih zu nan rit ruangah zanlam tlaipi tiang nan meng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nan puai caanah ṭingṭang le khuang le phirivau nan tum ih le sabit zu thawn nan ciah aw. Asinain Bawipaió in ziang a tuah ti nan thei thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Curuangah sal kaih mi ah nan cang ding. Nan hotu pawl rawl loin an thi dingih mi zaaraan pawl cu tihal in an thi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mithi khua in a pum a puar zo, a khop zo ti a nei lo; a kaa kau zetin a aang ringring. Jerusalem ih bawi le upa pawl khal a au a khuangih a hnok ceelceel mi mizaraan pawl thawn hmun khatah a dolh hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zozo khal an ning a zak dingih mi puarthau pawl hmuahhmuah ṭhum ṭheh an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asinain Cungnungbik Bawipa in a cahnak huham a langter dingih a hman mi a tuah ding, a thianhlimnak cu a minung pawl thu a ṭhennak parah a langter ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A siat ṭheh mi khawpi sungah cun tuu pawl in hrampi an ei dingih me pawl in tlimno an ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nan cem a si! Nan sualnak ihsin nan luat suak thei nawn lo a si hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“ Bawipa in ka tuah ding a ti mi cu zamrangin tuah sehla kan zohhnik pei cu. Israel ih Pathian thianghlim in a saduhthah cu tuah suak hnik seh; a ruah mi le a tumtah mi pawl cu hmu hnik uhsi!” nan ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nan cem a si! Thilṭha lo cu thilṭha nan ti ih thilṭha cu thilṭha lo nan ti. Thimnak cu tleunak ah nan cangter ih tleunak cu thimnak ah nan cangter. A khaa mi cu a thlum ah nan tuah ih a thlum cu a khaa ah nan tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nan cem a si! Kan fim, kan fim ngaingai tiah nan ruat aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nan cem a si! Zu palang lamah micak pawl! Zu a phun phun rawi lamah cun ralṭha le ṭih neilo pawl nan si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Asinain nawhthuh an lo pek ahcun mi mawh khal nan thlah hluahhlo ih mawh neilo sawn cu a thu nan theihsak lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Curuangah fangcang kungro le hrampi caar cu meisa in a huul ih a kaang ṭheh vekin nan hram pawl an muat dingih nan par mawi pawl an vuai dingih thli in a semhlo ṭheh ding; ziangahtile Israel ih Pathian thianghlim, Cungnungbik Bawipa ih in zirh mi nan hnong a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A minung pawl parah Bawipa cu a thin a hengih hrem dingah a kut a khai zo. Tlang pawl an hnin ṭheh dingih a thi mi pawl ih ruak cu hnawmhne bangin lamzin ah an ril teptep ding. Cui hnu hmanah Bawipaió thinhengnak cu a reh hrih lo dingih hrem dingah a kut a khai hrih ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bawipa in lamhlapi ih a um mi miphun khat ko dingah theihthiamnak a langter. Vanhram deng ihsin ra dingah hurhuuk in a ko. An ra ngaingai ih zamrangzet in an ra thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An lakah a baang mi pakhat hman an um lo; pakhat hman a bah mi an um lo. An it lo, an sing fawn lo. An taikhap pakhat te hman a dor loih an kedam hri pakhat te hman a cat lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An conkiang pawl cu an hriam ngaingai; an li cu sai mai dingih nawp cia an si. An rang tin pawl cu ṭeeklung vekin an hak ih an rangleng ke pawl cu phusiing bangin an herh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An ralkap pawl cu kiosa in sa an deh ih zohman lon thei lo dingah an tlanpi ih an ai an kio bangin an thawm a ring a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cui ni a thlen tikah tifinriat awn vekin Israel tlunah an awn an au ding. Hi ram hi zohhnik uh. Thimnak le oloksongnak lawng a um. Tleunak cu thimnak in a dolh a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siangpahrang Uzziah a thih kum ah Bawipa ka hmu. A siangpahrang tokham parah sunglawi le huham neizet in a to ih a sunlawinak puan cu Biakinn sung a khat ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kimvel ah meisa alh bangtuk serafim vancungmi an um ih thla paruk ciar an nei. Thla pahnih in an hmai an khuh aw; a dang pahnih in an ruangpi an khuh aw ih a dang pahnih in an zuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pakhat le pakhat an ko aw ih: “Thianghlim, thianghlim, thianghlim! Cungnungbik Bawi cu a thianghlim! A sunlawinak cu leilung ah a khat a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An aw thawm cu a thang tukih Biakinn hram tiangin a hnin ṭheh. Cule Biakinn cu meikhu in a khat ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah kei in, “Ka cem a si! Ka ruahsan ding zianghman a um nawn lo. Ka hmur ihsin a suak mi ṭongkam hmuahhmuah cu a sualmi ṭongkam a si ṭheh; misual lakah ka um ih hmurka thianglo lakah ka leeng. Atu ah ka mit rori in siangpahrang, cungnungbik Bawipa ka hmu fawn,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun serafim pakhat cu biakṭheng ih meiling kha caiceh in a cep ih cumi kengin ka hnenah a rung zuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cui meiling cun ka hmur a run dai ih, “Zohhnik, na hmur a dai zo; atu ihsin na mawhnak a hlo ṭheh ih na sualnak cu ngaidam a si zo,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in, “Zoso ka thlah ding? Zosi kan palai a si ding?” a ti ka thei. Cutikah kei in, “Keimah ka feh ding! I thlah aw!” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule anih in, “Va feh awla hi minung pawl hnenah: ‘Ziangtluk ih nan ngai hmanah nan thei lo ding. Ziangtluk ih nan zoh hmanah nan hmu lo ding,’ ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi minung pawl ih thinlung hi mol ter awla an hna khal seet ter in an mit tla caw ter aw; cuticun hmu hlah hai seh, thei hlah hai seh, theithiam hlah hai seh. An hmuh ih, an thei ih an theihthiam a si ahcun ka lamah an hoikir dingih an dam pang ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah kei in, “ Bawipa , cuticun ziangtik tiangso a si ding?” ka ti. Anih in, “Khawpi pawl siatsuah ṭheh an si ih an ṭhing reprep tiang; zozo khalin an inn an tlansan ṭheh tiang; hi ram hi an ṭiosan ih a ṭhin reprep tiang a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi minung pawl hi lamhlapi ah ka kuat hai dingih an ram cu ramṭhing ah a cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Minung pahra sungah pakhat hi ram sungih a taan hmanah anih khal cu siatsuah cih a si thotho ding; amah cu an hau cia mi sasua kung sumhmui bangtuk a si ding,” a ti. (Sumhmui cu Pathian ih minung pawl hramthawhnak thar tican a si.)
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uzziah fapa Jotham ih fapa siangpahrang Ahaz in Judah ram a uk laiah raldonak a suak. Siria siangpahrang Rezin le Israel siangpahrang Pekah, Remaliah fapa, in Jerusalem an do; a sinan an lak thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siria ralkap pawl Israel ram an thleng zo ti kha Judah siangpahrang in a theih tikah amah le a minung pawl cu an thin a phang tukih thli in thingkung a sem vekin an hnin an ṭhia ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in Isaiah hnenah, “Na fapa Shear Jashub hruai awla siangpahrang Ahaz tong dingah feh uh. Siangpahrang cu tlunta ticawm ihsin tidai a rung luannak tihriat netnak ih hnipuan taktu pawl hnaṭuannak lamzin ah nan tong ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nan ton tikah amah cu ralring te in, hnangamzet in, thinphang lo le ṭih lo te ih um dingah sim uh. Siangpahrang Rezin le a ralkap pawl le siangpahrang Pekah thinhengnak cu ṭih ding a um nawn lo; a mit zik rero mi thingthu pahnih ih meikhu tluk hman a si nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siria le Israel mi le an siangpahrang thawn an lo phiar a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah do an tum; Judah mi pawl cu an hnenih ṭang dingin an hro dingih Tabeel fapa cu siangpahrang canter an tum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Keimah Bawipa in cuti ih cang lo dingin ka than zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ziangahtile Siria cu Damaskas khua hnakin a cak sawn cuanglo ih Damaskas cu siangpahrang Rezin hnak khalin a cak sawn cuang fawn lo. Israel ram thu kan sim asile atu ihsin hmailam kum sawm ruk le kum nga sungah Israel cu a kuai ṭheh dingih ram ramkhat ti tlak hman a um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel ram cu Samaria khua hnakin a cak sawn cuanglo ih Samaria khal cu siangpahrang Pekah hnakin a cak sawn cuang fawn lo. Nan zumnak a cak lo asile rei nan awh lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa cun Ahaz hnenah a sim sal ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“ Bawipa na Pathian hnenih sin khihhmuhnak dil aw. A thukbik mithi khua ihsin siseh, a saangbik vancung khalin siseh dil aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahaz in, “Khihhmuhnak ka lo dil ding. Bawipa cu ka hniksak lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah Isaiah in, “Maw siangpahrang David tefa sin pawl, ngaihnik uh. Minung thin nan cemter zo ih a poizet a si; atu ah Pathian thin nan cemter duh lala maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Atu ah Bawipa amah rori in khihmuhhnak a lo pe ding. Nunau no pakhat in fa a vun ih fapa a hring dingih a hminah Immanuel tiah an sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hung upat ih a ṭha le a sia thleidan a thiam tikah a rawl ei mi cu cawhnawi le khuaitizu a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cui caan a thlen hlanah nan ṭihzet mi siangpahrang pahnih ih ram cu a ṭhing reprep ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Israel le Judah nan ṭhen awk hnuah ziangtik hman ih nan ton dah lo mi harsatnak cu Bawipa in nangmah le na sungkhat le na miphun parah a thlenter ding - Assiria siangpahrang a thlenter ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Cui caan a thlen tikah Bawipa in Izipt mi pawl cu Nail tiva hna a hlatnak bik khalin thothe vekin ra zuang dingah le Assiria mi pawl cu an ram in khuai vekih ra zuang dingah kuai in a ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An ra dingih horkuam kip, lungpuk kip, hling le so lak le ṭilva tlannak ram kip ah an khat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cui caan a thlen tikah Bawipa in Assiria siangpahrang cu nan lu meettu dingah Zufrates tiva raal ihsin a ko dingih nan khahmul, nan lupar sam le nan taksa par hmul hmuahhmuah a meet ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Cui caan a thlen tikah lothlo pa pakhat in cawla pakhat le me pahnih a neih hmanah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />an hnawi a tamzet dingih a hai mi a daih ṭheh ding. A si, ram sungih a taangmi hmuahhmuah in ei dingah cawhnawi le khuaitizu an nei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Cui caan a thlen tikah sabit hmuan ṭhazet, sabit kuang thawngkhat a um mi, hmuan pakhat ih tangka thawngkhat man cu hling le so in a khat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Li le thal thawn minung ramtawihnak hmunah a cang ding. A si, ram pumpuluk cu hling le so in a khat ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rawl an rak ciinnak tlangpar pawl cu hlingkung a kho ṭheh dingih zohman an feh lo ding. Caw le tuu tlannak ramah a cang ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in ka hnenah, “Cangannak ah lungpheng tumpi pakhat la awla misenpi theih thei dingin: ‘Zamrang-lon-zamrang-laak,’ tiah ngan aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rintlak minung pahnih-puithiam Uriah le Jeberekhiah fapa Zekhariah cu theihpitu ah sawm hai aw,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cui hnuah ka nupi thawn kan ittlang ih fa a vun ih fapa a nei. Cutikah Bawipa in, “A hmin ah ‘Zamrang-lon-zamrang-laak,’ tiah ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Naute in, ‘Nunu, Papa,’ tihman a thiam hlanah Damaskas ih lennak thilri le sumsaw hmuahhmuah le Samaria ih ral lon thilri hmuahhmuah cu Assiria siangpahrang in a lak ṭheh ding a si,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Bawipaió cu ka hnenah a ṭong saal ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Hi minung pawl in daiteih a luangmi Shiloah Tiva tidai an hnong ih siangpahrang Rezin le siangpahrang Pekah hmaiah khur rero ih an um ruangah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa Keimah rori in Assiria siangpahrang le a ralkap pawl cu Judah do dingah ka hruai ding. Zufrates tiva a len ih a kap hmuahhmuah a liam thluh bangin an ra ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah ram sungah tilik bangin an rung dingih liang an tiang dingih ziang hmuahhmuah an khuh ṭheh ding,” a ti. Pathian kan hnenah a um. A thla a pharh ih kan ram cu a hum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw ramkip le phunkip tla, thinphang in hmun khatah tongkhawm aw uh. Ngai uh, lamhlapi ih a um mi pawl tla raldo dingah nan timtuah uh; a sinan ṭih uh. A si, nan timtuah ṭheh uh; a sinan phang uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tumtahnak cu nei ko uh. Zianghman hlawhtlinnak nan nei cuanglo ding. Nan duhzat in ṭong uh; a lak hlir an si ding, ziangahtile Pathian kan hnenah a um a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Misenpi pawl ih thlun mi lamzin thlun lo dingah Bawipa in a huham nasazet thawn ralrinnak i peek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“An tumtah mi ah tel ve hlah awla an ṭih mi kha ṭih ve hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa Keimah lawng a thianghlim mi ka si kha ciing ṭha aw. Keimah lawnglawng na ṭih ding mi cu ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka thianhlimnak mangbangza a si ruangah keimah cu an bahnak lungto bangtuk ka si. Keimah cu Judah ram le Israel ramih misenpi le Jerusalem khawsungmi pawl a awk tu ding thang bangtuk ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi tampi an bah ding. An tlu dingih an kiak an kuai ṭheh ding. Thang in a awk ding,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nannih ka dung i thluntu pawl, Bawipa in ka hnenih a sim mi thu pawl a kilkhawitu le a nung tertu ding nan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa cu a minung pawl ih hmuh lo dingin a thup aw; a sinan kei cun amah ka rinsan ih ka ruahsannak cu amah hnenah ka ret a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hitawk ah hin Bawipa in i pek mi faate pawl thawn kan um. Cungnungbik Bawipaió tokham cu Zion Tlang ah a um ih kanmah tla hi Israel mi pawl hnenah khihhmuhnak ah in thlah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi tampi in pol le kut ṭial zohthiam pawl, a phun a tlok rero tu pawl, leeng ding le thuron dingah an lo fial ding. “A nungmi pawl can ai-ah a thi mi pawl thusuh ding le mithi thlarau pawl thuron ding cu a ṭha ko sokhaw,” an lo ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cuti an ti tikah nannih in, “ Bawipa ih a lo zirh mi hi ngai sawn uh. Pol thu cu ngai hlah uh. An lo sim mi cu nan hrangah ṭhathnemnak zianghman a nei lo ding,” nan ti pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An rilrawng le an thinheng in an siangpahrang le an Pathian tiangin an cam ding. Van an zoh ding,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />leilung khal an zoh ding; a sinan harnak le thimnak siar lo a dang zianghman an hmu lo ding. Cui ṭihnungza thimnak sungah cun an lut cuahco a si. Hi harsatnak caan sungih sin an luatnak ding lamzin a um lo ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zebulun miphun le Naftali miphun pawl ram cu ningzak in a rak um zo; a sinan hmailamah hi ram cu ram sunglawi ah a cang ding. Mediterranean ihsin nisuahnak lamah Jordan khatlam ral tiang, cule ramdang mi umnak Galilee tiang ram sunglawi ah a cang ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khawthim lakih a feh mi pawl in a nasazet mi tleunak an hmu zo; Thladem ramih a um mi pawl parah tleunak a thleng zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , lungawinak tumpi na pek hai; An thin na nuamter zo a si. Na hnaṭuan mi parah an lung a awi ngaingai; Mi in rawl an lak caan ih an lung a awi bangtuk le, raal lon mi thilri an zem awk caan bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An thilrit phurhnak hnamhri cu na saat cat zo; An liang parih kawn khal na khiak ṭheh zo. Maw Bawipa , na minung pawl a hrem tu le a hmuhsuam tu cu na neh zo. Hlanlaipi ih Midian ralkap na neh zo vekin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na minung dotu pawl ih kedam le thisen hnih mi an hnipuan pawl hmuahhmuah cu meisa in ur ṭheh an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan hnenah naute a suak zo; Kan hrangah fapa peek a si zo; Amah cu in uktu a si ding. Amah cu “Mangbangza Remruattu,” “A cakmi Pathian,” “Kumkhua ih Pa,” “Daihnak Siangpahrang,” tiah kawh a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A siangpahrang uknak le huham cu a ṭhangso vivo ding; A uknak sungah kumkhua in daihnak a um ding. Siangpahrang David ai ah a uk ding; Dingnak le thuhman thawn a uk dingih atu le kumkhua in a uk ding a si. Cungnungbik Bawipa in hi hmuahhmuah a tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel uknak le Jakob tefa sin parah thuṭhennak a peek zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi thu cu Israel mi hmuahhmuah le Samaria khawpi ih a um hmuahhmuah in an thei ding. Atu ahcun hngalzet le puarthau zetin an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Annih in, “Tlakrawh inn pawl an cim ṭheh zo; a sinan lungto inn kan sak saal ko ding. Theipi kungih tuah mi kaan an tan ṭheh; a sinan sidar thing ṭhabik in kan sak saal pam ding,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cui ruangah Bawipa in an raal pawl cu raltho dingah le anmah do dingah a forh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nisuahnak lamah Siria le nitlaknak lamah Filistin mi pawl cun Israel dolh ṭheh dingah an kaa an ang! Cu hmanah Bawipaió thinhengnak cu a reh hrih lo; a kut cu mihrem dingah khai cia in a um lai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel mi pawl an sual an siir aw hrih lo; Cungnungbik Bawipa in daan a tat naan amah an pan duh cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ni ni khat sungah Bawipa in Israel hotu pawl le misenpi pawl cu a hrem ding; an lu le an mei a saat tan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi upa le upat tlak pawl cu lu an si; thuphan lawnglawng mizirhtu profet pawl cu a mei an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himi pawl hruaitu pawl in an hruaisual ih an buai ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cui ruangah Bawipa in an mino pawl cu pakhat hman a luat ter lo ding; an nuhmei le nu pa neilo pawl hnen khalah zaangfahnak a neilo ding; ziangahtile hi minung pawl hi Pathian theilo le miṭha lo hlir an si ih, an sim mi thu cu thu ṭha lo hlir a si. Cui hnu hmanah Bawipaió thinhengnak cu a dai hrih lo; hrem dingah a kut cu khai cia in a um lai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Himi pawl ih ṭhatlonak cu hling le so a kaang ṭheh tu meisa bangin a alh rero lai a si. Hrampi le tusung thing tiangin a kaangih a khu cu dum zetin vanah a kai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa a thin a heng ruangah a thinhengnak cu an ram sungah meisa bangin a kaangih minung pawl cu tih mi thing vekah an cang. Zokhal mah hrang hlir ah an nung; unau dontu pakhat hman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rawl an hmuh mi pohpoh cu an zon hnawh ih an ei; a sinan an rilrawn a reh cuang lo. An sungsuak an faate tiangin an ei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Manasseh mi le Efraim mi an do aw; an pahnih an ṭangkhawm ih Judah an do. Cui hnu khalah Bawipaió thinhengnak cu a dai hrih lo; hrem dingah a kut cu khai cia in a um lai a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nan cem riai a si! Ka minung pawl hrem duh ah a dinglo mi daan nan tuah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mifarah le mi zonzai pawl in an covo an co loih an thu nan theihsak lo. Cuticun nuhmei le nu pa neilo farah pawl ih thilri pawl nan long a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian in a lo hrem tikah ziangso nan tuah ding? Nan parah lam hlatpi ihsin harsatnak a rathlen tikah ziangtinso nan um ding? Bomnak hawl in zohnen ah so nan tlan ding? Nan thilri le nan lennak pawl hi khui ah so nan thuh ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Raldonak ah nan thi ding; a si lole an lo kai dingih an lo hruaihlo ding a si. Cui hnu hmanah Bawipaió thinhengnak cu a dai hrih lo; hrem dingah a kut cu khai cia in a um lai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ka thin i heng tertu pawl thawinak ih ka hman mi talhtum cu Assiria a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka thin ai a thok tertu, Pathian ṭihzah lotu pawl do dingah Assiria ka thlah a si. An thilri long dingah le an minung pawl lamzin hnawmhne bangih palcih dingah ka thlah a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asinain Assiria siangpahrang in mi thisen luannak ding tumtahnak a rak nei ve. Ram tampi siatsuah ding a tum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tluang a khawngih, “Ka ralkap hotu ralbawi pawl cu siangpahrang an si ṭheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kalno le Karkhemish khua pawl ka neh. Hamath le Arpad khua pawl tla ka neh fawn. Samaria le Damaskas khawpi pawl tla ka lak zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Milem a biatu ram pawl daantattu dingah ka kut ka hawi zo; an milem pawl cu Jerusalem le Samaria ih milem hnakin an tam sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Samaria le a milem pawl ka siatsuah thluh zo bangtuk in Jerusalem khua le cutawkih an biak mi milem pawl cu ka siatsuah ṭheh ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Bawipa in, “Zion Tlang le Jerusalem parih ka tuah mi pawl ka ṭheh tikah Assiria siangpahrang khal cu a tluangkhawn le a puarthau ruangah daan ka tat ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Assiria siangpahrang in, “Keimaió tuah ṭheh mi a si! Ka cak, ka fim ih theihthiamnak ka nei a si. Ramkhat le ramkhat karlak ramri pawl cu ka siat ṭheh ih an rawl khawl mi pawl cu ka lak ṭheh. Cawcang bangin, cutawkih a um mi pawl cu ka palbeek ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Leilung tlunih ram pawl cu vate bu vek an si ih an lennak le an sumsaw pawl cu vate ti kan laak vekin olte in ka laak a si. Keimah dawi dingah, thla khawng ngamtu zohman an um lo. Ka aang ngamtu khal an um lo,” tiah tluang a khawng ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa cun, “Hreitlung in a hmangtu hnakin ka tum sawn, a ti thei pei maw? Hluah in thing attu hnakin ka thupi sawn, a ti pei maw? Talhtum in minung a keng lo; minung in talhtum a keng a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in atu rawlkhop ih a nungmi pawl hi hrem dingah natnak a thlengter ding. An taksa ruangpi sungah natnak cu meisa kang bangin a kaang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian amah, Israel ih tleunak cu meisa ah a cang ding. Israel ih Pathian thianghlim cu mei-alh ah a cang dingih ni ni khat sungah ziang hmuahhmuah, hling le so tiangin, a kaang ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tupi ruul zetzet le loram ṭhaṭha pawl cu natsia in milai a siatsuah bangin a siatsuah thluh ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thingkung a taangmi tla a malzet dingih nauhak tualleng hmanin a siar thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel mi pawl sungin a taangmi mi malte in anmah a siatsuahtu ram rinsan nawn loin Israel ih Pathian thianghlim Bawipa sawn an rinsan tikcu caan a thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel mi sungin mi malte cu a cak mi an Pathian hnenah an kir saal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Atu ahhin Israel mi cu Tifinriat kapih vunnel zat in an tam naan a kirsal mi cu mi malte an si ding. Mi tam sawn hrangah cun hlohralnak cu retsak cia a si ih an ton ding hrimhrim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A si, hi ram pumpi sungah Cungnungbik Bawipa in a sim cia vekin, siatsuahnak a thlengter ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in Zion ih a um mi a minung pawl hnenah, “Izipt mi in nan parih an rak tuah zo vekin Assiria mi khalin an lo hrem ih nan tuarzet naan ṭih hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Reilote ah nan parih hremnak ka thlenter mi cu ka reh ter dingih anmah sawn ka siatsuah thlang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Oreb Lungpi ih Midian mi pawl ka rak vuak bangtuk in Cungnungbik Bawipa Keimah in ka fungin ka vuak hai ding. Izipt mi ka tuarter zo bangin Assiria mi pawl ka tuarter ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cui caan a thlen tikah cun a cak mi Assiria kut sungih sin ka lo suah dingih an kawn cu nan hngawng ah thilrit a si nawnlo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ral pawl in Ai khua an lak. Migron an lan zo. An rawl cu Mikmash ah an ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cui tlangkawn an run tan ih Geba ah an riak. Ramah khua mi pawl cu an thin a phangzet. Siangpahrang Saul ih khua Gibeah khua mi pawl cu an tlanhlo ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Gallim mi pawl au hnik uh! Laishah mi pawl ngai hnik uh! Anathoth mi pawl in sawn hnik uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Madmenah le Gebim khua mi pawl cu thih ṭih ah an tlan ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuihsun ah ral cu Nob khua ah an um ih Zion Tlang le Jerusalem khawpi lamah an kut tum an hawi ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in thinghnge thlak mi bangin a thlak hai ding. Anmah lakih a puarthau bik le a saangbik khal cu saattan mi le namthlak mi a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tupi laifangih thing pawl tla hreitlung ih an hau vekin le Lebanon ih thing ṭhabik tla an thluk vekin Bawipa in anmah tla cu a thluk ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David le a tefa sin pawl ih siangpahrang an ṭuannak cu hau mi thingkung bangtuk a si. Asinain thingbul in hnge dang a cerh saal ṭheu bangtuk in David tefa sin sung ihsin siangpahrang a thar a suak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipaió thlarau in fimnak a pe ding; A mi pawl uk thiamnak le theihthiamnak a pe ding. Bawipaió duhnak cu a theithiam dingih a ṭih ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipaió hnaṭuan kha a lungawinak a si ding. Mit zohnak le mi simnak men in thu a ṭhen lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi farah pawl thu cu ṭhatein a ṭhensak dingih, Bawmtu neilo pawl an covo a hum sak ding. A thupeknak vekin minung cu hrem an si dingih, Mi ṭha lo pawl cu thah an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dingnak le felnak thawn a minung pawl a uk ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cinghnia le tuu an um tlaang dingih, Tlavang le me te an bok tlaang ding. Caw faate le kiosa faate rawl an ei tlaang dingih Nauhak in an kilkhawi hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Caw le savom rawl an ei tlaang dingih An faate pawl cu an bok tlaang ding. Caw bangin kiosa in fangkuang ro a ei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Naute khal tuahmawhnak a tong lo ding, Rul tur nei kiangih a lek rero hmanah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian tlang thianghlim Zion ahcun, Tuahmawhnak le ṭhatlonak zianghman a um lo ding. Ziangahtile tifinriat ih tidai a khah vekin Leilung cu Bawipa theihnak in a khat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cui ni ah David tefa sin sung ihsin siangpahrang a thar a suak dingih miphun tampi hrangah khihhmuhnak a si ding. A khawpi sungah an tongkhawm aw dingih upatnak an pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cui ni a thlen tikah cun Bawipa in a huham a langter saal dingih, Assiria ram, Izipt ram, Pathros ram, Sudan ram, Elam ram, Babilonia le Hamath ram le tipikap ram le tidai ih kulh mi ram pawl ihsin a taang hrih mi a mi pawl cu a khawm saal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in a thantaar a khaisaang dingih Israel le Judah mi, ṭhekdarh a si mi pawl cu leilung killi ihsin ka khawmsaal ding, ti langternak ah miphun tampi hnenah a hmuh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel ram in Judah cu a halhsik nawn lo dingih Judah cu Israel ral a si nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmun khat ah an ṭang tlaang dingih nitlaknak lamah Filistin le nisuahnak lamih a um mi pawl an do ding. Edom mi le Moab mi pawl an neh dingih Ammon mi pawl in an thu an ngai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa in Suez tidai kel cu a kangter dingih Zufratis tiva kangter dingah thli sa a hrangter dingih tivate pasarih lawng a zuah ding; cuticun zokhal in an tan thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Izipt ram ihsin an pupa pawl suahnak hrangih lamzinpi a rak um vek khan Assiria ram ihsin cutawkih a nungdam sun a minung Israel mi pawl hrangah misenpi suahnak lamzin a um ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cui ni a thlen tikah senpi in: “Maw Bawipa , nangmah ka lo thangṭhat; Ka parah na thin a rak heng naan Atu ahcun i hneem ih na thin a heng nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian cu i Runtu a si; Amah ka rinsan dingih ka phang lo ding. Bawipa in huham le thazaang i pek; Amah cu i Runtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tihal mi hrangah ti thiangte cu An lungawinak a si bangin, Pathian ih minung hrangah a runnak cu An lungawinak a si,” tiah hla an sa ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cui ni a thlen tikah misenpi in: “ Bawipaió hnenah lungawinak thu sim uh; A lo bawmtu dingah amah ko uh. Miphun hmuahhmuah hnenah a tuah mi sim uh; A natsat zia than uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipaió hnenah hla sa uh! Mangbangza thil tampi a tuah zo a si. Cui thuthang cu leilung pumpi in thei seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion ih a um mi hmuahhmuah in Hla sa hai sehla au hai seh. Israel ih Pathian thianghlim cu amak a si; A minung pawl hnenah a um,” tiah hla an sa ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon ih thu ah Pathian ṭong a ra mi Amoz fapa Isaiah in a theih mi cu hiti in a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tlangpar phul ahcun raldonak thantaar thlai uh! A puarthau mi khawpi kotka pawl do dingah nan ralkap pawl hnenah napi in au uhla do thlang uh tinak ah nan kut hawi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipaió hmaihngalnak a co tu le in a porh aw zet mi a ralkap pawl cu do awknak thianghlim ih ral do dingah le a thinheng tertu pawl hrem dingah a ko zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tlangpar ihsin a thang mi thawmvang cu ngaihnik uh! Misenpi awn-au thawng, ram tampi le miphun tampi an tonkhawmnak thawmvang cu! Ralkap tampi ih Bawipa in a ralkap pawl cu raldo dingah a tiarter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ralkap pawl cu lamhlapi vanhramdeng ihsin an ra. A thinheng in hi ram pumpi cu Bawipa in a siatsuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ṭap ai uh! Bawipaió ni cu a nai zo; Cungnungbik in siatsuahnak a thlenter ding ni a ra thleng zik thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah ih kut cu thacem in a zawng thluahthlo dingih an thinlung tla a der ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ṭihphannak le tuksumnak in an khat dingih naute neih zikih nunau nat bangin thinharnak le natnak in a ciah hai ding. Ṭihnak in pakhat le pakhat an zoh aw dingih ningzahnak in an hmai cu a sen ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipaió ni cu a rathleng zik thlang, Bawipaió thinheng ni le aithok ni cu! Leilung pumpi hi ramṭhing ah a cang dingih misual hmuahhmuah cu an hloral ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Van arsi le arsi burpi khal an tleu lo ding; ni a suah tikah a thim dingih thlapi khal a vang lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Leilung pumpi parah thih hlohnak poimawh ka thlengter dingih mi ṭha lo pawl cu an sualnak ruangah ka hrem ding. Mi hngal pawl cu ka vuakdai hai dingih mi puarthau le zaangfah neilo pawl cu ka hrem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A nungdam sun cu sui hnakin an mal sawn ding
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa Keimah in ka thinhengnak ka langter ni ahcun van khi ka hnin ṭheh dingih leilung tla a umnak ihsin phong ko in a khur ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Babilon ih a um mi ramdangmi pawl cu an khua le an ram ciarah an tlan dingih khaaltu neilo tuu bangtuk in le ramtawi pawl hmai ihsin sakhi a tlan vekin an tlanhlo ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zokhal sisehla kaih ngah mi poh cu ralnam in sunthat le sahthat a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An mithmuh rori ah an naute pawl cu sop ṭheh in an vuak that ding; an innsung thilri an lak dingih an nupi pawl kaihrem in an sualpi ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in, “Babilon do dingah Median mi pawl ka forh. Anmah tla cu sui a duh lomi le ngun a poisa lomi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An li le an thal thawn mino an that ding. Naute parah siseh, tleirawl parah siseh zaangfahnak zianghman an neilo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Babilon ram cu ram mawibik a si; an ram minung pawl in an porh bik mi ram a si. Sikhalsehla Bawipa Keimah in Sodom le Gomorrah ka siatsuah vekin ka siatsuah thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Babilon ah zohman an um duh nawn lo ding. Hmunkhat ihsin hmun dangih a ceer ringringtu Arab mi tla in an puanthlam an sak duh lo dingih tuukhal pawl khal in an tuu an khal duh lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nelrawn ramsa umnak hmun ah a cang dingih sumbuh bu saknak hmunah a cang ding. Cutawkah saam-ar an um dingih zaathar pawl an pet an zuang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ralvennak inn le siangpahrang inn pawl ah cinghnia le kawlkei an bo ceelceel ding. Babilon ih tikcu caan a cem zikte thlang; rei a awh nawn lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung Israel mi pawl parah zaangfah thinpemnak a nei saal dingih amai minung ah a hril saal ding. Anmaió ramah a umter saal dingih an hnenah ramdangmi tla an um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih a pek mi an ram ih an kir tikah miphun tampi in Israel mi cu an bawm ding. Cule miphun tampi in Israel an rian ding. Israel mi sal ih a rak kaitu pawl cu Israel in sal ah an kai dingih, anmah a rak hremtu pawl cu Israel in a uk ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel mi pawl cu an zonzaihnak, an tuarnak le an hnaṭuankhung ihsin a cawl ter dingih awllen caan a tuahsak hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cui ni a thlen tikah Babilon siangpahrang cu an hnihsan dingih, “Mi zaangfah neilo siangpahrang a tla zo! Zohman a hrem thei nawnlo ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An neh mi le an lak mi ram minung pawl cat loih a hmuhsuam tu le thinheng in a hremtu siangpahrang siava pawl cu an thilti theinak le an huham thawn a cemter ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Atu cun leilung pumpuluk ah daihnak le hnangamnak a um dingih zozo khal lungawi sopar te in hla an sa ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi siangpahrang a tlak zo ruangah Lebanon ramih farthing le sidar thing pawl cu an ai a puang ding, ziangahtile anmah hautu siangpahrang a um nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Babilon siangpahrang hmuak dingah mithi khua cu a ralring. Leilung tlun an nunlai ih upa a rak si mi pawl ih thlarau cu an timlaam aw ih, siangpahrang pawl ih thlarau cu an tokham ihsin an tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An zate in an au ih, ‘Atu cun kanmah vekin na ṭawnṭai ve thlang! Kanmah vek thotho na sihi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ṭingṭang awn-mawi thawn an lo hmuak ṭheu mi cu atu ahcun mithi khua Sheol na thleng ve a sihi! Tholung cu na ihkhun ah an cangih na puan sin mi khal tholung thotho an sihi!’ tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Babilon siangpahrang, deirel arsi, nang cu van ihsin na tla zo! Tuihlan ahcun ram tampi na neh, atu ahcun leilungah vuakthlak na si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Van ah kai na tum ih a saangbik arsi tlunah na tokham ret na tum. Khuavang pawl an tokhawmnak saklam tlang parah siangpahrang bangtuk ih to ding na rak ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khawdur tlunah ka kai dingih Cungnungbik bangtuk ka si ding, na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asinain a thuknak bik hmun mithi khua ah dirhthlak na si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mithi pawl in ṭhep lo le aang loin an lo zoh dingih, “Leilung tlun a hnin ṭheh tu le ram tampi a khur tertu cu hi pa hi maw a si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khua tampi a siatsuahtu le leilungtlun ramṭhing ih a cangtertu cu amah hi maw a si? A salkaihmi a thlah dah lotu le an inn ih tlunter a sianglotu cu amah hi maw a si?” tiah an ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Leilung tlun siangpahrang hmuahhmuah cu a ṭhazet le a mawizet mi thlaan ah phum an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a sinan nang cu thlaan na nei loih na ruak cu a thu dingah hlonlak mi a si. Ral ih an thah mi ralkap pawl ruak thawn hmun khatah lungkua sungih hlon mi na si ih palcih rero mi na si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na ram na siatsuah ih na minung pawl na thah ruangah siangpahrang dang bangtuk in sunglawi ih phum na tong lo a si. Miṭha lo sung, na sungkhat pawl zohman an nung lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />That ṭheh hai uh! Hi siangpahrang ih fapa pawl cu an pu le an pa pawl ih sualnak ruangah an thi ding. Anmaió sung zohman in leilungtlun ah mi uktu an canglo dingih khua dintu khal an um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in, “Babilon ka do dingih ka siatsuah ṭheh ding. Ka zuah mi zianghman a um lo ding-nauhak khal ka zuah lo ding; zohman an luat lo ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Babilon cu cirhduup ah ka cangter dingih cutawkah sumbuh an um ding. Babilon cu siatsuahnak hmunphiah in ka phiat dingih ziang hmuahhmuah a phiat hlo ṭheh ding. Cungnungbik Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in siat a serh ih, “Ka khuakhan mi cu a kim ding. Ka tum mi hmuahhmuah cu tuah ṭheh a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka ta a si mi Israel ram sungih Assiria mi pawl cu ka siatsuah dingih ka tlang parah ka palbeek hai ding. Ka minung pawl ih phurh mi Assiria kawn cu ka hlih sak dingih an thilrit cu ka ṭhum sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cumi cu leilung pumpi hrangah ka tumtah mi a si ih miphun pawl hrem dingah ka kut ka hawi zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Himi tuahsuak dingah cungnungbik Bawipa cun a tum rori a si. A kut cu daantat dingah a hawi zo ih zohman in an kham thei nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Siangpahrang Ahaz a thih kum ah hi thu cu Pathian hnen ihsin a ra:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Maw Filistin mi pawl, an lo vuaknak fung cu a kiak zo; a sinan nan lungawi duh hlah uh! Rul pakhat a thih tikah a ai-ah a hraangdeuh mi rul dang pakhat a suak a si. Rul in ti a tit ih a zuang thei mi rulhreng a keuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bawipa cu a minung pawl lakih mi zonzai le mi farah pawl kilkhawitu a si dingih himte in a umter ding. Sikhalsehla nannih Filistin mi parah cun nasazet in paam a tlungter dingih pakhat hman nan luat lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Maw Filistin khua pawl, bomnak dil in au uhla aihram uh! Nan zate in thinphang in um uh! Saklam ihsin ralkap ratnak leikhu cu khawdur bangin a ra, cuih ralkap lakah ṭihhrut pakhat hman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Filistin ram ihsin a ra mi palai pawl cu ziangtin so kan son ding? Bawipa in Zion cu a tihnget zo ih harsatnak a tuar ringringtu a minung pawl cu cutawkah humhimnak an ngah ding, tiah kan sawn ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hihi Moab ih thuhla a si: Ar le Kir khawpi cu zan zankhat sungah siatsuah an si ih, Moab ram cu a ṭhing reprep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dibon khua mi pawl cu biakṭheng ih ṭap dingah tlang parah an kai. Moab mi pawl cu Nebo le Medeba khua pawl an hmuh tikah riahsia le ninghang in an ṭap an ai. An riahsia in an sam le an khahmul an meet ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khawsung lamzin ih a feh pawl in buri hnipuan an hruk; an khuasuah le an inn parin an ṭap ih an raak an kio.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Heshbon le Elealeh khua mi pawl cu an ṭap an au ih an aw cu Jahaz tiang a thang. Ralkap ralṭhabik hman an khur; an ralṭhatnak cu a hlo ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moab hrangah ka thin a na a si! A minung pawl cu Zoar khua le Eglath Shelishiyah khua tiang an tlan ṭheh. Mi hrekkhat cu Luhith lamzin an zawh ih an feh phah ah an ṭap vivo; a hrek cu Horonaim lamah an tlan ih lungngai in an ṭap phah vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimrim Tiva cu a kang ṭheh, a kiangkap ih hrampi cu an vuai ṭheh; a hringmi zianghman a um nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An neih mi hmuahhmuah thiar in Partiam Phairawn an tan ih khatlam ralah tlan an tum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moab ramri kipah ṭahnak thawm a thang. Eglaim le Beerelim khua khalah an ṭahnak thawm a thang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dibon khua ah tiva cu thisen in a khat; a sinan cuhnak ih besia deuh an hrangah Pathian in a thlengter hrih ding. A si, Moab ram sungih a taangsun mi pahnih khat tla cu thah ṭheh an si ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nelrawn ih a um mi Sela khua ih Moab mi pawl in Jerusalem khua ih mi uk bawi hnenah tuu faate laksawng ah an kuat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule a bu ihsin dawi mi vate bangin, tumtah mi nei cuca loin Arnon Tivakap ahcun an suk an so ih an hngak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah mi hnenah, “Ziang so kan tuah ding, in sim hnik uh! Sun nilingah thing daihnem ih kan colh bangin nan thladem hnuai ah in colhter hram uh! Kannih cu raltlan mi kan si ih zohman ih in hmuh theilonak hmunah in thup hram uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nan ram sungah in umter hram uhla a siatsuah in duhtu pawl ih kut ihsin in humhim hram uh,” tiah an dil. (Hremnak le siatsuahnak cu a reh dingih ram pumpi siatsuahtu pawl cu an cem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule David tefa sin pakhatkhat cu siangpahrang ah a cang dingih a minung pawl cu duhdawtnak le rintlak sinak thawn a uk hai ding. A hman mi tuah dingah a zamrang dingih thudik lawnglawng a ṭan ding a si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah mi pawl in, “Moab mi pawl an puarthau zia cu kan theih ṭheh mi a si! An hngal zia le mi an hmuhsuam cu zapi theih a si; a sinan an tluangkhawnnak cu zianghman a si lo,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Moab mi pawl cu an tuar mi harnak ruangah an ṭap ding. Cule Kir Heres khua sungih rawl thawthaw an ei ṭheu mi an vun ruahsaal tik khalah an ṭap ding. An zate in an bei a dong ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Heshbon khua kiangih lo pawl le Sibmah sabit hmuan ihsin ram uktu bawi pawl ri tertu sabit a suak. Hitawkih sabit kuang cu an ṭhazet ih Jazer khua tiang a zaam; nisuahnak lamah nelrawn tiang, nitlaknak lam ahcun Tili Thi khatlam ral tiang a zaam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Atu ahcun Jazer khua hrangih ka ṭah vekin Sibmah sabit kuang cu ka ṭah, ziangahtile an lungawi tertu dingah rawl lak ding an neilo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Loram cu a ṭhazet nan zohman an lung a awi lo. Sabit hmuan sungah zohman awn-au an um lo, hla khal an sak lo. Zohman in sabit an ciil lo; lungawi ih awn-aunak cu a reh ih a ṭhing reprep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moab le Kir Heres hrangah riahsia in ka hruum ruangro.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Moab mi pawl tlangpar biakṭheng le an biakinn ah thlacam dingih an feh rero cu an tha an baangter lak men; zianghman a ṭhahnem lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi thu cu a hlanah Pathian in Moab hnenih a rak sim mi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule atu ah Bawipa in, “Atu ihsin kum thum cekci ah Moab ram sungih sumsaw le lennak hmuahhmuah cu a cem ṭheh ding. Minung an tamzet nan mi malte lawng an nung dingih an ṭawnṭai zet ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Damaskas cu khawpi a si nawn lo ding; a siat ṭheh mi hnawmpen a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siria ramih khua pawl cu kumkhua in tlansan mi khua an si ding. Tuu le caw tlannak leenkolh a si dingih cuih ṭilva pawl cu zohman in an dawi lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel khal ṭannak neilo a si dingih Damaskas cu a zalennak a hlo ding. Siria mi a nungsun pawl cu Israel mi vekin ningzak le mualpho in an um ding. Keimah Cungnungbik Bawipa in ka sim zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in, “Israel ih natsatnak a cem ni a thleng cing ding; a lennak cu farahnak in a thlengsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel cu rawl lak ṭheh zomi lo bangtuk a si ding. Rawl an lak cia mi Refaim Phairawn ih lo vekin a kolh ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi malte lawng an nung ding. Israel cu, a rah an lawh ṭheh ih a ziik ah pum hnih thum, a hnge ah pum li nga a taangmi Olif kung bangtuk a si ding. Keimah, Israel ih Bawipa Pathian in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cui ni a thlen tikah mi pawl in anmah seemsuahtu, Israel ih Pathian thianghlim hnenah bomnak duh ah an hoi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anmaió kutih an tuahcop mi biakṭheng pawl cu an rinsan nawn lo ding; an kutzung in a suak mi Asherah pathiannu biaknak a zarhmi thingphun pawl le mei-ur thawinak hrangih biakṭheng pawl khal an rinsan nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cui ni a thlen tikah cun ṭhate ih an kulh mi khua pawl cu an tlansan ṭheh dingih, Israel mi ṭih ruangah a tlantu Hiv mi le Amor mi khawpi pawl bangin, an khua pawl cu an tan ṭheh ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Israel, lungpi bangin a lo runtu le a lo humtu Pathian cu na hngilh zo. Ram dang Pathian be dingin hmuan thianghlim tuah na tum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asinain na phun zing rori ah an ṭhang ih an mum an par hmanah rawl lak ding cu na nei cuanglo ding. Harsatnak le a dam theilo mi natnak lawng a um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ram cak zetzet pawl cu an buai ciam co. An buainak thawmvang cu tifinriat huuk thawm le a nasazet mi tisuar thawm bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ral pawl cu tisuar bangin mi an nor ciamco; a sinan Pathian in a kawk hai ih dungah an siip; tlang parih thli sem mi leivut bangtuk le phusiing ih lak mi fangkuang ro vekin an hloral ta a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zanlam ahcun tuksumza; a sinan zinglam ahcun an hlo ṭheh! Kan ram a siimtu hmuahhmuah in cubangtuk an si ciar ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sudan ram tiva khatlam ralih a um mi ramah thlakhawn thawmvang a thang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cui ramih thlah mi ram palai pawl cu Nail tivapi par in phaipheng ih tuah mi lawng in an ra. Maw palai cak pawl, zamrangin kirsal uh! Thuhla cu nan ramah kirpi saal uh; Nail tiva puutnak, a cakmi le huham a nei mi nan ramah, leilung pumpi ih an ṭih mi-misaang le vunngil mi nan miphun hnenah cun kirsal uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leilung tlunih a um mi hmuahhmuah in ngai uh! Tlangzim parih an thlai dingmi khihhmuhnak thantaar zoh uh! Tawtawrawt an tum awn ngai uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in ka hnenah, “Sun laiah vaang kelkel ih ni a tlan bangtuk le rawl lak caan khawhlum zanah daite ih dai a tlak bangtuk in ka umnak vancung ihsin ka run zoh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sabit par an tla ṭheh ih a rah an hmin phah vivo laifang sabit rah lak a cuut deuh hlanah Sudan mi pawl cu nam hriamzet in sabit hnge olzet ih a sahcat thei vekin olzet in ral in a siatsuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An ralkap ruak pawl cu phum loin an taan dingih vate le ramsa hrangah an si ding. Khawṭhal caanah vate in an ei dingih thlatang ah ramsa in an ei ding a si,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tikcu caan a rathleng dingih Nail tiva puutnak ram, a cakmi le huham a nei mi ram, leilung pumpi ih an ṭih mi misaang le vunngil mi pawl in Cungnungbik Bawipa hnenah thawinak an peknak caan a thleng ding. Cungnungbik Bawipa biaknak hmun Zion Tlang ahcun an ra ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Izipt hrangih a thleng mi thu: Bawipa cu zamrang zetin mero parah a to ih Izipt ah a ra a si. A hmaiah Izipt ih milem pawl cu an khur ih Izipt mi pawl ih ralṭhatnak cu a hlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Izipt ram sungah mah le mah do awknak ral ka tho ter ding; unau le unau an do aw dingih innhnen le innhnen tla an ral aw ding. A hua aw mi khua pakhat le pakhat an do aw dingih a ral aw mi siangpahrang pawl cu mi uk theinak huham duh ah an do aw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Izipt mi pawl ih tumtah mi cu ka siatbal ṭheh dingih an thinlung ka siat ter ding. An milem hnenah bomnak an dil ding; pol an leeng dingih mithi thlarau pawl thu an ron ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Izipt mi pawl cu miheer le mi puarthau kut sungah ka pek dingih mi zaangfah neilo siangpahrang in a uk hai ding. Cungnungbik Bawipa Keimah in ka sim zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nail tivapi ah tidai a malzet dingih nuamte in a kang ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tiva ṭeek pawl cu an nam zet dingih an caar ṭheh ve ding. Phaipheng le phok pawl cu an vuai ṭheh ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nail tivakap ih ciin mi rawl kung hmuahhmuah an caar ṭheh dingih thli in a semhlo thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nail tivapi ih ngakaih in pum a cawmtu hmuahhmuah an hruum an ai ding; an sio le an sur pawl cu a lak an si ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Puanthaan tuahtu pawl an thin a nau ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />thiamtaktu le zungthiam pawl cu an thin a pit dingih an van a sang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zoan khua ih hotu pawl cu mi-aa hlir an si! Izipt mifim bik pawl in at-thlak thu an forh. Hlanlai siangpahrang le mifim pawl ai-awhtu kan si tiah ziangtinso siangpahrang an sim ngam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Izipt siangpahrang, khui ah so na mifim pawl an si ṭheh? Cungnungbik Bawipa in Izipt hrangih tumtahnak a neih mi hi an lo sim thei hmang ding nan!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zoan le Memfis hotu pawl cu mi-aa an si! An miphun hruaitu ding an si nan an hruaisual zo a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa in thinlung buainak a pek hai ih an thusimmi khal a buai ṭheh. Curuangah Izipt in thilsual lawnglawng a tuah ih zuri pa cu amai luak par lala ih a sawn vekin Izipt cu a sawn rero a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Izipt ram sungah milian siseh, mi farah siseh mitum siseh, mi nauta siseh a bawm theitu zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Izipt mi pawl cu nunau bangih a ṭihhrut caan a rathleng ding. Cungnungbik Bawipa in anmah hrem dingih a kut a thlir kha an hmuh tikah an tuksum in an ṭhia thlohthlo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An hrangah Bawipa in a ruah cia mi an theihsaal tinte in Izipt mi in Judah mi pawl cu an ṭih ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cui caan a thlen tikah Izipt khua panga ah Hebru ṭong an hmang ding. Cutawkih a um mi pawl in siatserh ih thu an kam tikah Cungnungbik Bawipa hmin in an kam ding. Khua pakhat cu, “Ni khawpi,” tiah an ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cui caan a thlen tikah Izipt ramah Bawipaió hmin in biakṭheng pakhat an dawl dingih Izipt ramri ah a hmin in lungphun an phun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cupawl cu Izipt ramah Cungnungbik Bawipa a um ti khihhmuhnak an si ding. Cutawkih a um mi pawl in hremnak an tuar ih bomnak dilin Bawipa an kawh tikah anmah runtu dingah Bawipa in mi pakhat a thlah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Izipt mi hnenah Bawipa cu a lang leh ding. Cutikah Bawipa cu an ṭihzah ding, an biak dingih a hnenah thawinak le laksawng an keng ding. A hnenah thu fekten an kam dingih an thukam mi vekin an tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Izipt mi pawl cu Bawipa in a hrem ding, a sinan a damter saal hai ding. Amah lam an hoi dingih an thlacamnak a theihsak dingih a damter hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cui caan a thlen tikah Izipt le Assiria karlakah lamzinpi a um ding. Hi ram hnih ih minung pawl cu olte in an tlawng aw thei dingih hmun khatah Pathian an be tlaang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cui caan a thlen tikah Israel cu Izipt le Assiria thawn an ṭangtlang dingih an ram thum cu leilung pumpi hrangah thlawsuahnak an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in thlawsuahnak a pe hai dingih, “Izipt ka minung, Assiria ka kut tuah mi, le Israel ka hril mi, nan parah thlawsuahnak um hram seh,” a ti ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Assiria ram siangpahrang Sargon thupeknak vekin Assiria ralkap hotu ralbawi le a ralkap pawl in Filistin pawl ih khua Ashdod an do.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hlankhan kum thum in Bawipa in Amoz fapa Isaiah cu a hruk mi a buri hnipuan le a kedam pawl phuak dingah a fial zo. A fial vekin a tuah ih lawngfangkheh le kedam loin a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ashdod an lak tikah Bawipa in, “Ka siahhlawh Isaiah cu lawngte in le kedam loin kum thum sung a um zo. Himi cu Izipt le Sudan parih a thleng dingmi thil khihhmuhnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Assiria siangpahrang in hi ram ramhnih ihsin a kaih mi sal pawl cu lawngfangkheh in a hruaihlo hai ding. Mino siseh, upa siseh, ke lawng le lawngfangkheh in an feh ding; an zahmawh tla a lang ṭheh dingih Izipt hrangah cun ningzahnak ngaingai a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sudan ram a rinsantu le Izipt ram a porh rero tu pawl cu an bei a dong dingih an thin a pit ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cui caan a thlen tikah Filistin ram tipikap ih a um mi pawl cun, ‘Assiria siangpahrang kut ihsin in humtu ding ti ih kan rinsan mi pawl ziang an cang, zohhnik uh! Ziangtin so kan luat thei ding?’ an ti ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon ram hrangih a thleng mi thu: Nelrawn ihsin phusiing bangin thihhlohnak poimawh cu ṭihnungza ram in a ra thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ṭihnungza thil a cangmi in langnak ka hmu-zuarthlainak le siatsuahnak hlir a si. Maw Elam ralkapbu, do uh! Media ralkap pawl, khua pawl cu kulh ṭheh uh! Babilon in a thlen ter mi harsatnak le tuarnak pawl cu Pathian in a cemter thlang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Langnak sungih ka hmuh mi cun ka sungah ṭihnak le natnak a suah ter-nunau nauneih nat bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thin a tur dukdo ih ṭihnak le thlaphannak in i zeel. Zanlam a thlen ding cu ka hngakhlap zet; a sinan a ra thlen ngaingai tikah ṭihphannak in ka khat thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Langnak ka hmuh mi ahcun rawl ei puai an tiimlaam ciamco khi ka hmu. An sawm mi pawl tonak ah puan sahsah an phah. An ei an in. Cule rinlopi ah thupek a thang, “Ralbawi pawl, tho uhla nan ralphaw la uh!” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun Bawipa in ka hnenah, “Feh awla ralvengtu ret aw; a hmuh mi lo sim seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rang to tahrat in mi pahnih pahnih in a ra mi le laak le kalauk to in a ra mi a hmuh asile ṭhateih zoh dingah sim aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule ralvengtu cun, “ Bawipa , a sun a zan in ralveng in ka ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Rinlopi ah an ra thleng! Rang to tahrat in pahnih pahnih in an ra. Ralvengtu in thu a than, “Babilon a tlu zo! An biakmi milem pawl cu an kuai ṭheh ih leilung ah an ril teptep!” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Israel ka minung pawl, sangvut vekih ciil zo mi nan si, a sinan atu ah Israel ih Pathian, Cungnungbik Bawipa hnen ihsin ka theih mi thuthang ṭha cu nan hnenah ka than zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Edom ram hrangah a ra thleng mi thu: Edom ihsin mi pakhat in i ko ih, “Maw ralvengtu, zan khawthim hi ziangtik ah so a cem ding? Tuan ah khua a vang ding maw? I sim hnik!” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah kei in, “Zinglam a ra thleng cing ding; a sinan zan khawthim a ra saal ding. Thusuh na duh hrih ahcun ra saal awla i ra suut aw,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Arabia ram hrangih a ra thleng mi thu: Nannih Dedan mi, phulcaar Arabia ramih ṭilva thawn a riak tu pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tihal in nan hnenih a ratu pawl cu tidai rak pek uh. Tema ramih a um mi pawl, raltlan mi pawl hnenah rawl pe uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mitampi cu ralnam ih thah ṭih ah an tlan; conkiang ih sai ṭih ah an tlan ih ral an ṭih ruangah an tlan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in, “Kumkhat cekci sungah Kedar miphun pawl ih cahnak le sunlawinak cu a cem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kedar ramsung mi lakah conkiang hmangtu pawl cu mi ralṭhabik pawl an si; a sinan mi malte lawng an taang ding. Keimah Israel ih Pathian, Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Langnak Phairawn hrangih a thleng mi thu: Ziang so an tuah? Ziangah so khawpisung mi pawl an inn par diphun ah puai an tuah ciamco?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An khua pumpi in lungawi in an au an kio ih an thawmvang cu a nasa ngaingai. Tuihṭum raldonak ih a thi mi nan minung pawl cu ral an do ruangih a thi mi an si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nan hotu pawl an tlan ṭheh ih thal pakhat hman an sai hlanah kaih mi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah i fehsan thluh uh; keimah lawng ka minung a thi mi pawl hrangah ninghang in ka ṭap rero ding. A leem khal i tum hlah uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Langnak Phairawn ah atu hi ṭih ih buai caan, ral sung caan le mangbang ih um caan a si ih, cumicu Cungnungbik Pathian Bawipa in kan parih a thlenter mi a si. Kan khawpi kulhnak ralhruang cu an balcim ṭheh zo ih bomnak dil ih aunak aw cu tlang kipah a khawk vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Elam ram ihsin ralkap pawl cu rang parin an ra ih li le thal an keng. Kir ram ih ralkap pawl cun ralphaw thawn an tim an tuah ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ram ṭhazet Judah phairawn ahcun rangleng an khat ih rang ralkap pawl cu Jerusalem kotka hmaiah an ding ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah ralhruang le an ṭannak pawl a cim ṭheh. Cui caan a thlen tikah hriamnam nan retnak inn ihsin hriamnam nan suah ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jerusalem khawpi kulhnak pharah rem a ṭulmi pawl nan hmu. Jerusalem khua sungih inn nan siar ciamco ih khawpi kulhnak phar remnak hrangih lungto duh ah inn hrekkhat cu nan bal. Khawpi sungih tidai khawlnak dingah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />khawpi kulhnak phar sunglam ah tikhawlnak tumpi nan dawl ih ticawm hlun ihsin tidai nan run luangter. Sikhalsehla hi thil hmuahhmuah a rak tumtu le a cangtertu Pathian sawn cu zianghman ah nan siar lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in ṭap le ai dingah le nan sam meet ṭheh ding le buri hnipuan hruk dingah a lo ko hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asinain nan hni nan kheek ih puai nan tuah sawn. Ei dingah caw le tuu nan that ih sabit nan in ciamco. “Kan ei kan in pei cu! Thaisun ah kan thi ding a si,” nan ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa Amah rori in ka hnenah, “Hi an ṭhatlonak hi an nunsung hmuahhmuah ngaidam an si lo pei. Keimah Cungnungbik Bawipa in ka sim zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in siangpahrang innsungsang hotu Shebna hnen ah i feh ter ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Zo ka si tiah so na ruat aw? Tlangpar lungto lakah na hrangah thlaan lai dingin zo in so thu a lo pek?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi upa pakhat cu na si ve nan Bawipa in a lo thur dingih a lo hlonhlo mai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawhlung vekin hluum ko in a lo khirh dingih ram kaupi ah a lo hlon ding. Cutawkah na hngalpi zet mi rangleng kiangah na thi ding. Na bawipa ih innsungsang ningzak tertu na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipa in na hnaṭuannak ihsin a lo hlon dingih na hnaṭuan saang ihsin a lo ṭhum ding,” ti ih sim dingah i fial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa in Shebna hnenah, “Cui caan a thlen tikah Hilkiah fapa ka siahhlawh Eliakim ka ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na zung hnaṭuannak korfualpi le na taikhap le na thuneihnak hmuahhmuah ka lak dingih a hnenah ka pe ding. Amah cu Jerusalem le Judah mi pawl hrangah an pa bangtuk a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amah cu David tefa sin siangpahrang ih thuai ah thuneihnak kimten ka pe ding. Hna a ṭuan theinak dingah a kut ah tawhfung pawl ka pe dingih amah ih a on mi cu zohman in an khar lo ding; amah ih a khar mi cu zohman in an ong lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amah cu a hngetzet mi thil bannak fungkhen bangin ka hngetter dingih a innsungsang zate hrangah mithmaiṭha ngahnak a hrampi a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Asinain a sungkhat pawl le a cawm mi pawl cu a hrangah thilrit zet an si ding. Thil bannak fungkhen ah beel le kheng pawl an thlai vekin a parah an thlai aw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cui ni a thlen tikah hngetzet ih khen mi fungkhen cu a der dingih a tlong ding. Cuticun a parih a thlai awmi khal cu an cem ṭheh ding,” tiah a ti. Bawipa in a sim zo a si!
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tair khua hrangih a thlengmi thu: Tipithuanthum parih khualtlawng mi pawl, riahsia in ṭap ai-uh! Nan suah nan luhnak khawpi Tair cu a siat ṭheh zo; inn pawl le lawng colhnak tla a siat ṭheh zo. Saipras ihsin nan lawng pawl an kir tikah cuih thu cu nan thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw Sidon khua ih sumtuahtu pawl, ai-hram uh! Nan minung pawl cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Izipt ramih a suak mi rawl lei le zuar tahratin ram tinkim thawn sumtuah dingah tifinriat parah nan thlah hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Sidon khawpi, ningzakza na si. Tifinriat le tipithuanthum thuuk pawl in an lo khaak ih, “Faate ka nei dah lo. Fapa le fanu khal ka cawm dah lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tair a siat ṭheh a si, ti an theih tikah cun Izipt mi pawl hman an mang a bang dingih an riah a sia ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Foenisia mi pawl, riahsia in ṭap-ai uh! Spain ramih tlanhlo tum uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khuahlan lai ih an rak din mi, nomnak in a khat mi Tair khawpi rak timi cu hihi a si pei maw? Tifinriat khatlam ralah ramdang lak ding le luah dingah tifinriat raal ih mi a thlahtu khawpi cu hihi a si pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leilung tlun ih upat bik mi sumtuahtu tum zetzet umnak, mi-uk bawi umnak Tair khawpi parah zoso hibangtuk in thu a tawlrel?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa ih tawlrelmi a si! An hngalnak le an tluangkhawnnak cemter dingah le an upat mi pawl mualpho ter dingah Pathian in a tuah mi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Spain ram a va luahtu pawl, va feh uhla lo va thlo uh! A lo humtu ding zohman an um nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in a kut cu tifinriat parah a khai ih ram tampi a hlon ṭheh zo. Foenisia ramih pursum leilawnnak hmun tumpipi pawl tla siat ṭheh dingin thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Sidon khawpi, na lungawinak a cem zo. Na minung pawl cu hremnak an tuarih Saipras ih an tlan khalle an him cuanglo ding. (
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tair khawpi hramlak ramsa tlannak ih a cangtertu cu Assiria mi an si lo, Babilon mi an si. Raldonak innsang cu Babilon mi pawl in an sak ih Tair khawpi kulhnak ralhruang an bal ih khawpi cu an siatsuah ṭheh a si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maw tipithuanthum parih lawng thluntu pawl, riahsia in ṭap-ai uh! Nan rinsanzet mi khawpi cu a siat ṭheh zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tair khawpi cu siangpahrang sankhat sung caan, kum sawm sarih sung an hngilh tikcu caan a rathleng ding. Cui kum a cem tikah Tair khawpi cu hla sungih hlawhhlangnu vek a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na ṭingṭang la awla khua sungah tawivak aw; Nang, hngilh zo mi hlawhhlang nu! An lo theih salnak dingah, Na ṭingṭang tum awla na hla sak saal aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cui kum sawm sarih a cem tikah Bawipa in Tair cu a hnaṭuan hlun a ṭuanter saal dingih leilungtlun ramkipah hlawhhlang nu a cang saal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pursum leilawn ihsin a ngah mi paisa cu Bawipa hnenah pek a si ding. A paisa cu a khawl ciamco lo ding, a sinan Bawipa a biatu pawl in a paisa cu rawl leinak le an hai mi an hnipuan leinak ah an hmang ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in leilung a siatsuah ṭheh dingih a ṭhing reprep ding. Leilung cu a linglet ter dingih minung pawl a ṭhekdarh ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zozo khal sisehla an ton mi a bangraan ṭheh ding-puithiam pawl le senpi pawl, sal pawl le bawi pawl, a leitu le a zuartu pawl, paisa coihtu le cawitu pawl, milian le mifarah pawl an ton mi a bangrep ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leilung pumpi cu a khingkuai ṭheh dingih a siatbal ṭheh ding. Bawipa in a sim zo ih a sim vekin a cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leilung cu a caar ih a vuai ṭheh; leilung pumpi cu a derdai; lei le van a siatral ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi in Pathian daan an buar ih kumkhua hrangih a tuah mi thukamnak cu an siatbal; cuticun leilung an borhhlawhter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuhrangah leilung cu siat dingah Pathian in a cam. Leilung mi in an sualman an tuar a si. A nungmi an mal deuhdeuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sabit kuang pawl an vuai ih sabit a har deuhdeuh. Lungawi sopar teih a rak um ṭheu mi pawl cu riahsiatnak in an khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nuamzet ih hla an sak ṭheunak ṭingṭang le khuang pawl cu an dai zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zu an in hmanah nuamzetin hla an sa thei nawn lo; zu ih thawtnak khal an thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khawpi sung ah ziang hmuahhmuah a buai ṭheh; minung pawl cu luat duh ah inn sungah an kharhkhum aw ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi pawl cu lamzin ah an dingih zu duh ah an au. Nomnak zianghman a um nawn lo; nomnak cu ramsung ihsin kumkhua daih in dawihlo a si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khawpi cu a siat ṭheh ih a kotka pawl cu a bal ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Leilung tlun ramkipah cuticun a si ṭheh ding. Rawl lak caan a cem ih olif kung ihsin olif rah an vuakthlak ṭheh ih pakhat hman taanglo ih an lak ṭheh caan a bang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A taangsun pawl cu lungawi in hla an sak ding. Nitlak lamih a um mi pawl in Pathian a nasatzia an phuang dingih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />nisuahnak lamih a um mi pawl in an thangṭhat ding. Tifinriat kap tluan ih a um mi pawl in Israel ih Pathian Bawipa cu an cawimawi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Leilung tlunih a hlabik ram hman in Israel miphun, miphun dik, an thangṭhatnak hla cu kan thei ding. Asinain kei ih hrangah cun beisei ding a um lo. Ka cem deuhdeuh ih ka taksa ruangpi in a daih nawn lo. Mi zuarthlaitu pawl in in zuarthlai thotho ih in zuarthlainak cu ani ani in a besia deuhdeuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maw leitlun minung pawl, tuksumnak a um, khur thuukpi a um ih nan hrangah thang kam cia in a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuksumnak ihsin tlanhlo a tumtu cu khur sungah an tla ding; khur ihsin a tlantu cu thang in a awk ding. Van ihsin ruah nasazet in a sur dingih leilung hramṭonak a hnin ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leilungpi cu a khing ding, a kuai dingih a phel aw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Leilungpi cu zuri bangin a sawn dingih thlisia lakih deute bangin a tlu ding. Leilungpi hi a sualnak in a delh tuk zo; a tlu dingih a thosal nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa in tlunlam ih a um mi huham neitu pawl le leilung parih mi-uktu pawl a hremnak tikcu caan a ra thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa in khur sungih thawngtla bangin siangpahrang pawl a khawm ding. Anmah hremnak tikcu caan a thlen hlan cu thawnginn sungah a khum hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thlapi a thim ding; ni a tlaang lo ding; ziangahtile Cungnungbik Bawipa cu siangpahrang a si ding. Jerusalem khua Zion Tlang ihsin a uk dingih misenpi hotu pawl in a sunlawinak huham an hmu ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah cu ka Pathian na si; Ka lo upat dingih na hmin ka thangṭhat ding. Mangbangza thil pawl na tuah zo; Kum reipi ihsin na tum mi pawl cu Felte in na tuah ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khawpi pawl cu na siatbal ṭheh ih, An kulhnak ralhruang pawl na siat ṭheh. Kan ral pawl ih sak mi siangpahrang inn pawl cu, Ziangtik hmanih sak saal nawn lo dingin a siat ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ram cakzetzet sungih minung pawl in, Nangmah cu an lo thangṭhat ding; Zaangfah neilo ramih khawpi pawl khalin Nangmah cu an lo ṭihzet ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mifarah le bawmtu neilo pawl in an lo pan ih Harsatnak caan khalah an him a si. Thlisia a hraan tikah beunak na pek hai ih, Nisat tikih colhnakah daihnem na pek. Thlatang ih thlisia bangin, Zaangfah neilo mi in an do hai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ramcaar lakih nisen sa bangin; Sikhalsehla Bawipa nangmah in Kan ral pawl cu na daih terih; Zaangfah neilo mi ih au-thawm cu na reh ter, Khawdur in nisa a daihter bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hitawk Zion Tlang parah hin Cungnungbik Bawipa in leilungtlun ramkip le miphunkip hrangah rawl ei puai a tuah ding. Cui rawl ei puai ahcun rawl thawbik le sabit thawbik an pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi tlangpar ah hin ramtin le miphun tinih riahsiatnak cu mero bangin a kiangter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in thihnak cu kumkhua in a hloral ter ding. Mi hmuahhmuah ih mitthli a hnul dingih leilungtlun khuazakip ah a minung pawl ih an tuar mi mualpho ningzahnak cu a lak hlosak ding. Bawipa Amah in a sim zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cui ni a thlen tikah zozo khalin, “Amah cu kan Pathian a si! Amah cu kan rinsan zo ih in runsuak zo a si! Amah cu Bawipa a si! A hnenah kan rinsannak cu kan retih lungawi aipuang in kan um; ziangahtile in hum zo a si,” an ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in Zion Tlang cu a hum ding; a sinan fangkuangro dawm ih an palbeek bangin Moab mi pawl cu palbeek an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tileuh tum bangin an kut cu an hawi ding, a sinan Pathian in anmah cu a namthla dingih an kut cu pawk ding neilo in a pil ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in Moab mi pawl ih sak mi ralhruang, saangzetzet ih an dawl mi phar pawl cu a balcim dingih leivut ah an cang ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Misenpi in hi hla cu Judah ramsungih an sak caan a thleng ding: Kan khawpi cu a cak! Pathian Amah in a ralhruang pawl a kil!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khawpi kotka pawl cu ong uhla, Rintlakzet miphun cu luh ter uh; A dikmi lawng a tuahtu miphun cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , daihnak famkim cu nangmah in na pe, An tumtah mi ah a hnget mi le Nangmah a lo ringtu hnenah cun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa cu kumkhua in rinsan uh! Amah in in hum ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi puarthau pawl cu a namthlak ih, An umnak khawpi cak hman cu a siatter; An ralhruang phar pawl cu a cimter ih, Leivut ah a cangter ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Atu ahcun rak hrem mi pawl in Cui leivut tlunin an feh ih an ke in an pal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , miṭha pawl lamzin cu na tluangter; An thlun mi lamzin cu zinphei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na duhnak kan thlun ih kan ruahsannak cu na hnenah a um; Kan duh mi hmuahhmuah cu nangmah na si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zan khuavaar in nangmah cu ka lo ngai, Ka thinlung zate in kan lo hlam. Leilung le a minung pawl thu na ṭhen tikah, Thudik cu an thei ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miṭha lo mi par ah zaangfahnak na nei naan, A dikmi cu an tuah dah cuanglo. Miding pawl ih ramsung hmanah hin Thilsual an tuah thotho. Na natsatnak cu zianghman ah an siar lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na hrem hai ding ti na ral pawl in an thei lo; Maw Bawipa , ningzakin tuah hai awla tuar hai seh; Na rak ruah cia mi hremnak cu tuar hai seh. Na minung pawl ziangtlukin na duhdawt ti kha hmuh hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah in neinung lennak in pe ding; Kan tuah thei kan timi hmuahhmuah hi Nangmaió tuahmi an si ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maw Bawipa kan Pathian, mi dangdang in in uk zo; Asinain kan Bawipa cu nangmah lawng na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An thi zo ih an nung nawn lo ding; An thla pawl cu an thosal nawn lo ding. Na hrem ih na hloral ter ṭheh zo a si. Zohman in an ciing nawn hai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , kan miphun hi na ṭhangso ter; Kan ram cu a kilkip in na kau ter. Cu ruangah na hmin in upatnak a co.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na minung pawl daan na tat ih An thinpit ah na hnenah thla an cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah in in ṭap ter; Nausuak natih nunau a ṭah bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kan na, kan tuar ih kan ṭap; Asinain zianghman kan hring lo. Kan ram hrangah nehnak zianghman kan suahpi lo; Kan ti suak mi zianghman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sikhalsehla kan minung a thi cia mi pawl an nung ding; An ruangpi cu a nung saal ding a si. Thlan sungih a it mi pawl cu An ṭhang dingih lungawi in hla an sa ding! A tleu detdo mi daitla ih leilung a hringter bangin A thicia mi pawl cu Bawipa in a nungter saal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Maw ka minung pawl, nan inn sungah lut uhla nan sangka khar uh! Pathian thinhengnak a reh hlanlo sung cu relh ta hrih uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Leilung mi pawl an sualnak ruangih daantat dingah Bawipa cu vancung a umnak hmun ihsin a rung ṭum ding. A thupte ih mi an phil mi pawl tla phuan thluh a si dingih a thi mi pawl cu leilung in a thup nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cui ni ah tipithuanthum sungih a um mi rul tumpi that dingah le a ngerh aw mi le ṭihnungza Leviathan rul cu hrem dingah Bawipa in a cak mi le a hmual a ṭha mi a ralnam a hmang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cui ni ah Bawipa in a nuamzet mi a sabit hmuan thu ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka sabit hmuan cu keimah in ka kil ih ti ka toih ringring. Zohman ih an siatsuah lonak dingah a sun a zan in ka kil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Atu ahcun ka sabit hmuan parah ka thin a heng nawn lo. Hling le so an um ahcun keimah in ka do dingih ka ur fai ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asinain ka minung ih ral pawl in keimai humhimnak an duh a si ahcun keimah thawn remnak tuah hai seh. A si, keimah thawn remnak tuahta hai seh,” a ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cui ni ah Israel mi, Jakob ih tefa sin pawl cu thingkung bangin hram an thla saal ding; an mum dingih an par ding. Cuticun leilung tlunah an rah a khat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu an ral pawl tluk cun Bawipa in a hremsiat lo; a thi mi khal an ral pawl zat in an tam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung pawl cu sal taannak ih kuatnak in a hrem hai. Nisuahnak lam ihsin a hrangmi thlisia a semhlo ter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khawvel pawl biakṭheng ih dawl mi lungto pawl miphiu vut vekih rialdip a si hlanlo le Asherah pathian nu can ai-ih thing phun mi le rimhmui urnak biakṭheng pawl a um sungah cun Israel sualnak cu ngaidam a si lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ralhruang ih kulh mi khawpi pawl cu an siatbal ṭheh zo! Hramlak ramṭhing bangin an lawngih an ṭhing reprep. Ṭilva tlannak ramah a cangih ṭilva pawl an um ih rawl an piat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thinghnge pawl tla an ro ih an kiak ṭheh; nunau pawl in tih thing ah an hlam. Ziangahtile minung pawl in zianghman an theihthiam lo ruangah anmah seemsuahtu Pathian in an parah lainatnak le zaangfahnak zianghman a nei nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cui ni ah Bawipa in, Zufrates tiva ihsin Izipt ramri tiang a minung pawl pakhat hnu pakhat a khawm dingih fang le fanghi ṭhen bangtuk in a ṭhen ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cui ni a thlen tikah Assiria le Izipt ramih saltaangmi Israel mi pawl ko dingah tawtawrawt an tum ding. An ra dingih Jerusalem khua, a tlang thiang parah Bawipa an biak ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel uknak cu a cem a si! A sunlawinak cu an hotu zuri pawl lu parah, pangpar ih tuah mi siangpahrang lukhum a vuai vekin, a vuai a si. A hngalzet mi an lu cu ṭhazet in rimhmui an hnih naan thizik ih zu an rit ruangah an ril men.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa in anmah do dingah a cakzet mi le huham a neizet mi pakhat a hril zo. Cupa cu rial tlak in a rung tla ding, thli le ruah bangin a ra ding, thil siatsuahtu tilik bangin a ra dingih ram cu a neh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An hotu zuri pawl ih hngalnak cu ke ih palcih mi an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An hotu mi hngal pawl ih hminthannak cu theipi rah hmaisabik a hmin vete in an lawh ih an ei ih a cem vekin a cem ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tikcu a ra thleng dingih cuih ni ah Bawipa cu a minung a nungdam sun pawl hrangah pangpar ih tuah mi siangpahrang lukhum vek a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in an thuṭhentu pawl hnenah dingnak thinlung a pe dingih an khawpi kotka pawl a ra dotu an ral pawl a dawihlo tu hnenah ralṭhatnak a pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Profet le puithiam pawl hman zu an ri ih an sawn ciamco. Sabit zu le zureu tamzet an in ih hmunkipah an lu zing in an sawn an ril ih an buai nasa. Profet pawl cu zu an ri tukih Pathian in langnak a hmuhter mi hman a tican an thei lo; puithiam pawl khal zu an ri tuk ve ih an hnenih a thlengmi thurel ding hman an rel thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An tonak cabuai hman an luak in a khat ṭheh ih a thiannak hmun malte hman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka parah an phunzai ih, “Hi pa hi zo ka zirh tiah so a ruat aw? A thusim mi cu hnawi thlei pekte nauhak hrang lawngah a ṭha ko lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In zirh tikah a cafang a cafang in, a catlaang a catlaang in le a thu pakhat hnu pakhat in in hei zirh fawn!” in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka thusim mi nan ngai duh lo asile Pathian in ramdang ṭong theih lo mi hmang in a lo zirhter hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amah in colhdamnak le nunnomnak a lo pe naón a thu cu nan ngai duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Curuangah a si Bawipa in a cafang a cafang in, a catlaang a catlaang in le thu pakhat hnu pakhat in a lo zirh tumnak cu! Cule kal khat nan kal tin in nan bah ding. Hriamhma nan pu ding, thang in a lo awk hai dingih ralkaih mi nan si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem ihsin hi minung pawl a uktu nannih mi puarthau pawl, Bawipaió thusim mi hi ngaihnik uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nanmah cun “Thihnak thawn thukamnak kannei zo ih mithi khua Sheol thawn lungkimnak cachuk kan tuah zo,” nan hei ti ih tluang nan khawng ciamco. Thilṭha lo poimawh a thlen tikah kan luat ding tiah nan zum ih thuphan pernak le mibumnak nan rinsan ruangah kan him ding, tiah nan ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa cun, “Zion ah a hngetmi le a khoh mi innhram ka thok ih, cuih innhram ahcun innkil ih dawl cih mi lungpi ka ret. Cui innkil lungpi parah cun, ‘A hngetmi zumnak cu a thin a sau fawn a si,’ ti in ka ngan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Innhram a ding maw dinglo ti tahnak ah felnak ka hmang ding. Sikhalsehla nan rinsanzet mi thuphan pawl cu thlisia le rial in a siatsuah ṭheh dingih nan himnak pawl cu tilik in a siatsuah ṭheh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thihnak thawn thukamnak nan tuah mi cu bal ṭheh a si dingih mithi khua Sheol thawn lungkimnak cachuk nan tuah mi cu phiat ṭheh a si ding. Thil ṭha lo poimawh a thlen tikah tilik bangin a lo khuh ṭheh hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cui thil poimawh cu hi ṭumkhat lawng a si ding, nan ti vete in a dang a ra thleng lala ding. Zingkhat hnu zingkhat a thleng ding. A sun a zan in nan tuar ding. Pathian thu a thar in a ra thleng dingih tuksumza a si sinsin ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Phungthluk ih, ‘Ihnak ihkhun le a tawituk, sin ding puan le a fate tuk,’ an timi mipa nan hluan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa in thiltuah a tum mi cu thil phundangzet vek a bang khalle a tuahsuak ding; Perazim Tlang le Gibeon Phairawn ih a rak do ciamco zo vekin a ṭul ahcun atu khalah a do ko ding. A thok zomi a hnaṭuan cu a kimter ding; cuih a hnaṭuan mi cu theih thei lo mi thil mangbangza an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na hnenih ralrinnak thu ka sim mi hi caponak ah ruatin hnihsan meen hlah. Na hnihsan meen asile na luatnak dingah a har sinsin ding. Cungnungbik Bawipa in hi ram pumpi siatsuah dingih a ruahcia mi cu ka thei zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka lo sim mi hi ngai uhla nan hnenih ka phuan mi hi ṭhatein ruat uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zovek lothlo pa khalin a leileh mi sungih rawl ciinnak ah tiah kumkhua catbaang loin a lei a let dah keel lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A leileh cu ṭhateih a simsial ṭheh hnu ahcun zira le remhmui ci a vorh. Sangvut le barli sangvut a tuh ih a kiangkapah rawl dangdang a cing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lo hnaṭuan daan a thiam, ziangahtile Pathian in a zirh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zira ci le remhmui ci laak duh ah talhtum tumzet in a vuak lo; talhtum ai ah a tawk dingmi fung fate deuh a hmang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sangvut a laak tikah a siat thluh tiangin catbaang loin a rial dah lo. Sangvut fang siat lo dingih ralringte in cawleng in a ciil ih a tawkfangte in a ciil thiam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi bangtuk fimnak le thiamnak cu Cungnungbik Bawipa ih pekmi a si. Pathian khawkhannak cu fimnak ih khuakhan mi a si ih hlawhtlinnak a um ringring.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem, Pathian biakṭheng, na cem a si! David khawpi cu a cem riai a si! Kum khat hnih cu awh hrih ko seh, puai tuahnak le nomnak pawl thawn!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule “Pathian biakṭheng,” timi khawpi parah cun Pathian in thilṭha lo poimawh a thlengter ding. Cutikah ṭahnak le au-nak a um dingih Jerusalem khawpi pumpi thisen in a khuh mi thawinak biakṭheng ah a cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian in hi khawpi cu a ral dingih a do dingih a kulh ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem cu leilung thuai ihsin hung ṭongsuak a tumtu mithla vek, leivut lakih sin a hung phun supso tu aw vek a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem, nangmah a lo dotu ramdang mi pawl cu leivut bangin semhlo ṭheh an si dingih ṭihnungza an ralkap pawl cu fangkungro bangin an zamhlo ṭheh ding. Hmakhatte-ah rinlopi-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa cun a nasazet mi thli le ruah, khuari le ṭeek tla le linghnin in a lo run ding. Thlisia le a alh hluarhlo mi meisa a run thlak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah Jerusalem khawpi, Pathian biakṭheng timi khua a dotu ih ralkap hmuahhmuah, an hriamnam le an thilri pawl le an ken mi hmuahhmuah cu mang vekin le zan kan ih ih kan mitthlam ih a cuangduak mi vekin an hloral ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem do dingah a puum aw mi ram hmuahhmuah cu, rilrawng zet pa a mangah rawl thawzetzet a ei ih a maai rero naón a ṭhangsaal tikah cun rilrawng thotho a sivek le tihal zet pa a mangah tidai riamzet in a in rero naón a ṭhangsaal tikah cun tihal le dangcaar thotho ih a um vekin an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Feh uhla mi aa si hrih ko uh! Nan mit cu caw hrih ko seh! Zu zianghman in loin ri uh! Zureu forkhat hman in loin sawn rero uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thizik ih it that dingah Bawipa in nan ih a lo hmuh ter hai a si. Profet pawl hi misenpi ih mit an si ding naón Pathian in an mit a hup a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Profet ih an hmuh mi langnak hmuahhmuah a tican nan theih theilonak dingah thuh in a um dingih an erh pit mi cazual vek a si ding. Casiar thiam hnenah nan fehpi ih in siarsak hnik aw nan ti hmanah ka siar thei lo, an erh pit a si si, a ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Casiar thiamlo hnenah nan pekih in siarsak aw nan ti khalle ca siar ka thiam ual lo, a lo ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Himi pawl cun in bia naón an ṭong cu tican neilo a si ih an thinlung cu khuimaw lamah a vakvai. Annih hrangah cun biaknak timi cu milai ih tuahcop mi daanterek le thilti ṭheu daan pawl khi a si ih, zoh loih an siar mi pawl khi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An ruah lopi in an parah harsatnak pakhat hnu pakhat ka thlengter ding. Mifim timi pawl cu mi-aa ah an cang dingih an fimnak cu zianghman ah a ṭhahnem lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An tumtahmi Bawipa hnenih sin a thuptu pawl cu rei an awh lo ding. An tum mi cu thupte in an tuah ih, “Zohman in in hmu lo, zohmanin an thei lo,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thil hmuahhmuah an linglet ter ṭheh. Beel tuahtu maw, beel tuahnak tlak so a thupi sawn? Minung ih tuah mi thil in a tuahtu hnenah, ‘Ziangah so i tuah?’ a ti thei ding maw? Asilole, “Na tuah mi hi zianghman na thei lo,” tiah a sim thei ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ṭongṭhimnak ih a um vekin a rei hlanah tupi ngawzet cu loram ah a cang dingih loram cu tupi ah a cangsal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuih ni a thlen tikah hnaset pawl in cauk thangzet ih an siarmi kha an thei dingih caan reipi khawthim sungih a um zo mi mitcaw pawl in an mit an meng dingih khua an hmu thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mifarah le mi lungnem pawl in Israel Pathian thianghlim ih pekmi lungawinak cu an co saal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutikah midang a hmuhsuam a hremtu le Pathian zianghman ih a siarlo tu pawl cu an cem ding. Misual hmuahhmuah cu siatsuah ṭheh an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian in midang a thangsiat tu, miṭha lo pawl hrem a khamtu le mifel pawl an felnak vekih thuhman coter duh lo ah thuphan a pertu pawl cu a siatsuah ṭheh hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Curuangah Israel ih Pathian, harsatnak sung ihsin Abraham a suahtu Bawipa in, “Maw ka minung pawl, mualpho in nan um nawn lo ding; ningzak in nan hmai a raam nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka lo pek dingmi tefa pawl nan hmu dingih cuticun keimah cu Israel ih Pathian thianghlim ka si kha in theithiam ding. Upatnak in pe dingih khawruahhar ṭihzahnak thawn ka hmaiah nan ding ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi aa pawl in thil theihthiamnak an nei dingih a phunzaitu le a tlokciar ringring tu pawl khal lungawizet in zirh an theih ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Judah ram uktu pawl cu an cem a si. Ziangahtile keimah dodaltu ah an cang. Keimaió khawkhannak a si lo mi an thlun ih ka lungkimnak tel loin lungkimnak cachuk an tuah; cuticun sualnak pakhat hnu pakhat an thuah vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keimah ron hmaisa loin bomnak duh ah Izipt ramah an feh. Izipt in in hum seh ti an duh ih Izipt siangpahrang an rinsan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sikhalsehla an siangpahrang in a bawm thei hai lo ding; Izipt ih humhimnak cu hloralnak ah a net ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An ram palai pawl cu Izipt ram khawpi Zoan le Hanes an thlengzo naón,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />bomnak an ṭulzet laifangih a bawm theilotu ram, rintlak a si lo mi ram an rak rinsan pang cu Judah mi pawl an siir zet saal ding,” tiah a ti zo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thlanglam nelrawn ramih ramsa pawl thu ah Pathian in hiti in a sim; “Ram palai pawl cu ṭihnunnak ram, kiosa le rulhraang pawl le a zam thei mi dragon rul pawl umnak ah khual an tlawng. Mi zianghman bomnak a pe theilotu ram hnenih laksawng pek dingah thilri mankhung zetzet cu an laak le an kalauk parah an suang ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Izipt in bomnak cu thulolak a si. Curuangah Izipt cu, ‘ṭihtlak lo Rulpi,’ tiah hmin ka pek zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ziangtluk miṭha lo an si kha kumkhua ih hminsinnak dingah an thuhla cu cauk sungih ngan dingin Pathian in i fial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian dodaltu an si ringring, thuphan pertu an si ringring ih Pathian zirhnak kha an thlun duh hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Profet pawl hman cu, “Daite in um uh, ṭong hlah uh! Hihi a hman ee, khakha a hmanlo ee, tiah in sim duh hlah uh! Kan theih duh mi a nuam mi lawnglawng in sim uh. Kanmah umteón um ve mai uhsi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In kian uh, kan lamzin in kham hlah uh! Nan ‘Israel ih Pathian thianghlim,’ thu cu a theih kan duh nawn lo,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Israel ih Pathian Thianghlim cun, “Ka lo sim mi cu zianghman ah nan siarlo ih mibumnak le thisen luannak sawn nan rinsan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mimawh hrimhrim nan si. Phar dawl a tlun ihsin a hnuailam tiang a khingkuai mi bangtuk nan si ih rinlopi ah nan tlu leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tlak beel a kuai ih meivam laknak ah le tikuang ihsin tidai vun suahnak hman umlo ih a kuai thluh bangin nan kuai thluh leh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa Israel ih Pathian Thianghlim in misenpi hnenah, “Rakir saal uhla daitein keimah i rinsan uh. Dai ziarzi ih um cu nan cahnak a si ih nan him ding,” tiah a ti. Asinain cutiih um cu nan duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Rang tlan cakzet pawl kan to dingih kan raal pawl ih hmuh lonak ah kan tlan ding,” nan ti. A si, nan hman; nan tlanhlo ngai ko ding. Kan rang pawl cu an cakzet a si, nan ti; a sinan a lo dawitu pawl cu nannih hnakin an cak sawn ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nan ral pakhat nan hmuh tikah nannih cu thawngkhat nan tlan ding; nan ral panga nan hmuh ahcun nan zate in nan tlan ṭheh ding. Nan ralkapbu sungin pakhat hman nan taanglo ding; a taangmi cu tlangzim parih amah lawng lungleng ih a dingmi nan thantaar ṭhuam pakhat lawng a si ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cubangtuk a sinan Bawipa cu nan parah zaangfahnak a nei lai hrih. Amah cun thil hman lawnglawng a tuah ruangah nanmah zaangfah dingah a lo hngak lai hrih. Lungawinak taktak cu Bawipa rinsannak ihsin a ra a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem ih a um mi pawl, nan ṭap nawn lo ding. Bawipa cu lainatnak neitu a si ih bomnak dilin a hnenih nan au tikah a lo theihsak hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa cun harnak le tuarnak sungah a lo thlenter hai ding, a sinan nan tuarnak hmunah cun a um ve dingih a lo zirhtu a si ding; cuticun amah nan hawl rero a ṭul lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zin nan hlo ih vorhlam le kehlam ih zinpeng nan zawh tikah nan dunglam ihsin a aw cu, “Hitawkin feh uh; hinah lamzin a um,” tiah a ti nan thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sui le ngun in huut mi nan milem pawl cu hnawmhne bangin nan hlonhlo dingih, “A hmuh ka lo duh nawn lo!” nan ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Rawl ci nan tuh tikah Bawipa in ruah a sur ter dingih rawl a ṭhan ter ding, rawl nan paṭha dingih nan ṭilva pawl tlannak khalah hramno a tamzet ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nan lo leilettu cawcang le laak pawl in a ṭhabik le a thawbik ṭilva rawl an ei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cui ni a thlen ih nan ral pawl ih ralhruang nan lakih an minung pawl nan thah tikah tlangsaang le tlangniam hmunkip in tidai an luang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thlapi cu ni tlukin a tleu dingih ni cu a tleu keel ih let sarih in a tleu ding; ni sarih tleunak khi ni khat ah kom hai sehla a bang ding. A tlunih thil cang ding pawl cu Bawipa in a minung hnenih a thlenter mi hma pawl a tuamsak hai ih a damter tikcu caanah a kim ṭheh ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pathian ih huham le sunlawinak cu a hlatpi in hmuh thei a si. Meisa le meikhu in a thinhengnak an langter. Thu a sim ih a ṭong cu meisa bangin a alh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ziang hmuahhmuah a fenhlo ṭheh tu tilian bangin a hmaiah thli a hran ter. Cui thli cun ram tampi a siatsuah ih a ṭha lomi an tumtahnak tla a cemral ter ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nannih Pathian ih minung pawl cu nizarh ni puai tuah zanih lungawi in hla nan sak bangin lungawi le hlasa in nan um ding a si. Israel a ṭantu Bawipaió Biakinn an feh laiah phirivau tum phah in lungawizet ih a fehtu pawl bangtuk in nan lung a awi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bawipa in a nasazet mi a aw cu mi hmuahhmuah a theihter dingih a thinhengnak hmual khal a ton ter hai ding. Meisa hliozet a um dingih khawdur a puak ciamco ding; rial a tla dingih ruah cu a thlet in a thle aw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Assiria mi pawl cu Bawipaió aw an theih tikah le a hremnak hmual an ton tikah an tuk a suum ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pathian in Assiria mi pawl a hrem beet vivo tikah amai minung pawl cun khuang le ṭingṭang aw thawng an thlun ding. Pathian amah rori in Assiria mi pawl cu a do ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Meisa rumzet sungih Assiria siangpahrang ur-nak ah tiah khuahlan lai ihsin hmun pakhat cu timlaam cia in a um zo. Cui hmun cu a thuuk ih a kauzet; zanthing tla saangzet in an peng zo! Kaat meisa bangtuk a si mi Bawipaió thaw in a ur ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bomnak duh ah Izipt ih a fehtu pawl cu an cem a si! Izipt ralkap pawl an rinsan; an rang, an rangleng, le an ralkap cakzet pawl an rinsan a si. Asinain Bawipa Pathian, Israel ih Pathian Thianghlim cu an rinsan lo; a hnenih sin bomnak khal an dil lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa cun a tuah mi a thei, thilṭha lo poimawh a thlenter a si. Miṭha lo pawl le a rak ṭantu pawl kha ka hrem ding a ti bangin a hrem taktak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Izipt mi pawl cu pathian an si lo, milai lawng an si! An rang pawl cu thlarau an si lo, titsa nei an si! Bawipa in a kut pharh in thil a tuah tikah cun a cakzet mi ram cu a ril dingih cumi a cakzet mi ram in a bom mi ram cak lo khal a sawn cih ding a si. An ram hnih in a siat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in ka hnenah, “Ramsa a dehtu kiosa cu tuukhal pawl in ziangtlukih an au an kio hnawh hmanah an dawihlo thei lo bangin, kei Cungnungbik Bawipa cu Zion Tlang humhim ka tumnak ihsin zohmanin in kham theilo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A fanote hum dingah vate cu a bu tlunih a heel awk rero bangin kei Cungnungbik Bawipa khalin Jerusalem cu ka hum dingih ka ṭan ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian in, “Maw Israel mi pawl, ka hmaiah nan sual zo ih in ralsan zo! Sikhalsehla ka hnenah rakir uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nan zate in sui le ngun ihsin a borhhlawh mi milem nan tuah mi pawl nan hlonhlo ṭhehnak tikcu caan a rathleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Raldonak ah Assiria cu a siat ṭheh ding, a sinan milai kut in a si lo ding. Assiria mi pawl cu raldonak ihsin an tlan dingih an mino pawl cu sal ah an kai hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An siangpahrang cu thinphang in a tlanhlo dingih an ralbawi pawl cu an ṭihtuknak ah an thantaar hman an tlanhlohsan ding,” tiah a ti. Jerusalem ah an biakmi Bawipa , Zion Tlang ah a meisa in thawinak a kangtertu Bawipa in a sim zo a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nikhat khatah cun a felzet mi siangpahrang a um dingih dingnak thawn hnaṭuantu ram pumpi hotu pawl tla an um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cupawl cu thli le ruah ihsin beunak lungpi bangtuk an si fingfing ding. Anmah cu nelrawn ih a luangmi tiva bangtuk le ramcaar lakih lung tumpi hneemdai bangtuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Misenpi ṭulnak le hai mi ah an mit an meng dingih an hna an thong ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ziang hmuahhmuah cu manhlap in an tuah lo ding; a sinan theihthiamnak thawn an tuah dingih an thinlung ngaingai an ṭong ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zohman in mi aa cu upattlak tiah an ruat lo dingih mi depde pawl cu mifel an ti lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi hmukhmak cun aat-thlakza in a ṭong ih thilṭha lo tuah ding a ruat. A tuah mi le a ṭongmi cu Pathian hmuhsuamnak lawng an si; mi rilrawng pawl a cawm dah loih tihal mi pawl in ding tidai a pe dah fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Miṭha lo a si ih thilṭha lo a tuah; a mibumnak in mifarah siatsuah ding lawng a ngaihtuah ih mizonzai pawl in an covo co lo dingah a kham ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sikhalsehla mifel cun felzet le rintlakzet in thil a tuah ih a hman mi cu a ṭan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nuam zet le daithlang zetih a um mi nannih nunau pawl, ka thusim mi hi ngaihnik uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Atu ahcun lungkimzet le hnangamzet in nan um; a sinan hmaikum atu tikcu ahcun nan bei a dong ding, ziangahtile sabit laak ding zianghman nan neilo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nuamzet le daithlangzet in, donharnak zianghman umlo in nan um zo; a sinan atu cun ṭihphang in khur thlohthlo uh! Nan hnipuan hlit uhla nan taai ah puansia ṭem uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Riahsia in nan ṭaang cuum uh! Ziangahtile lo ṭhazetzet le sabit hmuan pawl cu siatsuah ṭheh an si zo ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />hling le so le hrambur lawng ka minung pawl ih lo sungah an kho a si. Innsungsang nuamzet ih an rak umnak inn pawl hrang le nuamzet ih an umnak khawpi hrangah ṭap in ai ciamco uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siangpahrang inn hman an tlansan dingih ram sungih khawpibik cu a ṭhing reprep ding. Inn pawl le an ralvennak ralhruang pawl cu kumkhua in a siatral ding. Cutawkah hramlak laak an vak dingih tuu pawl an tlang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Pathian in a thlarau kan hnenah a run ṭhum saal ding. Ramṭhing cu ramṭha ah a cang saal dingih lo cun rawl tampi a suak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ramsung khuazakip ah dingnak le diknak lawnglawng tuah a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah in a dik mi an tuah ding ruangah kumkhua in himnak le daihnak a um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian minung ih inn pawl cu daihnak le hnangamnak in a khat dingih thinharnak zianghman a umlo ding. (
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tupi sungah rial a tla dingih khawpi cu balsiat ṭheh a si ding.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ziangtluk lungawinak so mi hmuahhmuah hrangah a si ding, lorawl hrangah tidai a tam ih laak le caw hrangah phannak umlo in tlannak hrampi a tam tikah cun!
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kan raal pawl an cem a si! Thil an ru, mi an zuarthlai; anmah cu zohman in an ramh loih an zuarthlai hai lo! Sikhalsehla ruk an ruknak le mi an zuarthlainak tikcu cu a cem cing ding; ruknak le zuarthlainak a tuartu bik ah an cang thlang ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , in zaangfah hram aw. Na hnen lawngah ruahsannak kan nei. Nikhat hnu ni khat in humhim awla harsatnak sungin in run hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan hnenah ṭangin na do tikah cun miphun dang pawl cu raldonak hmun ihsin an tlanhlo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An thilri pawl cu an lon ih ralthil lon mi ah an canter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa a nasat zia cu! Ziang hmuahhmuah tlunah uktu a si. Jerusalem cu dingnak le felnak in a khahter dingih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ram pumpi cu hnangamzet le hngetzet in a umter ding. A minung pawl cu a hum ringring ih fimnak le thiamnak tla a pek. An ro ṭhabik cu Bawipa an ṭihzahnak hi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ralṭha pawl in bomnak an dil ding. Daihnak um seh tiah khua a khang rero tu ram palai pawl cu nasazetin an ṭap ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ramsung ih lamzin tumpipi cu ṭihnunnak a tam ruangah zohman khual an tlawng ngam lo. Lungkim thukamnak pawl an phiat ṭheh ih thukamnak an tuah mi pawl an balsiat ṭheh zo. Zohman upat mi an nei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An ram cu zohman ih thlawh loin a lawngih a ṭhing reprep. Lebanon ramih tupi pawl cu an vuai ṭheh ih Sharon phairawn ramṭhazet cu nelrawn vekah a cang; Bashan ramah le Karmel Tlang ah thingkung pawl cu an hnah a ṭil ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in miphun pawl hnenah, “Atu cun ka thok thlang ding. Ka cahzia le ka huham neihzia ka langter dingih nan hmu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nan ngaihtuah mi pawl cu zianghman ṭhathnemnak an neiloih nan tuahmi hmuahhmuah cu alak hlir an si. Nanmah le nanmah nan siatsuah aw a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ṭhung tuahnak ih an ur mi lungto vekin a vut ah nan cangṭheh dingih hling an ur ih vutcam ih a can vekin nan ciam ṭheh ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hlat ih um mi siseh, a nai ih um mi siseh, zozo khalin ka thil tuah mi hi thei hai sehla huham ka neihzia hi thei thlang hai seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zion ih a ummi misual pawl cu thinphang in an khur thlohthlo. “Pathian thuṭhennak cu kumkhua alh mi meisa vek a si. Kannih lakah hin cuvek meisa sung ihsin a luat theitu kan um ding maw?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hman mi lawng nan sim ih nan tuah a si ahcun nan luat thei ding. Nan thuneihnak cu mifarah bumnak ah hmang hlah uh; nawhthuh tla ei hlah uh! Laithah tumtu pawl hnenah tel hlah uh; thilṭha lo an tuahnak khalah telve hlah uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuti ih nan um asile nan hlawhtling dingih a hngetzetmi ralhruang bangin nan him ding. Ei ding rawl le in ding tidai nan ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ram kaupi a uktu siangpahrang ih sunlawinak cu na mit in na hmu saal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ramdangmi siahkhawltu le thlingthlatu nan rak ṭihzet mi pawl kha cu a ruah hman nan ruat saal nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihngalzet ramdangmi, an ṭong hman a tican nan theih lomi pawl kha nan hmu saal nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zion hi zohhnik uh, biaknak lamih puai kan tuahnak khawpi hi! Jerusalem hi zohhnik uh! Ziangtluk umnak ṭha le himnak khua so a si! Puanthlam-a ṭhuam an phawi dah lomi le a hri a cat dah lomi bangtuk a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa in a sunlawinak huham in hmuh ding. Tiva kauzet le tivate kiangkapah kan um ding, a sinan kan ral lawng pawl cu cunah an feh lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lawng parih long feh ternak thilri hmuahhmuah cu ziang hmanah an ṭhahnem lo; lawng puan hman an pharh thei lo. Kan ral ralkap pawl ih thilri hmuahhmuah cu lon ṭheh a si ding. Cui thilri cu a tamzet dingih ke-awl pawl khalin covo an ngah thei ding. Bawipa amah cu kan siangpahrang a si ding. Amah in in uk dingih in hum ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kan ramsungih a um mi hmuahhmuah in, “Ka dam lo e,” tiah an ti dah nawn lo dingih an sualnak phunkim cu ngaidam a si ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw miphun hmuahhmuah tla, ra uh! Ra tongkhawm aw uhla ra ngaihnik uh! Leilung pumpi le a tlunih a um mi hmuahhmuah in ra uhla ra ngai uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa cu miphun pawl hmuahhmuah parah le an ralkap pawl parah a thin a heng a si. Siatsuahnak ih thlenter dingin a ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An ruak cu phum an si lo ding; a leengah an thu an ṭawt ding; tlang pawl cu thisen in a sen ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ni, thlapi le arsi pawl an tla dingih leivut ah an cangṭheh ding. Van cu pherzual bangin a zual aw dingih a hlota dingih arsi pawl cu sabit hri le theipi kung an hnah a ṭilh bangin an ṭil ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in vanah a ralnam a taat hriam ih atu ahcun Edom ram le ramsung minung siatsuah ṭheh dingih a ruahcat cia mi pawl parah cuih ralnam cu a rung thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thawinak ih pekmi tuu le me pawl an thah mi thisen le a thau vekin thisen le thau in a ralnam cu a tuam ṭheh ding. Bawipa in hi thawinak cu Bozrah khawpi ah a pek ding. Cuticun Edom ramah nasazet in a that hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cui ram mi pawl cu hramlak cawcang le cawcangte pawl bangtuk in an ril dingih leilung cu thisen in a sen dingih thau in a khuh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi tikcu cu Bawipa in Zion a run caan a si dingih Zion ral pawl parih phu a lak caan a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Edom ram tiva ih tidai pawl cu lawng hnihmi ṭaar-si ah a cang ṭheh dingih leilung cu kaat leilung ah a cang ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A sun a zan in a kang dingih meikhu cu cat loin a suak ding. San khat hnu san khatah an ram cu hnawmpen ramṭhingah a cang dingih zohman an ramsungin khual an tlawng nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sumbuh le tlang-ak umnak ramah a cang ding. Bawipa in, lei le van a seemsuah hlan vekin an ram cu a lawngmi le a ṭhing reprep mi ah a cangter saal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ram uktu siangpahrang a umlo dingih an hotu pawl hmuahhmuah cu an hloral ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hling le so an siangpahrang inn kipah le ralhruang in kulh mi khua kipah a kho dingih cinghnia le sumbuh umnak ah an cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutawkah hramlak ramsa an vak dingih khawsia pakhat le pakhat an sawn aw ding. Zan ih a vak mi khawsia rul tumpi tla colhnak hawl in cutawkah a ra thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sumbuh pawl in bu an tuah dingih ti an ti ding; faate an keuh dingih an cawm ding. Langta tla cutawkah pakhat hnu pakhat an khawm aw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipaió ca-uk sungah a nungmi ramsa thuhla hawl uhla siar hnik uh! Cui ramsa pawl cu hi ram sungih a umlo mi an umlo ding; rualpi neilo khal an umlo ding. Cubangtuk ih si dingah Bawipaió thupek cia mi a si; amah rori in hmunkhat ah a khawm ṭheh hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa amah in ram cu a ṭhensak dingih an covo fingfing a pe hai ding a si. Sankhat hnu sankhat cunah an um dingih kumkhua in anmah ih ta a si ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nelrawn ramṭhing cu a lung a awi ding; Hramlak ah pangpar an par ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nelrawn cu hla a sa dingih lungawi in a au ding; Lebanon Tlang bangin a mawi dingih, Karmel le Sharon ih lo bangin ramṭha a si ding. Zokhal in Pathian sunlawinak cu an hmu ding, A nasatzia le a huham neihzia an hmu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kut caklo pawl cakter uhla, A ṭawnṭai ih a thir mi khuk pawl hngetter uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thinnau mi le beidong mi hnenah, “Cak uhla zianghman ṭih hlah uh; Pathian nanmah run dingah a ra lai, Na ral pawl parih phu lak dingah a ra a si,” tiah sim uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mitcaw pawl in khua an hmu thei dingih, hnaset pawl an hna a vaang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ke-awl mi in an khir an laam dingih, A ṭong theilo mi khal lungawi in an au ding. Nelrawn sungin tidai a luang dingih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A alh mi vunnel cu tili ah a cang ding. Leilung a caar mi cu ticawm in a khat saal ding. Cinghnia an rak um ṭheunak hmunah, Phok le phaipheng tla an kho ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutawkah cun misenpi hrang lam tumpi a um dingih “Thianhlimnak Lamzin,” ti a si ding. Misual pawl cu cuih lamzin ah an feh theilo ding. Cutawkih a fehtu pawl cu mi-aa pawl ih hruaisualnak an tong lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutawkah cun kiosa a um lo ding; Sahraang dang tla in an pal lo ding. Bawipa ih a runsuak mi pawl cu, Hi lamzin thlun in an inn ah an tlung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lungawi sopar tein Jerusalem an thleng ding, Nunnuam zetin hla an sa dingih an au ding. Ninghan riahsiatnak in an luat thlang dingih, Kumkhua in an nun a nuam tata ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siangpahrang Hezekiah in Judah ram a uknak kum hleili kumah Assiria ram siangpahrang Sennakherib in ralhruang in kulh mi Judah ram khua pawl a do ih tampi a lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuihhnu ah a kutthuai ih bawi upabik cu ralkap tampi thawn Judah siangpahrang Hezekiah cu remnak tuahter dingah Lakhish ihsin Jerusalem ah a thlah. Cui a thlah mi bawi cu puan taktu pawl hnaṭuannak lamzin, tlunta tili ihsin tidai an laknak tihriat kiangah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutikah Judah mi upa pathum in an va tong: Siangpahrang inn hnaṭuantu pawl hotu Hilkiah ih fapa Eliakim, zung cazipi Shebna le cazin kaitu Asaf fapa Joah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Assiria ralbawipa cun, “Ziangah so siangpahrang Hezekiah hi amah le amah zum awzet in a um? tihi kan siangpahrang in a thei duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ṭong meenmeen hin ralkap lam cahnak le thiamnak hi a ai-awh thei ding tiah nan ruat maw si? Keimah do dingah hin zo in in bawm ding tiah so nan ruat?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka thei ko, Izipt in in bawm ding tiah nan zum. Sikhalsehla Izipt rinsan cu ziang a bang nan thei maw? Kianghrol ah phaipheng kuang hman vek a si-a kiak ih na kut a lo aat. Izipt siangpahrang an rinsan tikah cun cubangtuk a si ringring ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Asilole Bawipa nan Pathian nan rinsan a si maw? Hezekiah in biakṭheng pakhat lawngah Pathian nan biak ding tiah Judah le Jerusalem mi pawl thu a pekih a dang biakinn le biakṭheng pawl hmuahhmuah a bal ṭheh mi kha nan Pathian biakinn le biakṭheng pawl sokhaw an si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asile kan siangpahrang hmin in thu ka lo tiam pei! Rang thawnghnih ka lo pe ding, a totu dingah minung cuzat na hmu thei ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan Assiria ralkap bawi lakih ralbawi nautabik hman nan tluk lo sokhaw! Cui tlunah Izipt in rangleng le rangpar ralkap pawl in kuat ding nan hei ti lai sapbai!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nan ram ka do ih ka siatsuah hi Bawipaió bomnak a tello ah mawsi nan ruat? Bawipa amah rori in nan ram do dingah le siatsuah dingah i fial a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah Eliakim, Shebna le Joah in cuih ralbawipa hnenah, “Kan hnenah cun Aramaik ṭong in ṭong aw! Kan thei ko sokhaw. Hebru ṭong cun ṭong hlah; phar parih a um mi hmuahhmuah in in ngai a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Assiria ralbawipa cun, “Hi ka thusim mi hmuahhmuah hi nanmah le nan siangpahrang hnen lawngih sim dingah kan siangpahrang in i thlah ah maw nan ruat? Si hlah e; phar parih a totu pawl hnen khalah hi thu hi sim ding ka si; ziangahtile nanmah tla ih nan tuah ding vek thotho in annih khalin an eek an ei dingah an zun an in ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule ralbawipa cu a dingih Hebru ṭong in, a aw neih patawp in a au ih, “Assiria siangpahrang in nan hnenih a ṭongmi hi ngaihnik uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hezekiah in lo bum rero hlah seh, tiah ralrinnak a lo pek a si. Hezekiah cun a lo run theilo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa rinsan dingih a lo forhnak cu lung hlah uh; Bawipa in in run dingih kan khawpi cu Assiria ralkap pawl a laak ter lo ding, tiah zum duh hlah uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hezekiah thu cu zum hlah uh. Assiria siangpahrang in atu ah nan khawpi sung ihsin rasuak in remnak tuah dingah thu a lo pek a si. Nan sabit hri ih sabit cu ei ter nan si ko ding; nan theipi kung ihsin theipi cu nan ei ko dingih nan tikhur in tidai cu nan in ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule kan siangpahrang in nan ram vek rori a si mi ramah a lo umter dingih cutawkah sabitti nan in theinak dingah sabit hri a um ve ko ih sang tuah dingah fang a um ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa in in run ko ding, tiah ruat dingah Hezekiah in nan thinlung cu lo mol rero hlah seh. Assiria siangpahrang in ram tampi a do tikah an ram ih khuavang pawl in an ram an run suak, ti nan thei dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khui ah so Hamath le Arpad khuavang pawl an si ṭheh? Khui ah so Sefarvaim khuavang pawl an um? Zo talin Samaria ram an run maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ram hizat ih khuavang pawl lakah khuavang pakhat talin an ram cu Assiria siangpahrang kut sungin an run maw? An run lo a si ruangah nannih teh nan Bawipa in Jerusalem a run ding tiah ziangtinso nan zum thiam?” tiah a ti ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutikah misenpi cu an dai khepkhep; Siangpahrang Hezekiah ih a rak tiamcia bangin an dai ih zianghman an sawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cule Eliakim, Shebna le Joah cu riahsia in an hnipuan an thlekih Assiria ralbawipa ih ṭong mi hmuahhmuah cu an siangpahrang hnenah an va sim.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siangpahrang Hezekiah in a hnenih an ra sim mi thu cu a theih tikah riahsia in a hnipuan a thlekih buri hnipuan a hruk ih Bawipaió Biakinn ah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule Amoz fapa Isaiah hnenah siangpahrang inn kiltu hotu Eliakim, zung cazipi Shebna le puithiam upa pawl a thlah. Annih khalin buri hnipuan an hruk ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Isaiah hnenih va sim dingah hiti in thu a cah, “Tuihsun cu kan hrangah tuar ni a si. Hremnak kan tuarih ningzahnak kan tong. Nunau pakhat in naute a neizik naón a nu a tha a maltuk lawmmam ruangah a hring theilo mi bangtuk kan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Assiria ram siangpahrang in a nungmi Pathian hmuhsuam dingah a kutthuai bawi pakhat a run thlah. Bawipa na Pathian in hiti ih an hmuhsuamnak cu thei hram sehla a ṭongtu cu hrem hram seh. Curuangah kan minung a taangsun pawl hrangah thla in rak cam sak hram aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isaiah in siangpahrang Hezekiah ih thucahmi a theih tikah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />hiti in thu a khirh, “Assiria mi pawl ih Pathian hmuhsuamnak ṭong an ṭong ruangah na thinlung siat ding a si lo, tiah Bawipa in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa in Assiria siangpahrang cu thu vakvai a theihter dingih cumi ruangah a ramah a kir ding; cule amai ram minung pawl ih kut in a thi ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Assiria ralbawipa cu a kirih, an siangpahrang cu Lakhish in a feh ih a kiangih um mi Libnah khua a do ti a theih tikah siangpahrang tong dingah cunah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Culai ah Ethiopia ram siangpahrang Tirhakah ho in Izipt ralkap pawl cu Assiria ralkap do dingin an ra, tiah thu a thang. Cumi cu Assiria siangpahrang in a theih tikah Judah ram siangpahrang Hezekiah hnenah ca a kuat ih a hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Na rinsan mi na Pathian cun ka kut sungih thlenglo dingin thu a lo sim; a sinan cumicun lo bum hlah seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Assiria siangpahrang in ram pakhatkhat parah ka siatsuah ding, ti ih a ruahcat hnu ahcun ziangtin a tuah ṭheu ti cu na theihcia a si ko. Ka luat thei ding, tiah na ruat mawsi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka pu le ka pa pawl in Gozan, Haran le Rezef khua pawl an rak siat ṭheh ih Betheden mi Telassar ih a um mi pawl an that ṭheh. An khuavang zohman in an run theilo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khui ah so Hamath, Arpad, Sefarvaim, Hena le Ivvah khua pawl uktu siangpahrang pawl an si ṭheh?” tiah a ngan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siangpahrang Hezekiah in cuih cakuat cu a rak thlah mi pawl kut in a lakih a siar. Cule Biakinn ah a feh ih Bawipaió hmaiah ca cu a retih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />thla a cam ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Maw Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian, na siangpahrang tokham parih a totu, nangmah lawng hi Pathian na si ih leilung tlun ram hmuahhmuah uktu na si. Nangmah in lei le van hi na seemsuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , atu ah in run thei awla in run zoh hram aw! Sennakherib in a nungmi Pathian na parih hmuhsuamnak a ṭongmi hmuahhmuah hi run thei ṭheh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , Assiria siangpahrang pawl cun ram tampi an siatsuah ṭheh zo ih an ṭhingter ṭheh ti cu kan thei zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An khuavang pawl Pathian a si lomi khuavang, thing le lungto in tuahcop mi milem pawl khal an ur ṭheh ti kan thei zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Curuangah maw Bawipa , kan Pathian, Assiria mi kut sungin in run hram aw; cuticun leilung tlun miphun hmuahhmuah in nangmah lawng Pathian na si kha an thei ding,” tiah thla a cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule siangpahrang Hezekiah thlacamnak Bawipa ih a lehnak kha Isaiah in a theih tikah Isaiah in Hezekiah hnenah thuthan dingin palai a thlah. Bawipa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Maw Sennakherib, Jerusalem khawpi in a lo hnihsan ih capo hnihsuahsainak meenah a lo tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na hmuhsuam mi le na cam rero mi hi zo a si tiah so na ruat? Israel ih Pathian Thianghlim Keimah sokhaw ka si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na siahhlawh pawl ka hnenah na thlah ih, ‘Ka rangleng pawl thawn tlang saangbik ka neh ih Lebanon Tlangzim khal ka laak a si,’ tiah tluang na khawng. ‘A saangbik sidar thing lakih a saangbik khal ka hau thei; a ṭhabik farthing khal ka hau thei ih tupi sungih a hlatnak bik khal ka thleng thei,’ tiah na porh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />‘Miphundang pawl ramsungah tikhur ka lai ih tidai ka in thei; ka ralkap pawl in Nail Tivapi cu caar ṭheh ko in an pal,’ tiah na porh aw ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Hi pawl hi hlanlaipi ihsin ka rak ngaihtuah cia mi a si ti na thei lo maw? Ka rak tumcia mi cu atu ah ka tuahsuak a si. Keimah in cahnak huham ka lo pek ruangah ralhruang ih kulh mi khua pawl cu hnawmpen ah na canter ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cutawkih a rak umtu pawl cu zianghman thilti theinak an neilo. Thinphang le mangbangin an um meen. Nisuahnak lam ihsin thlisia a hrang mi in a seem mi lo sung hrampi le diphun ih a kho mi hrampi bangtuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sikhalsehla na thu cu a zate in ka thei. Na tuah mi le na fehnak khal ka thei ṭheh. Ka parih na thinhengzia khal ka thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na thinhengnak thuhla ka thei zo ih na tluangkhawnnak tla ka theih ṭheh zo ruangah atu cun na hnar ah sio ka thlaih ding; na kaa ka lo kharh dingih na ratnak lamzin ihsin ka lo kirter ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cule Isaiah in siangpahrang Hezekiah hnenah, “A cang dingmi thil pawl khihhmuhtu cu hiti in a si ding. Tuihkum le hmaikum cu amahte ih a kho mi fang nan ei ding; asinan a kumleh ahcun fang nan ciing thei dingih rawl nan nei ding; sabit hri nan phun dingih sabit rah nan ei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Judah miphun sungin a taangsun cu nan ṭhangso zet ding; leilung thuukpi sung tiang hram a thla ih rah a rah mi thingkung bangtuk nan si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jerusalem le Zion Tlang ah a taangsun mi malte an um ding, ziangahtile Cungnungbik Bawipa in cuti ih cang dingin a tumtah hrimhrim mi a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Assiria siangpahrang thu ahcun Bawipa in hiti in a sim zo: “Hi khawpi sungah a lut lo ding; hi khawpi sungah conkiang pakhat hman a sai lo ding. Hi khawpi kiangkapah ralphaw kengtu ralkap pakhat hman an ra lo ding; cule hi khawpi donak ah a ralhruang lenglam in leisaang a kimvel in a dawl lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hi khawpi sung cu a pal hrimhrim lo ding; a ratnak lamzin ihsin a kir saal ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hi khawpi cu ka ṭan dingih ka hum ding; ka hmin thannak ah le ka siahhlawh David hnenih thukamnak ka tuah zo ruangah hi khawpi cu ka run ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Bawipaió vancungmi pakhat cu Assiria ralkap pawl riah hmunah a feh ih an ralkap thawng zakhat le thawng sawmriat le thawngnga a that. A thaizing khua a vang tikah ralkap cuzat cu an ril teptep; an thi ṭheh riai!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cutikah Assiria siangpahrang Sennakherib cu dungah a siip ih Nineveh khua ah a kir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nikhat ah Sennakherib cu a khuavang Nisrok biakinn sungih a khuavang a biak laiah, a fapa pahnih Adrammelek le Sharezer in an ralnam in an sunthat ih cuihnu ah Ararat ramah an tlan. A fapa dang pakhat Esarhaddon in a ai ah siangpahrang a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Culai ah siangpahrang Hezekiah cu a na ih a thi zikte. Amoz fapa profet Isaiah in a va veh ih, “ Bawipa in a seherhmi hmuahhmuah tuah ṭheh in sim ṭheh seh, a nunglo ding a lo ti. Curuangah thi dingin tiimlaam aw,” tiah a va ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Hezekiah cu phar lamah a herih thla a cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , ka damsung hmuahhmuah ah nangmah rinsan in le rintlakzet in ka lo rian zo ih tuah ding i duhsak mi lawnglawng tuahsuak ka tum ringring cu ciing hram aw,” tiah a ti. Cule nasazet in a ṭap ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in Isaiah hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Hezekiah hnenah va feh awla ‘ Bawipa keimah, na pu David ih Pathian in na thlacamnak cu ka thei ih na mitthli ka hmu zo. Tuihnu kum hleinga ka lo nunter hrih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangmah le hi khawpi cu Assiria siangpahrang kut sung ihsin ka lo luatter dingih hi khawpi cu ka hum ringring ding, a ti,’ tiah va sim aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Isaiah in, “ Bawipa in a thukamnak a kimter ding tinak ah hminsinnak a lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siangpahrang Ahaz ih a tuah mi ni tahnak kha sun hnuah Bawipa in a thlaam cu dunglamah kal hra a kir ter ding,” tiah a ti. A ti vekin a thlaam cu dunglamah kal hra a kir saal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A natnak ihsin Hezekiah a dam sal tikah lungawi thangṭhatnak hla a ngan:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka san ṭhat laitak ah Mithi khua ka thleng ding a si hi, ka ti. Tarkuun ih nunglo dingah ka ruat aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa ka tongsaal nawn lo ding, Midang a nungmi zokhal, tiah ka ruat. Minung umnak hi ram ahcun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka nunnak cu sahcat a si ih a cem ta; An bal mi thlaam bangin. Thiamtlang ihsin an tan mi puan bangin. Pathian in ka nunnak a cemter a sihi, ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zan vaarte nat tuar in ka ṭap ka ai; Kiosa in ka ruh khiak ṭheh sehla cubangin. Pathian in ka nunnak a cemter a sihi, ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka aw cu a diim zetih theih thei a si nawn lo; Thuro bangin ka awn maimai. Vancung lam ka thlirnak ah ka mit an kham ṭheh; Maw Bawipa , hibang harnak sungin i run aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka sim thei mi ziangso a um? Bawipaió tuah mi an si ṭheh si! Ka thin a na tukih ka it thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na hrangah ka nung ding, Na hrang lawngah nun ka duh. I damter awla i nungter hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka thin natnak cu daihnakah a cang ding; Ka nunnak cu ṭihphannak sungin na run. Ka sualnak hmuahhmuah i ngaidam ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mithi khua ihsin zohmanin an lo thangṭhat theilo ding; Mithi pawl in rintlak na sinak cu an ring theilo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A lo thangṭhat tu cu minung pawl an si; Atu ih ka lo thangṭhat bangtuk in. Rintlak na sizia cu pa le pawl in an faate pawl an sim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah in i damter zo; ṭingṭang kan tum dingih Nangmah thangṭhatnak hla kan sa ding. Kan nundam sung hmuahhmuah ah Nangmah cawimawinak cu Na Biakinn sungah kan sa ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Isaiah in siangpahrang cu, “Theipi rah rialdip awla na khuaihli hma ah ben aw; cule na dam ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutikah siangpahrang Hezekiah in, “Biakinn ah ka feh thei saal ding, ti langnak ah ziang khihhmuhnak so a um?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cui caanah Babilon siangpahrang a si mi, Baladan fapa Merodak Baladan in siangpahrang Hezekiah a na ti kha a thei; curuangah ca pakhat le laksawng pakhat a kuat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hezekiah cun Baladan ih palai pawl cu ṭhatein a rak zoh ih a lennak hmuahhmuah a hmuh ṭheh hai. A neih mi a sui le a ngun pawl, rimhmui le zihmui pawl, a ralkap le ralkap thilthuam hmuahhmuah tla a hmuh a si. A thilri retnak inn sungah siseh, a uknak sung hmuahhmuah ah siseh, a neih mi a hmuh lomi pakhat hman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule profet Isaiah cu siangpahrang Hezekiah hnenah a feh ih, “Himi pawl hi khui in so an rat? Na hnenah ziangso an sim?” tiah a sut. Hezekiah cun, “Ram hla zet, Babilon ram in an ra,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isaiah in, “Siangpahrang inn sungah ziangso an hmuh?” ti ih a sut tikah Hezekiah in, “Ziang hmuahhmuah an hmu ṭheh. Thilri retnak inn sungah ka hmuhter lomi thil zianghman a um lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah Isaiah in, “Cungnungbik Bawipa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Na inn sungih a um mi hmuahhmuah, tuihsun tiangin na pu le na pa pawl ih an rak khawl mi thilri le hlawnthil pawl cu Babilon ramih an phurh ṭhehnak tikcu a rathleng ding. Zianghman a taanglo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangmaió tefasin pawl rori hman Babilon ah an hruai dingih Babilon siangpahrang inn ih hnaṭuantu dingah an til an per ding a si,’ a ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cumi cu siangpahrang Hezekiah in a theih tikah a nundam sungah cun daihnak le humhimnak a um ding, ti can ai a si tiah a zum ruangah Hezekiah cun, “ Bawipa hnen ihsin a ra mi thu i sim mi cu thuṭha a si,” tiah a sawn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kan Pathian in, “Ka minung pawl hneem uh, Ka minung pawl hneem hai uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem khua mi pawl tha pe uh. A reizet an tuar zo ih An sualnak cu ngaidam a si zo, tiah sim uh. An sualnak hmuahhmuah ih ruangah Nasazet in daan ka tat hai a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw a thangih, “ Bawipa hrangah Hramlak ramṭhing ah lamzin tuah uh. Kan Pathian hrangah nelrawn ah lamzin sial uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Horkuam hmuahhmuah silhkhah thluh uhla, Tlangsang hmuahhmuah bal ṭheh uh. Tlang pawl cu hmunrawn ah an cang dingih, Leilung bingbo hmuahhmuah rualtein rem thluh an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipaió huham cu a lang dingih, Mi hmuahhmuah in an hmu ding. Bawipa amah rori in a kam zo a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw in, “Au aw!” i ti. Kei in, “Ziang so ka au ding?” tiah ka sut. “Minung cu hrampi bangtuk an si; Hramlak pangpar hnakin reideuh an nung cuanglo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hrampi cu an vuai ih pangpar cu an ziam, Bawipa in an parih thli a hranter tikah cun! Minung cu hrampi hnakin an cak deuh cuanglo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A si, hrampi cu an vuai ih pangpar cu an ziam; Asinain kan Pathian thu cu a hmun ringring a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem, tlang parah hung kai awla, Thuthang ṭha cu hung sim aw. Maw Zion, ring zetin au awla, Thuthang ṭha cu phuang aw. Simsuak aw, zianghman ṭih hlah. Judah ram khawpi pawl hnenah ‘Nan Pathian a ralai a si,’ tiah sim aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa cu a cahnak huham thawn Mi uk dingah a ra lai. A runsuak mi pawl tla a rak hruai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tuu pawl cu tuukhal bangin a kilkhawi ding; Tuu faate pawl cu hmun khatah khawm tahrat in, A kut in a cawi dingih, An nu hnenah nuamte in a fehpi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tipithuanthum khi a suumpi in a tah theitu an um maw? Van khi a khaap in a tah theitu teh an um maw? Zoso leilung tlunih leivut hi a bawm sungah a thun ṭheh thei? Zoso tlangsaang le tlangmual hi cuai in a khai thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hitión tuah aw tiah Bawipa a sim theitu zoso a um? A zirh theitu le ruahnak pe theitu teh an um maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian in zoso thu a ron dah? Zohnen ah so fimnak le theihthiamnak a hawl dah? Thiltuah daan teh zotal in an sim dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipaió hrangah miphun pawl cu zianghman an si lo; Tidai forkhat tluk fang an si. Lamhlatpi ih tikulh pawl tla cu, Leidip fangkhat tlukin an zaang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lebanon tupi sungih ramsa hmuahhmuah cu, Kan Pathian hnenih thawinak pek dingah a tamtuk lo. Tupi sungih thingkung hmuahhmuah khal cu Mei-ur thawinak zanthing hrangah a maltuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leilung tlun miphun hmuahhmuah cu A hrangah zianghman an si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian cu ziangthawn so kan ṭhim thei ding? Ziang a bang ticu ziangtinso kan rel thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kutzungthiam pawl ih tuah mi milem, Sui sertu pawl ih sui in an khuut mi, Ngunkheng sungih an toh mi bangtuk a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sui le ngun a neilo tu cun A siat ol lomi zanthing an hril. Kutzungthiam pakhat a hawl ih A tlu lo dingmi milem a tuah ter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nan hmu lo maw? Nan thei dah lo maw? Reipi ihsin sim cia nan si lo maw? Leilung ziangtin a thok ticu nan thei zo lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Leitlun le van leengah A siangpahrang tokham parih a totu in a tuah a si. A thuai ih milai pawl cu a mithmuh ah sihte tia fang an si. Van khi puan bangin a pharh ih Minung umnak ah puanthlam bangin a zaar a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amah in uktu cakzetzet cu a thlak ih Thulolak ah a tuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Anmah tla cu thingkung note Hram neilo a suak pekte bangtuk an si. Culai ah Bawipa in thli a hran ter, An caar ṭheh ih fangkungro bangin a semhlo ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian thianghlim cu zo thawn so kan tahṭhim thei ding? Amah a bangtu zotal an um maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Van khi hun zohhnik uh! Nan hmuh mi arsi hmuahhmuah khi zoso a tuah? Ralkapbu an ho vekin hi arsi pawl a ho tu cun ziangzat an si, ti a thei ih an hmin in a ko fingfing a si. A huham cu a nasa ngaingai ih Pakhat te hman an hlo dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Maw Israel, ziangah so nan phunzai ih Bawipa in kan harnak in theihsak lo, Kan hrangah thil a tawlrel ṭha lo, tiah nan ti?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nan hmu lo maw? Nan thei dah lo maw? Bawipa cu kumkhua ih a hmun mi Pathian a si. Leilung hmuahhmuah tuahtu a si. Anih cu thabaang le thacem in a um dah lo; A ruahnak cu theih ban ding rual a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A baang mi le thacem mi pawl cu an tha a cakter saal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mino pawl hman an baang dingih Tlangval khal an tha cem in an sawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Bawipa a rinsan tu cu An tha a tlung saal ding. Muvanlai vekin thlapharh in an zam ding. An tlan khalle an tha a baang lo ding; An feh rero khalle thacem in an sawn dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian in, “A hlatpi ih um mi ram pawl, Dai zirziar in um uhla ka sim mi hi ngaihnik uh! Thurelnak hmunah nan thu cu rak keng uh. Nan thuhla relnak tikcu nan ngah ding. Ra uhla zoso a hman ti kan ruat tlang hnik pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mi hmuahhmuah nehtu cu zoso nisuahnak lamin a rak hruai? A fehnak kipah zo in so nehnak a pek? Miphun tampi le siangpahrang tampi tlunah zo in so nehtu a siter? A neh mi pawl cu leivui sihaisehla cubangin a ralnam in a sah thlak! Fangkungro cu thli ih a semhlo bangin a conkiang in a ṭhekdarh ṭheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An dungin a dawi, himdam zetin a feh vivo! Leilung hman a dai manlo titlak in a zamrang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiti ih a ngaihtuahtu cu zoso a si? Leilung tlun thuanthu ih cang dingin a tumtu cu zoso a si? Bawipa keimah cu a hramthok ah ka rak um zo; Bawipa Pathian keimah cu a netnak khalah ka um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Lamhlatpi ram pawl in ka thiltuah mi cu an hmu zo; An ṭih ngaingai ih an thinphang in an ṭhia. Curuangah hmun khatah an tongkhawm aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kutzungthiam pawl tla an bawm aw ih Pakhat le pakhat tha an pe aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lettama in sui sertu hnenah ‘Sui tuah na thiam zet,’ a ti. Milem ngilzet ih a deengtu in Tlawngkhen in a kaikomtu cu a lom. Mi pakhat in ‘Na erh mi cu aṭha a si,’ a ti ih Hngetzetin milem cu an retnak hmunah tlawngkhen in an kheng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Sikhalsehla nang Israel ka siahhlawh, Nang cu ka lo hrilzo mi na si. Ka rual Abraham ih tefa sin nan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leilung netnak in ka lo hruai; Vanhram deng ihsin ka lo ko ih, ‘Nang cu ka siahhlawh na si,’ ka lo ti. Ka lo hnong lo, ka lo hril sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zianghman ṭih hlah, na hnenah ka um a si. Keimah cu na Pathian ka si, zianghman in lo phangter hlah seh. Ka lo bawm dingih ka lo cakter ding; Ka lo hum dingih ka lo run ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Na parih thinhengtu pawl cu Mual an pho dingih ningzah an tuar ding. Nangmah a lo dotu cu an thi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cat lo ih a lo dotu pawl cu Leilung ihsin an hloral ta ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keimah cu Bawipa na Pathian ka si; Na tha ka lo cakter ih, ‘Zianghman ṭih hlah; ka lo bawm ding,’ tiah ka lo ti,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw Israel, miphun fate le mi ṭawnṭai na si. Asinain zianghman ṭih hlah, ka lo bawm ding. Israel ih Pathian Thianghlim keimah cu a lo runtu ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangmah cu fang vuaknak fung, a thar, a hriam mi ha a nei mi bangtuk ah ka lo tuah ding. Tlangsang pawl na ciil dingih an siat ding; Tlangmual pawl tla leivut ah an cangṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Van ah na khirh hai dingih Thli in a semhlo ding; Thlisia in khuazakip ah a ṭhekdarh ding. Asinain keimah hi na Pathian ka si ruangah nang cu na lung a awi ding. Israel ih Pathian Thianghlim hi i thangṭhat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Ka minung pawl mangbang vansaangin an um ih Tihal in an dang a caar tikah, Bawipa keimah in an thlacamnak cu ka thei ding; Israel ih Pathian keimah cun ka dungtun dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tlangcar lakih sin tiva an puut dingih Phairawn in cerhti fim an luang ding. Nelrawn cu ticawm in ka khahter dingih Ramcaar cu cerhti luannak ah ka canter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nelrawn ah sidar zanthing ka kho ter ding, Lawithing, lenhmui le olif thing tla ka kho ter ding. Leenkolh ah tupi ka umter dingih cuih tupi ahcun farthing, hualthing le tufar thing an kho ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cumi cu mi in an hmuh tikah Bawipa keimah ih tuah mi a si kha an thei ding. Israel ih Pathian thianghlim in hi hmuahhmuah cu a cangter a si tikha an theithiam thlang ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel siangpahrang, Bawipa Pathian in; “Miphun hmuahhmuah ih khuavang pawl, Nan thuhla cu rel hnik hmeen uh! Nan thiam tawkin sim hnik uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinah ra uhla thil a cang dingmi simcia hnik uh; Thil a cangzo mi pawl ih tican in simfiang hnik uh. Cule hmailam ih thil a cangmi a um tikah a tican kan theih theinak dingah, ziangti zawng in so a kim ding, ti in simfiang hnik uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hmailam ih a ra dingmi thuhla in sim uh; Cuticun khuavang ngaingai nan si kan thei ding. Thilṭha pahnih khat tal tuah hnik uh, Asilole thihnak thupoimawh thlenter hnik uh. ṭihnak le tuksumnak in in khahter hnik uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nanmah siseh, nan thiltuah mi siseh, thuphan hlir nan si! Nanmah a lo biatu pawl le fihnungza an si fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Nisuahnak lamih a um mi pakhat ka hril zo; Saklam ihsin do dingah ka hruai ding. Mi uktu pawl cu ciarbek vekin a pal, Beel tuahtu ih tlak a pal bangin a palbeek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hi thil a cang ding, tiah in simcia theitu zotal nan um maw? Nan hman ngai a sihi, kan ti dingah zotal nan um maw? Cubangtuk a ṭongtu zohman nan um lo; ṭong kamkhat hman nan ṭong lo, Nan ṭong a theitu pakhat te hman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Keimah Bawipa cu Zion hnenih hi thuthang a phuang tu hmaisabik ka si. Jerusalem hnenah palai ka thlah ih, ‘Na minung an ra ding! an rakir ding a si,’ tiah sim dingin ka fial a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nan khuavang pawl ka zoh tikah Pakhat hman in zianghman an ṭong lo. Ka thusuh mi a let theitu zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi khuavang pawl hi thulolak hlir an si; An tuah thei mi zianghman a um lo. An milem pawl hi mi ṭawnṭai le huham neilo hlir an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ka siahhlawh cu hinah a um; Amah cu ka cak ter mi le ka hrilmi a si, A parah ka lung a awi. Ka thlarau in ka khah ter zo ih Miphun hmuahhmuah hnenah thuding a thleng ter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A au lo dingih a aw tla a saang lo ding; Lamzin khalah ringzet zetin thu a sim lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A sawn i a kiak zik mi phaikung a khiak lo ding, A mit zik mi mei inn khal a hmit lo ding. Mi hmuahhmuah hnenah kumkhua in thuding a thleng ter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A bei a dong lo dingih a thin tla a nau lo ding; Leilung tlunah thuding a leeng ter ding. Lamhlapi ram pawl in a thuzirh mi cu an hngakhlap ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in van tla khi a seemsuah ih a pharh; Leilung le nunnak a nei mi thil hmuahhmuah a tuah. Minung hnenah nunnak le thaw a peek. Bawipa Pathian in a siahhlawh hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“ Bawipa keimah in ka lo ko ih huham ka lo peek, Leilung tlunah thuding a leennak dingah. Nangmah sungin mi hmuahhmuah thawn thukamnak ka tuah ding. Nangmah sungin miphun tampi hnenah tleunak ka thlenter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mitcaw pawl ih mit cu na vaangter dingih, A thim mi thawnginn sungih a to mi pawl cu na luat ter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Keimah lawng hi Bawipa na Pathian ka si. Ka huham cu khuavang dang ka hlawm lo ding, Ka sunlawinak khal milem pawl ka ṭhen lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ra thleng ding ti ih ka rak simcia mi cu An thleng ngaingai zo. Atu ahcun thil thar ka lo sim ding, An thlen hlan ihsin ka lo sim cia ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa hnenah hla thar sa uh; Leilung pumpi in amai thangṭhatnak hla sa uh. Tifinriat parih a fehtu pawl in amah cu thangṭhat uh; Tifinriat sungih a um mi pawl khalin thangṭhat uh. Lamhlapi ramah a um mi khalin thangṭhat cio uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nelrawn le nelrawn khua pawl in Pathian cu cawimawi hai seh. Kedar mi pawl khalin cawimawi hai seh! Sela khua ih a um mi in tlangsaang parih sin lungawi in au ciamco hai seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lamhlapi ih a um mi pawl in Bawipa hnenah thangṭhatnak le sunlawinak pe hai seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa cu micak bik bangin a feh; Raldo dingah a timtuah ih a hngakhlap zet a si. Raldo dingah a au ih neh dingah a au ciamco. A ral pawl hnenah a huham a hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian in, “Tikcu reipi daiteón ka um zo; Ka minung pawl ka sawn lo. Atu cun ka thok thlang ding; Nau nei ding nunau bangin ka hruum ka ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tlangmual le tlangsaang pawl ka siatsuah ding; Hrampi le thingkung pawl ka caar ter ṭheh ding. Tiva horkuam pawl cu nelrawn ah ka tuah dingih, Ticawm pawl ka kaang ter ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ka minung mitcaw pawl ka hruai ding; An feh dah lonak lamzin ihsin. An khuathimnak cu tleunak ah ka thleng ding; An hmai ih zin bingbo cu ka ngilter ṭheh ding. Hi pawl cu ka tuah tengteng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Milem a rinsantu pawl le Cui milem pawl ka pathian a ti tu cu an ning a zak dingih mual an pho ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Nannih hnaset pawl, ṭhatein ngaihnik uh! Nannih mitcaw pawl, naihten zohhnik uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka siahhlawh hnakih mit a caw sawn an um pei maw? Palai ka thlah mi hnakih hnaset sawn an um pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Maw Israel, na hmuh mi le na ton mi hi a tamzet zo; Asinain na hrangah zianghman santlai an si lo. Theihnak ah hna na nei; Asinain na theih fel ngaingai mi ziangso a um?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa cu mi run ding a hiarzet tu Pathian a si; Curuangah a daan le a thuzirh mi kha a sunloih ih, A minung pawl khalin upat hai seh ti a duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a minung pawl cu mi in an ram; Leilung kua sungah an khum ih, Thawnginn hlatpi ah an thup hai a si. Thilri ram mi le lon mi an si; Anmah humtu dingah zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hi thuhla hi a theitu zotal nan um maw? Tuihnu cun ṭhatein nan ngai thlang lo ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel hi mi ramtu pawl kutih a petu hi zoso a si? Bawipa amah a si; Kan dodal ih a parah sualnak kan tuah mi Bawipa a si. A duhnak vekin kan nung thei lo; A thupekmi vekin kan thlun thei fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Curuangah a thinhengnak in tuarter ih, Raldo harsatnak in tongter a si. A thinhengnak cun meisa bangin Israel ram pumpi a kang; Sikhalsehla ziang a cang rero ti kan thei dah lo; Hi hmuahhmuah ihsin zianghman kan zir ngah mi a um cuang lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Israel, nangmah a lo tuahtu Bawipa in, “Zianghman ṭih hlah-ka lo hum ding; Na hmin in ka lo ko zo-ka ta na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thukmi tidai sungih na feh khalle na hnenah ka um ding. Na ton mi harsatnak pawl hin a lo neh lo ding. Meisa sungih na feh khalle na kaanglo ding. Hremnak harsa khal in a lo na ter lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ziangahtile keimah cu Bawipa nan Pathian ka si. A lo runtu, Israel ih Pathian thianghlim ka si. Nangmah luatter duh ah Izipt ka hnong sawn pei; Ethiopia le Seba khal ka dungtun sawn pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na nunnak run duh ah miphun tampi ka hnong sawn pei; Ziangahtile nang cu ka hrangah na sunglawi. Ka lo duhdawt ih upatnak ka lo pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zianghman ṭih hlah aw-na hnenah ka um a si. “Lamhlapi nisuahnak le nitlaknak ihsin, Na minung pawl ka rak hruai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anmah thlah dingin saklam cu ka sim dingih, Anmah hreng nawnlo dingin thlanglam cu ka fial ding. Ram hlapipi ihsin ka minung pawl cu rakir hai seh; Leitlun khuazakip in ra tlung hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keimaió minung an si ih, Sunloihnak i petu dingih ka seemsuah mi an si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian in, “Ka minung pawl cu thuṭhennak zungah ko uh; Mit an nei naón mitcaw an si. Hna an nei naón hnaset an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Miphun dang pawl cu thuṭhennak hmunah ko hai uh; An khuavang lakah hmailam thusim theitu an um maw? Atu ih thil cangmi pawl hi zoso a rak simsung dah? Hi khuavang pawl hin kan sim mi cu a hman ih Kan thu cu thudik a si, ti langternak ah thutheih pitu rak suahpi hai seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Maw Israel mi pawl, nanmah hi ka thu theitu nan si; Keimah i riantu phun ih ka lo hrilmi nan si. Cuticun keimah cu in thei dingih in zum ding; Keimah lawng Pathian ka si kha in theithiam ding. Keimah siarlo Pathian dang a um lo; A um dah loih a um dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Keimah pakhat lawng hi Bawipa ka si. A lo run theitu ding cu keimah lawng ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A cang dingmi ka rak simcia zo; Cule nangmah bawm dingah ka ra a si. Cubangtuk ih a tuahtu ramdang khuavang an um lo; Nanmah hi ka thu theitu nan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keimah cu Pathian ka si ih ka si kumkhua ding. Ka huham sung ihsin zohman an luat lo ding. Ka tuah mi cu zohmanin an thleng theilo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel ih Pathian thianghlim, a lo runtu Bawipa in, “Nanmah luatter dingah Babilon ah ralkap ka thlah ding; An khawpi kotka pawl ka siatbal ṭheh ding, An minung awn-aunak cu ṭahnak ah a cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keimah hi Bawipa nan Pathian thianghlim cu ka si. Maw Israel, a lo seemsuahtu ka si ih, Keimah hi na siangpahrang ka si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khuahlan laiah Bawipa in, Tifinriat sungin lamzin a rak tuah. Tiherh lakah lamzin a umter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A cakzet le a makzet mi ralkapbu cu a hloral ter ṭheh; Rangleeng le rangpar ralkapbu pawl cu! An ril ih an tho nawn lo; Meifar kan mih vekin an mit ta a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Bawipa in, “Dunglam thil lawnglawng ngaihtuah hlah uh; Hlanlai thuhla lawng ruat hlah uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thilthar ka tuah dingmi ṭhatein thlir uh. Atu khalah an um rero thlang-nan hmu thei ding. Hramlak ramṭhingah lamzin ka tuah ding, Cutawkah tidai nan hrangah ka luan ter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hramlak ramsa hman in in ṭihzah ding; Cinghnia le saam-ar in in thangṭhat ding, Ka hrilmi ka minung pawl hrangah Nelrawn ih tiva kan luan ter tikah cun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keimah hrangih ka tuah mi miphun an si; Keimaió thangṭhatnak hla in an sa ding!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw Israel, nan biakmi cu kei ka si ual lo; Kei cu in ning a sisi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mei-ur thawinak ih tuu cu ka hnenah nan keng lo; Nan saserh thawinak in nan cawimawi mi cu Kei ka si lo. Thil pek ding lo ngen in nan thil ka rit ter lo. Rimhmui lo dil in ka lo rethei ter lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka hrangah rimhmui nan lei lo; Nan ṭilva ih thau in in tlai ter fawn lo. Nan sualnak in ka thil in rih terih, Thilṭha lo nan tuah mi in ka thin in baangter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cubangtuk a sinan, nan sualnak a malh ṭheh tu Pathian cu Keimah thotho ka si! Keimah ka si ruangah hibangtuk in ka tuah a si. Nan mawhnak cu ka ciing ringring lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thuṭhennak zungah feh hnik uhsi; Mi mawhthluknak nan neih mi rak keng hnik uh. Nan felnak langter dingah nan thu cu sim hnik uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nan pu le nan pa pawl an rak sual; Nan hotu pawl tla ka parah an sual zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nan ram uktu pawl in ka hmun thianghlim an borhhlawh ter; Curuangah Israel parah siatsuahnak ka thlenter; Ka minung pawl midang hmuhsuam dingih a tuahtu cu Keimah ka si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw Israel, ka siahhlawh, Ka hrilmi, Jakob tefa pawl, ngaihnik uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keimah hi a lo seemsuahtu Bawipa ka si. Na nunnak a seem vete in ka rak lo bawm zo. Zianghman ṭih hlah; i riantu ka siahhlawh na si. Ka hrilmi, ka duhdawt mi na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tidai a haal mi ramah tidai ka pe ding; Nelrawn ah tiva ka luanter ding. Nan faate pawl parah ka thlarau ka burh dingih Nan tefa sin par khalah ka malsawmnak ka burh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ṭhazet ih tidai a ngah mi hrampi bangin an ṭhang dingih, Tivakap ih partiam kung bangin an hniing ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Pakhat hnu pakhat mi in ‘Kei khal Bawipaió mi ka si,’ an ti ding. Israel mi pawl an ra fin vivo ding. An baan parah Bawipaió hmin an ngan fingfing dingih, Pathian ih minung ah an siar aw ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel a uktu le a humtu Bawipa , Cungnungbik Bawipa cun, “keimah cu hmaisabik le netabik ka si; Keimah siarlo Pathian dang a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka tuah mi a tuah theitu zotal an um maw? Caan a rak thoktir ihsin a netnak tiang, Thil a cang ding hmuahhmuah a simcia theitu an um maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka minung pawl, zianghman ṭih hlah uh! Khua hlanlai ihsin tuihsan tiang a cang ding hmuahhmuah a hlankhan in ka rak simcia zo; Cui thu cu nan thei ih keimai thutheih pitu nan si. Pathian dang zotal an um maw? A cak mi Pathian, ka theih dah lomi teh an um maw?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Milem a tuahtu minung pawl cu zianghman an si lo; cule an uar zetmi le an sunloih zetmi an khuavang pawl khal cu santlailo hlir an si. Hi khuavang a biatu le a upat tu cu mi aa le mitcaw pawl an si ih ningzahnak an tong ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Biak dingah thir in khuavang tuah cu zianghman a ṭhahnem lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cui khuavang a biatu hmuahhmuah cu an ning a zak leh ding. Milem a tuahtu pawl cu minung lawng an si. Zianghman an si lo. Ra hai sehla an thuṭhennak hmunah ra ding hnik hai seh. An ṭih dingih ningzahnak an tuar ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sodengpa in thir tankhat a lakih meivam sungah a vaam ter. A cak mi a baan in sobul a lakih pianhmang nei tiangin a deen. Cuti ih a ṭuannak ah a ril a rawng, a ti a haal ih a baang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule lettama pakhat in zanthing a tah. Miphiu in zuk pungsan a suai; zipaw a ṭhut ih a hriamhrei in a ṭuan. Biakinn sungih ret dingah minung pianhmang in a tuah; minung pianhmang mawizet ah a tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cumi tuah dingah sidar thing maw, sasua kung maw, farthing maw tupi ihsin a hau ih a hmang. Asilole sidar thing a phun ih ruahpi ih ṭhanter dingin a hngak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Minung in thingkung a hrek cu tihthing ah a hmangih a hrek cu milem tuahnak ah a hmang. Thing a hrek cun meisa a tuah ih a khuahlumnak ah a ai ih sang tla a rawh. A dang a hrek cun milem a tuah ih a biak:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zanthing hrekkhat cu meisa ah a muah; sa tla a em ih a ei ih a tlaizet hngin. Meisa ai tahratin, “A hlum a va nuam so! Ka meisa ṭhat daan cu!” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zanthing hrekkhat cun milem a tuah. A hmaiah a kun ih a biak. A hnenah, “Nangmah hi ka pathian na si. I run hram aw,” tiah thla a cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cubangtuk minung pawl cu an aa tukih ziang a si kan tuah ti hman an thei lo. Thutak le thuhman lamah cun an mit an siing ih an thinlung a pit a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Milem siamtu in, “Zanthing a hrek cu meisa ah ka ur ṭheh. Meivam parah sang ka rawh ih sa ka em ih ka ei. A dang zanthing cu milem ah ka tuah. Cui zanthing tan tankhat hmaiah cun atu hi ka kuun rero a sihi!” ti ruahnak le ngaihtuahnak malte hman a neilo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vutcam ei vekih tican neilo a si. A thinlung aa in zin peengah a hruaihlo ih bom thei ding a si nawn lo. A kutih a pom mi milem cu pathian a si ual lo, ti hman a thei thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw Israel, hi thil pawl hi ciingṭha aw; I riantu na si hi hngilh hlah. I riantu si dingah ka lo seemsuah ih, Ziangtik hmanah ka lo hngilh lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na sualnak cu mero a kian bangin ka kianter zo. Ka hnenah rasal aw; A lo runtu cu keimah ka si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Maw van tla, lungawi in au uh! Leilung thuuk mi pawl, au cio uh! Tlang le tupi sung zanthing hmuahhmuah khal lungawi aipuang in au cio uh! Bawipa in a nasatnak langter tahratin A minung Israel a run zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Keimah cu Bawipa ka si; a lo seemsuahtu le Runtu ka si. Keimah hi Bawipa cu ka si; thil hmuahhmuah seemsuahtu ka si. Van tla khi keimah lawngin ka pharh; Leilung ka tuah tikah zohmanin in bawm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kutṭial zohthiam pawl cu mi-aa ah ka tuah ih, Arsi zohthiam pawl ih ṭong cu thuphan ah ka cangter. Mifim pawl ih ṭong cu ka el pit ih, An fimnak cu aatnak a sizia ka langter ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ka siahhlawh in a cang dingmi thil a simcia ih, Ka tumtah mi phuang dingah palai ka thlah tikah cun, Cui a sim mi le ka tumtah mi cu ka kimter rori a si. Jerusalem hnenah, ‘Minung an um saal ding a si,’ tiah ka ti. Judah khawpi hnenah, ‘A thar in saksal nan si ding,’ ka ti. Hi khawpi pawl cu hnawmpen sung ihsin an ding saal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thu ka pekih Tipithuanthum ka caarter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cule Sairas hnenah, ‘Nangmah cu ka ai-ah uktu na si ding. Tuahter ka lo duh mi na tuah ding: Jerusalem cu saksaal dingah thu na pe dingih Biakinn ih innhram thoksaal dingah thu na pe ding,’ ka ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sairas cu Bawipaió hrilmi siangpahrang a si! Bawipa in ram tampi nehtu dingah ṭuanvo a pek. Siangpahrang tampi an huham long dingah a thlah. Bawipa in a hrangah khawpi kotka pawl a on sak ding. Bawipa in Sairas hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Keimah rori in na fehnak lamzin ka sial ding; Tlangsang le tlangmual pawl ka rawnter ding. Daar ih tuah mi kotka pawl ka khiak dingih Thir kotkalh pawl cu ka tan ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thimnak le a thupnak hmunih sumsaw pawl ka lo pe ding; Cuticun keimah hi Bawipa ka si cu na thei dingih, Israel ih Pathian in a lo hril a si, tihi na thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka siahhlawh Israel bawmtu dingah ṭuanvo ka lo pe; Ka hrilmi minung pawl bawmtu dingah. Keimah cu i theilo naón, Upatnak tumpi ka lo pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Keimah hi Bawipa ka si, Pathian dang zohman an um lo. Nang cun i theilo naón, Na hai mi thazaang cahnak ka lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khatlam vanhramdeng ihsin khatlam vanhramdeng tiang, Mi hmuahhmuah in keimah hi Bawipa ka sinak le Pathian dang khuihman ih a um lo zia, An theih ṭhehnak dingah hibangtuk in ka tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tleunak le thimnak tuahtu ka si. Thlawsuahnak le thihhloh poimawhnak suahtertu khal ka si. Hi hmuahhmuah a tuahtu cu Bawipa keimah ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nehnak cu van ihsin ruah bangin ka sur ter ding. Leilung in cucu a rak pom dingih, Dingnak le luatnak thawn a mum dingih a par ding. Bawipa keimah in cubangtuk in ka cangter ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Beel dang vek thotho a si mi tlakbeel pakhat in Beel tuahtu kha thu a el ngam pei maw? Tlak in beel tuahtu kha, “Ziang so na tuah rero hi?” a ti dah maw? Beel in beel tuahtu ih zung mawilonak cu a soi dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zotal in a nu le a pa hnenah, “Ziangah so hiti vekin in tuah?” a ti ngam dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel ih Pathian thianghlim, Hmailam thil um ding daan a sersiamtu Bawipa cun, “Ka faate pawl thuhla ahcun i soisel theinak thu na neilo; Ka kut tuahnak khalah thu i pe theilo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leilung pumpi a tuahtu cu keimah ka si ih A parih um dingah minung cu ka seem ter. Ka cahnak in van tla khi ka pharh ih, Ni le thlapi le arsi pawl khi ka uk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sairas a forhsuak tu cu keimah ka si; A ṭha lomi rem dingih ka tumtahnak ṭuansuaktu dingah! A fehnak lamzin cu ka dingter ding. Ka khawpi Jerusalem cu a dinter saal dingih Sal taangmi ka minung pawl a luatter ding. Hi bangtuk tuah dingah zohman in a hlawhman an pe lo, Nawhthuh khal an pe lo a si,” tiah a ti. Cungnungbik Bawipa in a sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel hnenah, “Izipt le Ethiopia lennak cu na ta an si ding; Seba mi khaansaang pawl cu na sal an si dingih Thir cikcin thawn an lo thlun ding. Na hmaiah an lu an kuun dingih, ‘Pathian in a lo umpi-Amah lawng hi Pathian a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel ih Pathian, a minung pawl a runtu cu, A thup aw mi Pathian a si,’ tiah an phuang ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Milem a tuahtu hmuahhmuah cu an ning a zak ding; An zate in mual an pho ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asinain Israel cu Bawipa in a hum zo; A mi nehnak cu kumkhua daih a si; A minung pawl cu mual an pho dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa in van tla khi a tuah! Amah cu Pathian a si. Amah in leilung hi a seemter ih leilungah a tuah! Reizet daih ding le hngetzet in a tuah. Ramṭhing le nelrawn hlir ah a tuah lo; Asinain milai umnak tlak ramah a tuah a si. Amah in, “Keimah cu Bawipa ka si; Pathian dang khuihman ah a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thupte in ka sim lo, Ka tumtah mi khal hmuh theilonak ah ka thup lo. ‘Ramṭhing le nelrawn ah i hawl uh,’ tiah Israel mi pawl ka ti dah lo. Keimah hi Bawipa cu ka si ih thutak ka sim. Thudik ka phuang a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ra hnik uh, leilung miphun pawl, Ram uknak a cem ṭheh hnu ih a taangmi pawl, Hmunkhatah ra hnik uh. Nan thuṭhennak hmunah rasuak ciar hnik uh. Zanthing ih tuah mi milem pawl a vahpi rero tu, Anmah a run theilotu khuavang hnenih thlacam tu pawl, Himi pawl cun zianghman theihnak an neilo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nan thuṭhennak hmunah nan thu cu ra rel hnik uh! Thuneitu pawl cu pakhat le pakhat ron aw hai seh! Hlanlaipi ihsin hi thil pawl hi a cang ding a si, tiah a rak simcia tu cu zoso a si? A minung pawl a runtu Pathian, Bawipa keimah ka si lo maw? Pathian dang zohman an um lo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Leilung tlun minung hmuahhmuah tla, Keimah lam hoikir uhla runak nan ngah ding. Keimah lawng Pathian ka um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka sim mi hi thudik a si ih, a thleng aw dah lo ding. Ka hmin sal in thu ka kam a si: Mi hmuahhmuah an ra dingih ka hmaiah khuk an bil ding. Ka hmaiah thu an kam aw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Ka hnen lawngah nehnak le cahnak cu a um, tikha an phuang cio ding. Asinain i huatu cu ningzahnak an tuar ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bawipa keimah in Jakob tefa sin pawl cu ka run dingih thangṭhatnak in pe ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Babilon ih khuavang pawl cu an cem a si! Khuahlanah Bel le Nebo an rak biak mi an si; Atu ahcun laak parah an suang ih, ṭilva baang tertu thilrit ah an cang zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cubangtuk in an khuavang pawl cu an cem a si. Milem pawl cu anmah le anmah an run aw thei lo. An kaih ih an phurh hlo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Maw Jakob tefa sin pawl, i ngaihnik uh; Ka minung sung ihsin a taangsun pawl. Nan seem vete in ka kilkhawi mi nan si ih, Nan suahthlak vete in ka cangcawi mi nan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nan Pathian ka si ih ka lo kil ringring ding, Na ṭuakpar le na tarkuun tiang ka lo cangcawi ding a si. Ka lo tuah ih ka lo kilveng ringring ding; Bomnak ka lo pe dingih ka lo hum ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Zothawn so in ṭhim ding? Keimah bangtu an um maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi in an paisa bawm an ongih an sui an buur; An ngun cu cuai in an thlai. Sui sertu an saangih milem an tuahter; Cui hmaiah an kuun ih an biak!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An liangah an hun khai ih an phur; Hmun pakhat ah an retih cutawkah a ding ringring. A umnak ihsin hmundangah a ceer thei lo. A hnenih thla an cam tikah a sawn thei lo, Harsatnak sung khalin a hum theilo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Maw misual pawl, hihi ruat ṭha uh! Ka thil tuahcia mi hi ngaihtuah ṭha hnik uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thil a cangcia mi pawl kha vun mang saal hnik uh! Keimah lawng Pathian ka si kha thei uh; Keimah bangtuk zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hramthok ihsin ziang a cang ding ti cu ka rak sim cia zo; Khuahlanlai ihsin a cang dingmi cu ka relcia zo a si. Ka tumtah mi cu a pelh dah lo ding, ka ti. Tuah ka tum mi hmuahhmuah cu ka tuah ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nisuahnak lam ihsin mi pakhat ka ko lai; Khaute bangin a rung zam dingih Ka khawkhan cia mi pawl cu a tisuak ṭheh ding. Ka sim zo vekin tuahsuak a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“I ngaihnik uh, nannih mi lungruh pawl, Nehnak cu a hlatzet hrih lai, ti ih a ruat tu pawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nehnak ni cu ka rak kengih a thlengzik thlang; A hlat nawn lo a si. Ka mi nehnak cu zohman in an tlaiter thei lo ding; Jerusalem cu ka hum dingih, Cutawkih Israel mi hnenah hminthannak ka pe ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw Babilon, Na siangpahrang tokham ihsin rung ṭum awla, Leilung par leivut lakah hin rung to aw. Na sanlai ahcun fala vek na si; zohmanih neh lo khawpi! Asinain atu ahcun falano le fala taksa neem na si nawnlo. Sal na si thlang!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Fang rialnak lungtumpi cu her aw! Fang rial aw! Na hmai khuhnak puan paate cu hlit thlang aw; Na hnipuan ṭhaṭha cu phuak thlang aw. Tiva tan dingin na hni hlit aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Namthlak mi le ningzak in, Taklawng um mi salnu bangin, Mi in an lo hmu thlang ding. Na parah phu ka lak dingih Zohman in in kham theilo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel ih Pathian thianghlim in in luatter zo; Amaió hmin cu Cungnungbik Bawipa a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in Babilon hnenah, “Daite in khuathim sungah to meen aw! Mi in ‘Ram kipih Lalnu,’ an lo ti nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka minung parah ka ai a thok; Ka minung lo vekin ka tuah a si. Na cahnak le na huham sungah ka thlak hai ih An parah zaangfahnak zianghman na nei lo; Nutar le patar pawl hman na tisiat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalnu ka si ringring ding, tiah na rak ruat ih Thildang cungcang cu na ngaihtuah dah lo. Ziangtin so a neet leh ding, tikhal na ruat lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“ṭhatein ngaihnik, nang nomnak lawng a duhtu; Nang ka hnget ka him ti ih a ruattu, ruatṭha hnik. Pathian tluk tuum ah na rel aw ih, Zohman ih bang lo mi ah na ruat aw a si. Ka nuhmei dah lo ding; Ka faate pawl tla in in taan dah lo ding, na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sikhalsehla mitṭhep ah, ni ni khat sungah, Hi thil pahnih cu na parah an thleng ding. Ziangtluk ih na zingawk le rai na thawi rero hmanah Na faate pawl in an lo taan thotho ding; Nuhmei ah na cang fawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Na siatvaatnak sungah cun zum awzet in na um; ‘Zohman in in hmu lo paam!’ na ti. Na fimnak le na theihnak in a peengah a lo hruai; Nangmah le nangmah cu, ‘Pathian ka si, Keimah bangtuk zohman milai an um lo!’ na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thihhlohnak poimawh cu na parah a thleng ding; Na mitkher le na kutṭial zohthiam pawl in an kham thei lo ding. Rinlopi ah siatsuahnak na parah a thleng ding; Na mang hmanih na man dah lomi siatnak cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na mitkher le na dawi thiamnak pawl cu thlah hlah aw; Na nolai ihsin na hman mi thil an si. An lo bawm thei khal a si thei meen! Na ral pawl in an ṭih tla a si thei meen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ziangtluk ih ruahnak an lo pek rero khalle Thilti theinak zianghman na nei nawn lo. Na thuron mi pawl cu rasuak in lo run hai seh: Arsi thu a zirtu le van tla ih lamzin a theitu pawl, Thlakhat hnu thlakhat thu a lo sim ih Na parih thil a cang dingmi a lo simtu pawl cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Annih cu fanghi bangtuk meen an si; Meisa ih ur ṭheh ding an si. Anmah le anmah hman an run aw thei lo ding. Meisa alh cu an hrangah a sa tuk ding; A hlum meen, ai ding tawkfang meisa a si lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na san sung hmuahhmuah ah thu na ron mi, Arsi zohthiam pawl ih thu cun Hitión an lo tuah ding: An lo tlansan ṭheh dingih anmah ih duhnak zin ciar an zawh ding. A lo runtu dingah pakhat hman an taanglo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Israel mi pawl, hihi ngaihnik uh! Judah tefa sin pawl, ṭhatein ngai uh! Bawipaió hmin salin thu na kam ih, Israel ih Pathian ka biak, na ti. Asinain na ṭongmi cu na hmurka lawngin a si; Na thinlung ah zianghman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cui tlunah hngalzet in, “Kei cu khua thianghlim sungih um mi ka si; Israel ih Pathian ka rinsan a si; Amaió hmin cu Cungnungbik Bawipa a si,” na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel hnenah, “Khuahlanlai ihsin thil a cang dingmi ka rak simcia zo; Cule hmakhatte-ah ka kim ter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na thinlung cu thir le daar bangih ruh zetin A um ding tihi ka rak thei cia zo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Ka khuavang pawl ih cangter mi le, Ka milem pawl ih sim cia mi a si,’ na ti theilonak dingah, thil a cang hlan ihsin ka rak sim cia zo; Hlanlaipi ihsin ka rak sim cia zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ka rak sim cia mi hmuahhmuah an kim ṭheh zo; Ka rak sim mi an hman a si, ti ih na pom a ṭul a si. Atu ah a ra thleng dingmi thilthar ka lo sim ding; A hlanih ka phuan dah lomi thil pawl cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Atu lawngah ka cangter ding, Hi bangtuk cu dunglamah a cang dah lomi thil an si. A rak cang dah zo a si ahcun ka theih cia mi a si na ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na suahthlak ihsin mi dodaltu na si ih, Rinsan ding na si lo, ti cu ka thei ṭheh a si. Curuangah a si hi thu hi na theih dah lonak le ṭong kamkhat hman na hna ih a thlen dah lonak cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Mi in ka hmin an thangṭhatnak dingah Ka thinhengnak cu ka suup a si; Ka thin ka neemter saal ih ka lo siatsuah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngun cu somei sungih an thianfai ter bangin, Tuarnak meisa sungah ka lo hniksak a si. Asinain man neilo na si cu fiangtein ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Curuangah thil ka tuah mi hi ka hmin hrang lawngah ka tuah; Ka hmin cu thangsia in ka umter thei lo; Sunlawinak khal keimai ta lawng a si ih Zohman in an co lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel hnenah, “Maw Israel, ka kawh mi pawl, i ngaihnik uh; Keimah cu Pathian ka si; Hmaisa bik ka si, netabik khal ka si. Keimah lawng hi Pathian ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Leilung ih hramṭohnak cu ka kutih tuah mi a si; Van tla khi ka kutih pharh mi an si. Lei le van ka ko tikah, Hmakhatte ah ka hmaiah an ra ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Nan zate in pumkhawm uhla ngaihnik uh! Ka hrilmi pa in Babilon a do ding, tiah Khui khuavang hmanin a phuang cia theilo a si. Ka tuahter duh mi cu a tuah ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hnenah a ṭongtu le a kotu cu keimah ka si; Ka hruai suakih hlawhtlinnak ka pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I ra naih uhla ka sim mi hi thei hnik uh! A hramthok ihsin nan hnenah zianghman thup loin ka sim; Ka sim mi thu cu a kim ringring a si,” a ti. (Atu ah Cungnungbik Bawipa in huham i pekih i thlah.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel ih Pathian thianghlim, a lo runtu Bawipa in, “Keimah cu Bawipa nan Pathian ka si; Nan ṭhatnak dingah a lo zirhtu le Nan fehnak ding lamzin ah a lo hruaitu ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka thupekmi rak ngai uh cila maw! Nan parah hin thlawsuah malsawmnak cu Ziangtik hman ih a kaang dah lomi tiva bangin a luang ding nan! Nan hnenah nehnak cu, Tifinriat kapih tilet a thlen cingcing bangin a thleng ding nan!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nan tefa sin pawl cu tipikap ih vunnel zat an si dingih leilung tlunah hin a hloral mi nan si lo ding nan!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Babilon ihsin suak uh! Nan luat a si feh uh! Cui thu cu lungawi in tlang-au uh! Khuazakip ah than uhla: “ Bawipa in a siahhlawh Israel a run zo a si!” tiah au ciamco uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung pawl cu a caar le a sazet mi nelrawn lakihsin a hruai tikah, tihalnak zianghman an tuar lo. An hrangah lungpi sungin tidai a puut ter. Lungpi cu a kuaiter ih tidai a luang zurzo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Misual hrangah cun himnak a um lo,” tiah Bawipa in a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lamhlatpi ih a um mi ram pawl, i ngaihnik uh! Khawtluang ih a um mi pawl tla! Ka suah hlan ihsin Bawipa in i hrilzo ih Amah riantu si dingah ṭuanvo i pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka ṭong cu ralnam vekin a hriamter; A kut in i hum. A hriamzet mi le hman dingih retcia mi conkiang bangtuk ah i tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah in ka hnenah, “Maw Israel, nang cu keimah riantu na si; Nangmah ruangah mi in in thangṭhat ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei in, “Ka ṭuan rero naón a lak hlir ah an cang. Ka thazaang a cem ṭheh; ka ṭuansuak mi zianghman a um lo,” ka ti. Asinain Bawipa cu a ṭha lomi ṭhattertu le a diklomi dik ko ih a tuah theitu a si tiah ka ring; Ka ṭuan mi ruangah amah in laksawng i pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka suah hlan ihsin, Bawipa in ṭuanvo i zem zo; A minung pawl hruaikir saal dingah le a ṭhekdarh aw mi Israel mi pawl kirter saal dingah amah riantu ah i tuah a si. Bawipa in hminṭhatnak i pek a si. Amah cu ka cahnak hrampi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Keimah riantu, na ṭuanvo thupi sinsin a um: A taangsun Israel mi pawl hnenah A hlan vekin hminthannak na thlenter saal ding lawng si loin, Leilung pumpi runnak an ngah theinak dingah nangmah cu miphun tampi hnenih tleunak ah ka lo tuah ding a si,” i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi ih an hmuhsuam zet mi, Miphun tampi ih huat mi, Uktu bawi pawl ih hnen-um ṭuantu hnen ah, A thianghlim mi Pathian, Israel Runtu cun, “Mi luat na si kha siangpahrang tla in an lo hmu dingih an lo upatnak langter dingah an ding ding; Siangpahrang fapa le bawi pawl tla in an lo hmu dingih upatnak in na hmaiah an kuun ding,” tiah a ti. Bawipa Israel ih Pathian thianghlim in a riantu a hrilzo ih a thukam pawl a kimter ringring ruangah a tlun ih bangtuk in a cang ngaingai ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung pawl hnenah, “Nanmah runnak ni a thlen tikah ka lo bawm ding; Bomnak nan dilmi cu ka thei ding. Ka lo kilveng dingih ka lo hum ding; Nanmah sungin mi hmuahhmuah hnenah thukamnak ka tuah ding. Nan taantak mi ramsungah cun ka lo umter saal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thawngtla mi hnenah cun, ‘Suak thlang uh,’ ka ti dingih, Thimnak sungih a um mi hnenah ‘Tleunak sungah ra thlang uh,’ ka ti ding. Cuticun tlang parih hrampi a piat rero tu tuu bangtuk an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An ril a rawng lo dingih an ti tla a haal lo ding; Nisa le nelrawn niling in a siatsuah hai lo ding. Ziangahtile anmah a duhtu in a kilkhawi dingih, Cerhti umnak ah a hruai hai ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tlang parah lamzinpi ka tuah dingih, Ka minung pawl fehnak lamzin ka sial ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka minung pawl cu ramhlapi ihsin an ra ding; Saklam le nitlaknak lam, Thlanglam Asuan khua khalin an ra ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maw van tla, hla sa uh! Maw leilung, lungawi in au uh! Tlang pawl tla lungawi in hlasa hai seh! Bawipa in a minung pawl cu a hneem dingih, a tuarzettu a minung pawl parah zaangfahnak a nei ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asinain Jerusalem mi pawl cun, “ Bawipa in in dungtun zo, in hngilh zo a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa in, “Nunau in a sungsuak fa a hngilh thei ding maw? A hrin mi a fa cu duhloin a um thei ding maw? A nu in a fa cu hngilh hmansehla, Kei cun ka lo hngilh dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem, ka lo hngilh thei dah lo ding; Ka kut zaphak parah na hmin cu ka ngan zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Nangmah a lo dinsal tu ding pawl cu an rathleng cing dingih, a lo siatsuahtu pawl cu an tlan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na kiangkap ih thil a cangmi pawl hi zohhnik! Na minung pawl an ra-an rakir saal rero lai a si. A nungmi Bawipa keimah in ka lo kam: Mo in a hlawnthil pawl cu hmaihngal zetih a hruh vekin, hi na minung pawl cu na hrangah hmaihngal tlak hlawnthil bangtuk an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Na ram cu hnawmpen ah a cangih a ṭhing reprep! Asinain a ra umtu pawl hrangah a fate tuk ding. Cule hnawmpen ih a lo cantertu pawl cu a hlatzet ah ret an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sal taannak ramih a suak mi na minung pawl cun ‘Hi ram hi a fate tuk, ram kau deuh kan duh a si,’ tiah ni khat khatah an lo ti lai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutikah na thinlungte-in, ‘Zoso hi faate pawl hi i hrinsak? Ka faale pawl an thi ih nucing ka si zo; Thawng tlakmi le dawihlo mi ka si, Zo in so hi faale pawl hi a kilkhawi? Keimah lawngih taantak mi ka si, khui in so hi faale pawl hi an rat?’ tiah na ti ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa Pathian in a minung pawl hnenah, “Ka kut ka hawi pei ih Miphun pawl hnenah khihhmuhnak ka langter ding; Cuticun nan faate pawl cu inn ah an ratpi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Siangpahrang pawl cu nan hrangah pa bangtuk an si dingih, siangpahrang bawinu pawl cu a lo tuamhlawmtu nan nu bangtuk an si ding. Nan hmaiah an lu an kuun dingih an lo ṭihzah ding; Nan hmaiah upatnak an lo pe ding. Cutikah keimah cu Bawipa ka si kha in thei ding; Keimah bomnak a hngaktu pawl cu an bei a dong lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ralkap ih lakcia mi thil cu nan long kir thei ding maw? Zaangfah neilotu ih kaih cia mi thawngtla pawl cu nan runsuak thei nawn ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bawipa in, “A si, a cang theilo nan timi hi a cang ding a si; Ralkap cakzet kut sungih ral kaihmi pawl cu runsuak a si dingih, zaangfah neilotu ih lak cia mi thilri khal lon kir a si ding. A lo dotu hmuahhmuah cu ka do dingih, nan faate pawl cu ka runsuak ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A lo hremtu pawl cu anmah le anmah ka thah awkter hai dingih, Mithah duhnak le thinhengnak in an ri ding. Cutikah nanmah a lo humtu le a lo luat tertu cu Bawipa keimah ka si kha miphun hmuahhmuah in an thei ding. Israel ih Pathian cakzet ka si kha an thei ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Mipa pakhat in a nupi a maak vekin Ka minung pawl hi ka maak ah maw nan ruat? Cuti asile nupi maaknak lethmat khui ah so a si? Mi pakhat in a faate pawl salih a zuar vekin Ral kaihnak ah ka lo zuar hai ah maw nan ruat? Asilo, nanmah ih sualnak ruangah ralkaih mi nan si; Thilsual nan tuah ruangah dawihlo mi nan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ziangah so ka minung pawl run dingih ka feh tikah Zo talih biak hman ka ton lo? Ziangah so ka kawh hai tikah zohmanin in sawn lo? Anmah hum dingah ka ṭawnṭai tuk lawmmam maw si? Ka thupeknak thawngin tifinriat cu a kang ṭheh, Tiva pawl cu nelrawn ah an cangṭheh, Tidai umlo ruangah tiva sung nga cu an thi ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Van tla ka thim ter thei, Mithi ngai bangin a mithmai a uih ṭheh a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in simthiamnak lei i pek, Thabaang mi pawl thacak tertu dingah. Zingtinte ka beng i var ter, I zirh dingmi thei theitu dingah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in theihthiamnak thinlung i pek, Amah cu ka dodal loih, Ka dungtun fawn lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I vua tu pawl hrangah ka zaang cu ka tun; I hmuhsuamtu pawl cu ka kham lo; Ka khahmul an bot ih ka hmai ih cil in phui khalle ka dawn lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In hmuhsuamnak cu ka hrangah a na lo, Ziangahtile Bawipa Pathian in i bawm a si. In tisiatnak tuar thei dingah pacan ka cuh. Mualpho in ka um lo ding ti ka thei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ziangahtile Pathian cu ka kiangah a um ih, Thiam i coter ko ding. Sual i puh ngamtu zoso a um? Thuṭhennak hmunah kan feh hnik pei! Sual cu i puh hnik hmeen seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa amah cu i ṭantu a si; Zoso mimawh na si, i ti ngam ding? Sual i puhtu pawl hmuahhmuah cu an hloral ṭheh ding; A mawr ih a rop mi hnipuan bangin an cem ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa a ṭihzah ih, A siahhlawh ṭongkam a ngaitu pawl, Nan fehnak lamzin cu thimnak in khat hmansehla, Bawipa cu rinsan uhla, nan Pathian cu hngauhsan uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Midang siatsuah dingih miphiartu pawl, Nan miphiarnak in nanmah a lo siatsuah ding! Bawipa amah in cutin a cangter dingih oloksongnak nan tuar ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Runnak a duhtu pawl, i ngai hnik uh. Ka bomnak duh ih a ra mi pawl. Nan suahnak lungpi kha ruat hnik uh, An lo laih suaknak lung kha!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nan pu Abraham le a lo hringtu Sarah kha ruat hnik uh. Ka kawh laiah Abraham cu faate a neilo. Asinain mal ka sawm ih faate ka pe. A tefa sin pawl cu mi tamzet ah ka tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Jerusalem parah lainatnak ka nei ding. Siatsuah ṭheh a si mi a khua ramih a umtu pawl parah. A ram cu nelrawn ah a cang naón hmuanduum ah ka cangter saal ding, Eden ih ka ret mi hmuanduum bangtuk in. Lungawinak le thinlung nomnak a um ding, Ka hnenih lungawinak le thangṭhatnak in a khat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“maw ka minung pawl, i ngai uh; Ka ṭong mi hi ngaihnik uh. Miphun hmuahhmuah hnenah ka thuzirhnak ka thlenter ding. Ka daan pawl cu an hrangah tleunak a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zamrang zet in ka ra dingih ka run hai ding, Ka mi nehnak cu a nai zo. Miphun hmuahhmuah cu keimah rori in ka uk ding; Ram hlapi pawl in ka rat ding cu an hngakhlap. Ka runnak cu beisei in an hngak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Van tla khi hun thlir hnik uh! Leilung hi cuan hnik uh! Van khi meikhu bangin an hlo ding; Leilung hi hnipuan hlun bangin a ṭet ding; Cule mi hmuahhmuah cu thothe bangin an thi ṭheh ding. Asinain ka mi runnak cu kumkhua daih a si ding; Ka mi nehnak cu sanmureng in a hmun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Dingnak a theitu nannih pawl, i ngai uh; Ka zirhnak thinlung sungih a rettu pawl! Midang in an lo hro ih an lo hmuhsuam khalle zianghman ṭih hlah uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cubangtuk minung pawl cu hnipuan rop bangin an cem ding. Asinain ka mi runnak cu kumkhua daih a si ding, Ka mi nehnak cu sanmureng in a hmun ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , tho awla in bawm aw! Na cahnak suah awla in run aw! Khuahlan lai ih na rak suah vekin suah saal aw. Tipithuanthum rulhreng Rahab a thattu le a saat ṭheh tu cu nangmah na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tifinriat a kaang tertu le na run mi pawl an fehsuahnak dingah tidai lakih lamzin a tuahtu cu nangmah na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na runsuak mi pawl cu Jerusalem ah, lungawi aipuang in, hlasak phah le au phah in an thleng ding a si. Kumkhua in an lung a awi dingih riahsiatnak le ninghannak ihsin kumkhua in an luat ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in, “A lo cak tertu cu keimah ka si. Ziangah so hrampi bangih a san a tawi ih a thi thei mi milai cu nan ṭih rero?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nanmah a lo tuahtu Bawipa , Van tla khi a pharhtu le leilung ih hramṭohnak a rettu Pathian cu nan hngilh zo maw si? Ziangah so a lo hremtu pawl ih thinhengnak le nanmah siatsuah ding a tumtu pawl cu khur thlohthlo in nan ṭih rero? An thinhengnak in ziangtik hmanah a lo dai thei dah lo ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Atu ih thawngtla mi pawl cu a rei hlanah an luat ding, An nun a sau dingih an duhzat in ei ding rawl an ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Keimah hi Bawipa nan Pathian ka si. Tifinriat cu keimah in ka ṭhang ih a tilet pawl cu ka huuk ter ciamco. Ka hmin cu Cungnungbik Bawipa ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Van tla khi ka pharh ih Leilung ih hramṭohnak tla Keimah in ka phun a si. Jerusalem hnenah, ‘Nangmah cu ka minung na si! Ka thuzirhmi ka lo pek zo ih Ka kutin ka lo hum a si,’ ka ti,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem, ṭhang thlang aw! ṭhang awla tho thlang aw! Bawipa in a thinheng in a lo in ter mi hremnak khuat cu na in zo. A ne tiang na in ih a lo sawn ter zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A lo hruaitu zohman an um lo. Na minung lakah a kut lo san tahrat in a lo tho tu zohman an um lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vanduainak phun hnih na tong; Raldonak ruangah na ram cu a siat ṭheh ih, Na minung pawl cu rawl loin an caar ṭheh. A lo zaangfahtu zohman an um lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lamzin kel kipah na minung pawl cu ṭaamsawl in an ril teptep. Thangkam pai thangih awh mi zukneng bangtuk an si. Pathian ih thinhengnak hmual an tong a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Harsatnak a tuartu Jerusalem mi pawl, Zuri bangtuk ih a sawn rero tu pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa nan Pathian cun a lo ṭan ih nan hnenah, “Ka thinheng in ka lo pekmi khuat cu nan kut sung ihsin ka laak saal rero lai a si. A lo sawn tertu zu cu nan in a ṭul nawn lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nanmah a lo hremtu pawl, Lamzin in a lo ril tertu, hnawmhne pal ih a lo pal tu pawl hnenah cuih khuat cu ka pe ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem, a nasa ih a cak mi khua si saal aw! Maw Pathian ih khawpi thianghlim, A mawi mi in thuam aw saal aw! Pathian theilo mi pawl cu na kotka sungah an lut saal nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem, luat thlang aw! Leivut lakih sin tho awla na tokham ah to aw. Maw sal ih a taang Zion mi! An lo ṭeemnak cikcin pawl cu phoih thlang aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung pawl hnenah, “Nanmah leinak ah paisa zianghman an pe lo, Asinain sal ah nan cang. Nanmah tlennak ah zianghman peek a si lo ding, A lakin nan luat ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hlanah Izipt ramah nan um ih mikhual ah nan cang. Nehhnu ah ziangthuhla hman umlo in Assiria in a lo hrem hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Atu Babilon ah cuvek thotho a cang saal: Ziangthu umlo in salkaihmi ah nan cang. A lo uktu pawl cu puarthau in tluang an khawngih Keimah hmuhsuamtu ringring an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain tikcu a ra thleng dingih Keimah cu Pathian ngaingai ka sihi nan thei dingih nan hnenih a ṭongtu hi keimah ka si kha nan lung a pem ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tlangpar ihsin a ra ih, Luatnak le daihnak thuthang ṭha a phuangtu ih ke cu ziangtlukin so a mawi? Zion hnenah nehnak thu a than ih “Nan Pathian cu Siangpahrang a si!” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khawpi a kilvengtu pawl cu an au, Lungawi in hmun khatah an au ciamco! Zion ah Bawipa a ra saal zo, ti kha an mit rori in an hmu a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem ih hnawmpen pawl, Lungawi aipuang in au hluarhlo uh! Bawipa in a khawpi cu a hum i, A minung pawl cu a hneem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in a huham thianghlim a suah ding, A minung pawl a run ding. Leilung pumpi in an hmu ṭheh ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Suak uh! Babilon cu tlansan uh! Biakinn thilri a kengtu pawl! A zarhmi thil zianghman tham hlah uh. Thianghlim te in um uhla hi khawpi cu tlansan uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuihṭum cu manmawh in nan tlan a ṭul lo ding; Raltlan bangin nan tlan a ṭul lo ding. Bawipa nan Pathian in a lo hruai dingih nan dung nan hmai in a lo kil ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Zohhnik, keimah riantu cu a hnaṭuannak ah a hlawhtling ding. Mi ih upat bik mi a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asinain a hmuihmel a siat ih minung hman a bang lo tikah cun mi tampi an mang a bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Miphun tampi in an zoh tikah an mang a bang ding, Siangpahrang tampi tla an khawruahhar in ṭong ding zianghman an thei lo ding. An zoh tikah a hlanih an theih dah lo mi an thei ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cutikah misenpi in, “Atu kan sim mi hi a zumtu an rak um dah leem pei maw? Hi thil ahhin Bawipaió kut a hmu tu an rak um leem pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asinain Bawipaió duhnak bangtuk in a riantu cu thingkung bangin a kho, Leicar lakih thing note bangin. Kan zoh duhnak dingah pianhmang ṭhatnak le mawinak a nei lo. Kan thinlung le kan mit in latu dingah mawinak zianghman a nei hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah cu kan hmuhsuam mi le kan hnon mi a si. Natnak le harsatnak a tuar. Zokhal in a zoh hman an zoh duh lo. Zianghman a si lo tiah kan umsan meen mi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Asinain amah cu kan zonzaihnak tuartu a si, Kan natnak phurtu khal a si. A zonzaihnak le a tuarnak pawl cu Pathian ih hremnak a si tiah kan ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sikhalsehla kanmah ih sual ruangah hriamhma a pu, Thil ṭha lo kan tuah ruangah vuaknak a tong. Hremnak a tuar mi cu kan damnak a si, Vuak a tuarnak cu kan rundamnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan zate in a hlo mi tuu bangin kan vakvai, Kan duhnak zin ciarah kan feh. Asinain Bawipa in cawhkuannak cu a parah a thlenter, Kan tuar ding mi kan sualman cawhkuannak cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“An tisia zet nan thindaiteón a tuar, Kam khat hman a ṭong lo. Thah dingih an fehpi mi tuu faate bangin le a hmul meh dingmi tuu bangin a kaa in ṭongkam zianghman a suah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amah cu an kai ih thah dingin a thu an ṭhen, A thih ding khal zohman in an poisa lo. Kan minung pawl ih sual ruangah thah a tong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thilsual tuah dah mi le thuphan per dah mi a si lo naan, Miṭha lo pawl thawn thlaan ah an ret; Milian hnenah an phum,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in, “A tuar ding cu keimai duhnak a si; A thihnak cu ngaidamnak a thlentertu thawinak a si. Cuticun a tefa sin pawl a hmu ding; Kum reipi a nungdam dingih Amah sungin ka tumtah mi cu a kim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Harsatnak a tuar hnuah lungawinak a tong ding; A tuarnak cu a lak a si lo ti a thei ding. Amah cu a dingmi keimah riantu a si ih ka lung a awi. Mi tampi ih ai ah cawhkuannak a tuar dingih anmah tla cu an sual ka ngaithiam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Curuangah amah cu upatnak hmun ka pe ding, Milian le micak pawl lakah ka ret ding. Lungkimzet in a nunnak cu a pekih, miṭha lo pawl lakah siarcih a si zo. Misual pawl ih sualman a tuarih, an sual ngaidamnak a dil a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem, faneilo nucing bangtuk na si. Asinain atu cun na lungawi awla au in hlasa aw. Atu cun a pasal in a taan dah lomi nunau hnakin faate tamdeuh na nei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na puan inn tumter deuh aw! Puan ṭemnak hri sauter deuh awla, A fungkhen pawl hnget deuh in tuah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ramri cu na ram kimvel ah kauh ter aw; Mi phundang pawl ih an luah mi na ram hi na miphun pawl in an co saal ding. Atu ih a ṭhing reprep mi khua pawl hi minung an khat saal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zianghman phang hlah, na ning a zak nawn lo ding; Mualpho in na um saal nawn lo ding. Nupi note na si lai ih na zuanzamnak le nuhmei na si ih ninghang lungleng ih na umnak hi cu na ciing nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A lo seemsuahtu a hmin Cungnungbik Bawipa a si mi cu na pasal bangtuk a si ding. A thianghlim mi Pathian, Israel ih Pathian in a lo run ding. Amah cu leilung pumpi uktu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Israel, nupi note bangtuk na si, A pasal ih maak mi le ninghang riahsia ih a um mi nunau bangtuk na si. Sikhalsehla Bawipa in a hnenah a lo ko saal ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tikcu tawite sung ka lo ṭhen; Ka lo duhdawtnak a thuuk ruangah ka lo hruai saal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Caan tawite sung ka thinheng in khatlam ka lo hoi san; Asinain kumkhua in a hnget mi ka lo duhdawtnak cu ka lo hmuh ding,” a ti. A lo runtu Bawipa in a ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leilung tlunah tilik ka thlenter nawn lo pei, tiah Noah san ah thu ka lo tiam zo. Atu ah na parah ka thin a heng nawn lo pei, tiah thu ka lo kam a si. Ka lo hrem lo ding, a kawk khal ka lo kawk lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thlua le tlang khal cim ṭheh hman hai sehla, Ka lo duhdawtnak cu a cem dah lo ding. Ka lo pe ding ti ih ka lo kam mi daihnak cu ka kimter ringring ding,” tiah a lo duhdawttu Bawipa in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw Jerusalem, bawmtu neilo zonzai tuartu khawpi, hneemtu zohman na neilo. Na innhram pawl cu lung mankhung in ka sak saal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na ralvennak innsang pawl cu ruby lungmankhung in, na kotka pawl cu meisa bangtuk ih a vaam mi lungmankhung in, na kimvel phar pawl cu lungvar in ka sak saal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Na minung pawl cu keimah rori in ka zirh dingih, daihnak le ṭhansonak ka pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dingnak le ṭhatnak in a lo cakter ding; Hremnak le ṭihphannak in na luat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Midang in an lo do asile ka thu loin an lo do a si ding. A lo dotu cu zo a si khalle a sung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Meisa a zaap ih hriamnam a tuahtu Soserpa cu keimah in ka tuah. Mithahnak ah cuih hriamnam a hmangtu ralkappa a tuahtu khal keimah ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asinain ziangbangtuk tuah mi hriamnam khalin a lo ngah lo ding; Sual a lo puhtu ṭongkam hmuahhmuah cu na let thei thluh ding. Keimah riantu pawl cu ka ṭan dingih nehnak ka pe ding,” a ti. Bawipa in a sim zo a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ra uh, ti a haal mi hmuahhmuah ra uh, hinah tidai a um Ra uh, paisa a neilo mi pawl rawl ra lei uhla ei uh. Ra uh, sabit le cawhnawi ra lei uh; man loin nan ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ziangah so rawl a si lo mi hrangah paisa nan hman? Ziangah so pum puarter lomi thil hrangah nihlawh nan pek? I ngai uhla ka sim mi vekin tuah uh; Rawl lakih a ṭhabik mi nan ei dingih nan nun a nuam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka minung pawl, i ngai uhla ka hnenah ra uh; Ka hnenah ra uhla nunnak nan ngah ding. Nanmah thawn kumkhua hmun mi thukamnak ka tuah dingih, David hnenih ka kam mi thlawsuahnak cu ka lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David cu hotu le miphun tampi hruaitu ah ka tuah ih, amah hmangin ka cahnak ka langter zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Atu ah miphun tampi nan ko ding; A lo thei dah lotu an si hmanah nanmah lam ṭang dingah an lo pan vivo ding. Israel ih Pathian thianghlim, Bawipa nan Pathian Keimah in hi bangtuk in ka cangter ding. Upatnak le sunlawinak ka lo pe ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ton a theihlai ah Bawipa cu hawl uh, Anailai ah amah ko uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Miṭha lo in an ziaza tlansan in an ruahdan thleng hai seh. Bawipa kan Pathian hnenah kir hai seh la, a ngaidam lohli ding. Amah cu mi zaangfahtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ka ruahnak cu nan ruahnak bangtuk a si lo. Ka lamzin le nan lamzin cu an dang aw a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Van tla khi leilung hnakih a saang bangtuk in Ka ruahnak le ka lamzin cu nan ruahnak le nan lamzin hnakin a sang sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ka ṭongkam cu van ihsin leilung ciarter dingih a tla mi vur le ruah ti bangtuk a si. Daidaw le vanruah in thlairawl an ṭhan ter; Ciin dingah thlaici an kho terih ei dingah rawl an suahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka kaa sungih a suak mi ṭongkam cu cubangtuk a si ding; Zianghman tuahsuak loin ka hnenah a kir lo ding; Tuah dingih ka tum mi hmuahhmuah cu a tuah ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Lungawi zetin Babilon ihsin nan suak ding; Hnangam zetih hruaisuak mi nan si ding. Nan hmaiah tlangsaang siseh tlangniam siseh hla an sa ciamco ding. Thingkung pawl tla lungawi in an au ciamco ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hlingkung khohnak hmunah farthing a kho ding; Hlingbur khohnak hmunah lenhmui kung a kho ding. Himi cu keimah Bawipa in ka tuah mi theihter saaltu hminsinnak a si ringring ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung pawl hnenah, “A rei hlanah ka lo run ding. Curuangah a dikmi le a hman mi tuah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nizarh ni a ul ringring ih a hmangsual lotu cu ka thlawsuah ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipaió minung pawl hnenih a ṭangtu ramdangmi in, “ Bawipa in a minung pawl thawn Pathian biak tlang in siang lo ding,” tiah ti hlah seh. Tilper mi in, “Faate nei theilo ka si ruangah Pathian ih minung pawl hnenah ka tel theilo ding,” ti hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi bangtuk mi hnenah Bawipa in, “Nizarh ni ul tahratin keimah i upat ih ka duh mi a tuahtu le ka thukamnak a thlun ringringtu cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ka Biakinn sungah le ka minung lakah nan hmin cu ciin ringring a si dingih, fanu le fapa nan neih ih nan hmin than ding hnakin nan hmin cu reideuh ciin a si ding. Ziangtik hmanah hngilh nan si lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipaió minung lakih a telmi ramdangmi pawl, Bawipa a duhdaw ih a riantu le Nizarh ni a ul ih a thukham felte-ih a thluntu pawl hnenah Bawipa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ka tlang thianghlim Zion ahcun ka lo thlenpi ding; ka thlacamnak inn ah lungawinak ka lo pe dingih ka biakṭheng parih nan pek mi thawinak tla cu ka saang ding a si. Ka Biakinn cu mi phun kip hrangah thlacamnak inn an ti ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sal taannak ihsin a minung pawl a suahtu Bawipa Pathian in amai minung pawl thawn finkhawm dingah miphundang rak hruai dingin thu a kam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa in miphundang pawl kha sahrang bangih ra tahratin a minung pawl ra bauhthlek thluh dingah a fial a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Israel hotu pawl, ka minung ralrinnak a simtu ding pawl hi an mit a caw ṭheh a si. Zianghman theih mi an neilo. Inn kilvengtu asinan a bo lomi uico bangtuk an si; an it ih mang an man hluahhlo meen. Ih an duhzia cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hamṭam zetih ziangtik hmanih khawh ti a neilo mi uico bangtuk an si. Theihthiamnak zianghman neilo hotu an si. An zate in anmah ih duh mi lawng an tuah ih anmah ih miatnak hlir an hawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Ra uh, sabit kan in pei. Kan dawk thei sung kan dawk pei! Thaisun cu tuihsun hnak hmanin ni sunglawi sinsin a si ding,’ tiah a ri pawl in an ti,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Miṭha an thi ih zohman in an theithiam lo, zianghman ah an siar lo. Asinain an thih tikah cun retheih zonzaih an tuar nawn lonak hmun ah an thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ziaza ṭha a nei mi cu hnangamnak an ngah ih an thih tikah colhnak an ngah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw misual pawl, nan thuṭhen dingah hinah ra uh. Pol pawl le pasal ṭaang ih mi ngai le hlawhhlang pawl hnakin nan ṭha deuh cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zoso hnihsuahsainak ih nan hman rero mi cu a si? Nan kaa ang tahratin nan lei nan khak hnawh mi cu zoso a si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leilung ṭhattertu khuavang kan biak nan ti ih a zarh mi nan thingkung thuai ah nu le pa nan pawl aw. Tivun kiang lungpuk sungah nan faate pawl cu raithawinak ah nan pek!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutawkih a um mi lungto ngil pawl cu nan lakih khuavang ah nan biak! Cui lungto hrangah sabit nan thlet ih nan pek; sangphut thawinak tla nan pek. Ka lung a awi dingah maw in ruat?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tlangsang parah thawinak pe dingah nan feh ih nupa pawl awknak riangri ah nan hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A taklawng te-ih a um mi nan milem pawl cu nan innhmai sangka phen ah nan ret ziarzi! Kei cu in taan; nan hnipuan nan phuak ih nan ihpi dingah tangka nan phalh mi nan mi ngai mi pawl thawn nan ihkhun kaupi parah nan it. Cutawkah nan taksa diriamnak cu nan tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nan rimhmui nan culh aw, nan sahriak nan thih aw ih Molek khuavang biak dingah nan feh. Biak ding khuavang hawltu dingah leilung khuazakipah palai nan thlah; mithi khua tiangah nan thlah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khuavang dang nan hawlnak ah nan thitha khal a cem ṭheh, a sinan nan bei a dong dah lo. Ningzah neilo nan milem pawl in cahnak in pek, tiah nan ruat; curuangah nan tha a baang dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Nan thinlung sungih ṭihnak a umtertu hi khuavang pawl cu zoso an si?” Cuti ih nan ṭih ruangah ka hnenah thuphan nan perih kei cu in hngilh riai a si! Daite ih ka um ringring ruangah maw kei cu in upat nawn lo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan tuah mi a hman, tiah maw si nan ruat? Ruat duh hlah uh! Nan tuah mi hi ka phuang thluh dingih nan milem pawl cun an lo humhim thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bomnak dilin nan au rero tikah nan milem pawl cun lo bawm hai seh. Voikhat thlihrang in a semhlo ṭheh hai ding! Sikhalsehla keimah i rinsantu pawl cu ramsungah an um dingih ka Biakinn sungin in biak ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ka minung pawl cu ka hnenah rakir hai seh. An lamzin ih midawntu hmuahhmuah cu hlon ṭheh uh! Lamzin tuah ṭheh uhla a cia in ret uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keimah cu kumkhua ih a nungmi Pathian, a saangmi le a thianghlim mi Pathian ka si. A saang le a thianghlim mi hmunah ka um; a sinan rinsannak le beiseinak nan neih saalnak dingah thinlung kuai mi le thinlung neem mi hnen khalah ka um a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka minung pawl hnenah nunnak ka pek; ka mawhthluk ringring lo dingih an parah ka thin cu kumkhua in a heng lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An sualnak le an duhhamnak ruangah an parah ka thin a rak heng a si. Ka thin heng in ka hremih ka hnong hai a si. Cucingin an thinlung a ruh ih anmah ih duhnak lamzin an thlun thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“An thil tuahzia cu ka hmu zo; a sinan ka damter hai ding. Ka hruai dingih ka bawm ding; riahsia ninghang mi pawl cu ka hneem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hlat ih a um mi siseh, a nai ih a um mi siseh, an zate hnenah daihnak ka pe a si. Ka minung pawl cu ka damter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sikhalsehla miṭha lo pawl cu, a cawl dah lomi tilet pawl in ciarbek le hnawmhne a suahpi ringringtu tifinriat bangtuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Misual pawl hrangah cun humhimnak a um lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ring zetin au uh! Nan aw neih tawp in au uh! Israel ka minung pawl kha an sualzia sim uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nitinte in bia ih ka daan thlun ah le a dikmi tuah ah an ruat aw. Anmah thluasuah dingah le daan ṭha pe dingah in dil a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Misenpi pawl in, “ Bawipa in in hmu lo a si ahcun ziangah so rawl kan ulh rero? Zianghman ih a siarlo a si ah ziangah so rawl loin kan tuar duh rero?” tiah an sut. Bawipa in an hnenah, “A hman teón kan ti ahcun, rawl ulhnak cu nanmah ih duh mi hawlnak ah le nan hnaṭuantu pawl hremnak ah nan hmang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi thihnai suahter nan ṭih lo; nan sual aw ih nan to aw. Hi bangtuk nan rawl ulhnak ruangah nan thlacamnak ka ngai dingah maw si nan ruat?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rawl nan ulh tikah zonzaih nan pe aw; hrampi kung bangin nan lu cu nan kuun; nan ih-nak ah buri puan le vutcam nan phah. Cumi maw rawl kan ul nan ti? Cumi parah ka lung a awi dingah nan ruat maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Kei ih ka duh mi rawl ulhnak cu hibangtuk a si. Thir cikcin bangih nan mi hremnak le kawn vekih mi a delh tu a hmanlo in mi nan tuahnak pawl hi hlon ṭheh uhla nan hrem mi pawl hi luat thlang hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nan tirawl cu rilrawng mi thawn ṭawm aw uhla nan inn tla cu inn neilo mifarah hrangah ong uh. Hnipuan hruk ding neilo mi hnenah hnipuan pek uhla nan sungkhat bawm ding tla el hlah uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Cutikah ka tleunak cu nan parah zinglam nisuak bangin a tlang dingih nan hma tla cu zamrang zetin a dam ding. Nan hnenah ka um ringring dingih ka lo run ding. Nan hnenih ka um ruangah nan him ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thla nan cam tikah ka lo let ding; in kawh tikah ka lo sawn ding. “Mi nan hremnak hi nan hlon ṭheh ih mi nan hmuhsuamnak le nan ṭong ṭha lo pawl nan cemter lawng si loin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />rilrawng mi an pum nan puarter ih mitlasam pawl an ṭul mi nan pek a si ahcun a lo kulhtu khuathimnak hi sun nitleu ah a cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule ka lo hruai ringring dingih leilung tlunih thilṭha in ka lo kimter ding. Ka lo damter dingih ka lo cakter ding. Tidai a tamzet mi hmuan bangtuk nan si ding; a kaang dah lomi ticawm bangtuk nan si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A siat ṭheh mi le hnawmpen ih a cangzo mi cu nan minung pawl in a hram hlun parah an sak saal ding a si. A kiak cia mi remsal tu le a siat ṭheh zomi inn pawl a sak saaltu tiah ciin ringring mi nan si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Sabbath ni cu nizarh ah nan tuah ih nanmah ih duhnak hawl ni ah nan hmanglo ih, cuih ni ah khualtlawng loin, hnaṭuan loin le duhdah ih ṭong loin um tahrat in hi ka ni cu nan thianghlim terih nan sunloih a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keimah in rennak sung ihsin a suak mi lungawinak cu nan co ding. Leilung pumpuluk ah upat mi ah ka lo tuah ding. Nan pu Jakob hnenih ka pekmi ram cu lungawi aipuang zet in nan luah ding. Bawipa keimah in ka sim zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu nanmah runtu si dingah a ṭawnṭai tuk lawmmam lo. Bomnak dilih nan aunak theilo tiangin a hna a seet lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nan sualnak ruangah a lo theilo a si sawn. Amah biak nan tum tikah Pathian thawn a lo ṭhentu cu nanmah ih sualnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuphan nan per, thisen nan luan ter, mi nan that; nan mawh rori a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A Thuṭhennak hmunih nan feh tikah dingnak cu nanmah ih lamah a um lo. Neh duh ah thuphan per nan rinsan a si. Midang natter duhnak thinlung nan neih mi cu nan tuahsuak rori.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A sia mi tumtahnak nan neih mi cu tur nei mi rulpi tii bangtuk a si. Pakhat nan vuakkuai ih nan siatsuah thei khalle a dang pakhat a rasuak saal ding. Asinain cuih nan tumtahnak cu nan hrangah zianghman ṭhathnemnak a neilo; maimom bu ih tuah mi hnipuan vekin santlailo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ṭha lo mi tumtahnak thinlung nan nei ringring ih cumi tuahsuak ding cu nan hiarzet! Mawhneilo minung that dingah nan khul a fung dah lo. Nan fehnak kipah siatsuahnak le miṭhionak lawng nan thlenter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nan kiangkap minung pawl zohman an him lo a si. Nan thiltuah mi hmuahhmuah cu a diklo mi hlir an si. Nan fehnak lamzin cu a ngawi ih cuih lamzin a thluntu hmuahhmuah in hnangamnak an hmu lo ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Misenpi in, “Ziangah so Pathian in kanmah in siatsuahtu pawl kut ihsin in runlo ti cu atu ah kan thei ngah zo. Kan fehnak lamzin vaangtertu dingah tleunak kan beisei naan thimnak lawng a um ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />mitcaw bangin kan vak a si. Sun nitlaang asinan zan khawthim le mithi khua khuathimnak hmun bangin kan bah kan ril.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ṭihphannak in kan khatih vansaanglam in kan um. Hremnak le tuahmawhnak ihsin in runtu dingah Pathian kan haizet naan hai man a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Maw Bawipa , na parih kan sualnak hi a tam ngaingai. Kanmah ih sualnak in in mawhthluk a si. Kan sualnak cu kan theifel ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangmah cu kan lo dodal, kan lo hnong ih kan lo thlun duh lo. Midang kha kan hremih na parah ral kan tho. Kan ruahnak a diklo ih kan ṭongmi khal hi thuphan hlir a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dingnak cu kan dawihlo ih thudik in in naih thei nawn lo. Senpi pumkhawmnak hmunah thuhman cu a bah ih felnak hrangah hmun a lawng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ṭhatnak a maltuk lawmmam thlang ih thilsia a tuah nawn lotu cu hmakhatte-ah tuahmawhnak a tong a si,” an ti. Himi cu Bawipa in a hmu zo ih dingnak a um theilo ruangah a lung a awi lo ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Namnuai mi pawl bawmtu dingah zohman an umlo kha a hmuh tikah a mang a bang ngaingai. Curuangah amai cahnak huham cu a hmang dingih nehtu a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dingnak cu raldonak thir angki bangin a hruk dingih nehnak cu thir lukhuh bangin a khum ding. Hremnak a tuartu pawl ai-ih phulaknak le daantatnak, a diklo mi dik dingih tuah duhnak thinlung in puan bangin a tuam aw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ral pawl cu lamhlapi ih an um hmanah an tuahsualnak vekin a hrem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nisuahnak ihsin nitlaknak tiang mi hmuahhmuah in amah le a huham cu an ṭih ding. Tilian le thlipi bangin amah cu a ra ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung pawl hnenah, “Nan sualnak ihsin a kirtu pawl hmuahhmuah ṭan dingah le run dingah Jerusalem ah ka ra ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nanmah thawn thukamnak ka tuah: Ka huham le ka thuzirhnak pawl ka lo pe a si; atu thok ihsin nan thlun pei ih nanmah san, nan faate san le nan tefa sin san tiang le sanmureng tiang ka thu ngai dingin nan zirh ringring pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem, tho awla ni bangin tleu aw; Bawipaió sunlawinak cu na parah a tlaang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Miphundang hmuahhmuah cu thimnak in a khuh ding, Asinain Bawipaió tleunak cu na parah a tlaang ding. Amah ih sunlawinak cu na hnenah a um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Miphun hmuahhmuah in na tleunak an pan dingih Siangpahrang pawl in na nisuak thar cu an fuk ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na kiangkap thlir awla zohhnik! Na minung pawl ra tlung dingin an tongaw khawm a si. Na fapa pawl cu lamhlatpi ihsin an ra ding; Na fanu pawl cu naute bangin cawi an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cumi na hmuh tikah na lung a awi dingih, Na lungawi tukah na ṭhia thlohthlo ding. Tipi khatlam raal in an lennak an rak keng dingih, Miphun tampi ih lennak cu na hnenah an rak keng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Midian ram le Efah ramin Kalauk a ruun in an ra ding. Sheba ramin an ra dingih sui le rimhmui an rak keng ding. Pathian ih thiltuah mi thuthangṭha cu mi in an phuang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kedar le Nebaioth mi pawl ih tuu hmuahhmuah cu, Na hnenah thawinak ah an rak keng dingih Bawipa lungawinak ah biakṭheng parah thawinak an tuah ding. Bawipa in a Biakinn cu nasa sinsin in a tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khawdur bangtuk le a inn lam pan ih a zuangmi thuro vekin a ra mi tangphawlawng pawl hi ziang lawng so an si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lamhlatpi ihsin a ra ih Pathian ih minung pawl a phurtu lawng an si. Israel ih Pathian thianghlim, Amaió minung pawl upatnak petu dingah miphun hmuahhmuah a tuahtu Pathian ih hmin thangṭhatnak le upatnak petu dingah sui le ngun an rak phur a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in Jerusalem hnenah, “Ramdangmi in na ralhruang an sak dingih an lal pawl in nangmah an lo rian ding. Ka thinhengin ka lo hrem zo; Asinain atu ihsin ka mithmai ṭha na hmu dingih na parah zaangfahnak ka nei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A sun a zan in na kotka pawl cu on an si dingih Miphunkip siangpahrang pawl in an lennak an rak keng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asinain nangmah a lo rian lotu miphun pawl cu an cem ṭheh ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Lebanon tupi sungih thing ṭhabik pawl, farthing, hualthing le tufar thing pawl cu, Jerusalem nangmah sak saalnak ah, Ka Biakinn mawiter nakah le Ka khawpi sunlawi ternak ah an rak keng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangmah a lo hremtu pawl ih fapa tla cu Upatnak in na hmaiah an ra kuun ding. A rak lo hmuhsuamtu pawl cu na kehramah an bok dingih, ‘ Bawipaió khawpi,’ Israel ih Pathian thianghlim ih khawpi Zion,’ tiah an lo ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Hnawhtakmi le huatmi na si nawn lo ding, Tlansan mi le a ṭhing mi khawpi na si nawn lo ding. A nasa mi le a mawi mi ah ka lo tuah dingih, Kumkhua ih nunnomnak khawpi ah na cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Miphun tampi le siangpahrang pawl in an lo kilkhawi ding; Nu in a faate a kilkhawi bangin. Bawipa Keimah in ka lo run zo ih Israel Pathian Cungnungbik ih ka lo luatter hi na thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Dar ai ah sui ka lo sum ding; Thir ai ah ngun ka lo phurh dingih zanthing ai ah dar ka lo ken ding. Lungto ai ah thir na nei ding. A lo uktu pawl in an lo hrem nawn lo ding; Dingnak le daihnak thawn ka lo ukter ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thah awknak thawmvang cu na thei nawn lo dingih siatsuahnak cu na ramsungah a thleng nawn lo ding. Ralhruang bangin Keimah rori in Ka lo hum ka lo ṭan dingih, Ka lo run zo ruangah i cawimawi ringring ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Sun ah ni cu na tleunak a si nawn lo dingih, Zan khalah thlapi cu na tleunak a si nawn lo ding. Bawipa keimah cu kumkhua in na tleunak ka si dingih Ka sunlawinak huham tleu cu na parah a tlaang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na riahsiatnak tikcu caan cu a cem thlang ding. Bawipa Keimah cu a kumkhua in na tleunak ka si dingih Ni le thlapi hnakin rei a daih ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na minung pawl in a hman mi an tuah dingih hi ram cu a kumkhua in an luah ding. An zate hnenih ka natsatnak langter dingah Ka phun mi le ka tuah mi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na minung lakih a fatebik le a nautabik innsang hman cu leilung tlunih a cakmi miphun tlukin a nasa ding. Hi thil hmuahhmuah cu tikcu a kim tikah zamrang zetin ka kimter ding. Keimah hi Bawipa ka si!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipaió thlarau cu ka hnenah a um ih cahnak in i khah ter. Bawipa in i hril ih farah hnenah thuthangṭha sim dingah, Thinlung kuai mi damter dingah, Ral kaih mi pawl hnenih luatnak thu thantu dingah le thawngtla mi pawl hnenih luatnak thu sim dingah i thlah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung pawl a runsuak dingih an ral pawl a nehnak tikcu a rathleng zo, ti ih thuthantu dingah i thlah a si. Riahsia mi pawl hneem dingah le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zion ih ninghangin a um mi pawl hnenah riahsiatnak ai ah lungawi thinnomnak, ninghannak ai ah thangṭhatnak hla thlentu dingah i thlah a si. Bawipa amah in a phun mi, thingkung bangtuk an si ding. An zate in a hman mi an tuah dingih Pathian cu a thiltuah mi ruangah thangṭhat a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kum reipi hnawmpen ih a cangzo mi khawpi pawl cu an sak saal ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka minung pawl ramdangmi in an lo rian ding. Nan tuurual pawl an kilkhawi ding; Nan lo an thlo dingih nan sabit hmuan an sial ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule nannih cu Bawipaió puithiam timi nan si ding; Mi phundang pawl ih lennak cu nan ei dingih mi nan dawtsorh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nan ningzahnak le nan mualphonak cu a cem a si. Nanmah ih ram sungah nan um dingih nan lennak cu a let hnih in a ṭhang ding. Kum khua in nan lung a awi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Dingnak cu ka duh ih puarthaunak le thisen luannak cu ka hua a si. Ka minung pawl cu felte in an ṭuan man ka pe dingih anmah thawn kum khua in a hmun mi thukamnak ka tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Miphun hmuahhmuah lakah an hmin a thang ding; A hmutu hmuahhmuah in keimah ih ka thlawsuah mi miphun an si kha an thei ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipaió thiltuah mi ruangah Jerusalem cu a lung a awi. Ṭhit awknak puai hrangih a thuam aw mi mo vek a si. Pathian in runnak le nehnak thawn a thuam zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A siat mi um loih a kho mi le a ṭhang mi thlaici vekin, Bawipa in a minung pawl cu a run ding. Cuticun Bawipa cu miphun hmuahhmuah in an thangṭhat ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem tha tho ter dingah ka simsuak ding; Runnak a ngah hlanlo le Zan ih datmei tleu vekih a nehnak a tleu hlanlo daite cun ka um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem, nehtu na si kha miphun hmuahhmuah in an hmu ding. An siangpahrang pawl khalin na sunlawi zia an zoh ding. Hmin thar in kawh na si ding; Bawipa amah rori ih a lo pek mi hmin in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa hrangih a mawizet mi siangpahrang lukhum vek na si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Tlansan mi,” ti ih kawh na si nawn lo ding; “Maak mi Nupi,” ti tla in na ram cu kawh a si nawn lo ding. Na hmin thar cu “Pathian a parah a lung a awi,” ti a si ding. Na ram cu “Lungawite ih ṭhit mi,” ti a si ding. Ziangahtile na parah Bawipa cu a lung a awi ih na ram hrangah amah cu pasal bangtuk a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tlangval in fala thiang a ṭhit vekin, Nang khal a lo tuahtu in a lo ṭhi ding. Tlangval cu a fala par ih a lung a awi vekin, Pathian cu na parah a lung a awi ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem, na ralhruang parah ralvengtu pawl ka retih A sun a zan in an dai lo ding; Bawipa in amai thukam a hngilh panglonak dingah Bawipa hnenah theihternak thu an sim ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa in Jerusalem a nunter saal hlanlo le Leilung pumpuluk porh tlak khawpi ih a canter hlanlo Bawipa cu colhnak tikcu an pe lo ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa cun siatcam in thu a kam ih a cahnak in a tuahsuak ding: “Nan rawl fang cu na ral pawl hrangah a si nawn lo dingih nan sabitti tla cu ramdang mi in an in nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Rawl a tuhtu le a khawmtu nanmah in rawl cu nan ei dingih Bawipa nan thangṭhat ding. Sabit a sialtu le a rah a lo tu nanmah in sabitti cu Bawipaió Biakinn sungah nan in ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem mi pawl, khua sungin suak uhla a ra kir mi nan minung pawl hrangah lamzin ceek uh! Lamzinpi tuah uhla lungto tla hlon ṭheh uh! Leilung pumpi theih dingin hminsinnak taar uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Jerusalem mi pawl cu sim uh, Anmah runtu Bawipa a ra lai; A hum zo mi minung pawl cu a hnenah a ratpi a si,” tiah miphun hmuahhmuah hnenah thu a than.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nanmah tla cu “Pathian Mithianghlim,” “ Bawipa Ih Run Mi Pawl,” tiah kawh nan si dingih Jerusalem cu, “Pathian Ih Duhmi Khawpi,” “Pathian Tlansan Lomi Khawpi,” tiah kawh a si ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Edom ram Bozrah khua ihsin a ra lai rero mipa hi zoso a si? A senzet mi puan in a thuam aw ih a nasa zet mi a cahnak thawn a ra fehtu hi zoso a si? Bawipa a si! Mi run dingah a cakzet mi a si ih a mi nehnak thu than dingah a ra a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ziangah so a hnipuan cu sabit sawrtu ih hnipuan bangin a sen ṭheh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Miphun pawl cu sabit bangin ka sawr ih keimah bom dingah zohman an pok lo. Kan thinheng in ka sawr hai ih an thisen in ka hnipuan cu a ṭeh thluh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka minung pawl runnak tikcu a thlengih an ral pawl hremnak caan a thleng zo, tiah ka ruatcat zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka kiangkap ka zoh ih zohman bawmtu ka neih lo kha ka hmuh tikah ka mang a bang ngaingai. Asinain ka thinhengnak in i cakter ih keimah tein nehnak cu ka ngahsuak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka thinheng in miphun pawl cu ka ciil ṭheh in ka ṭhendarh ṭheh. An nunnak thisen cu leilung ah ka thlet ṭheh a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A pelh dah lomi Bawipaió duhdawtnak thu ka sim ding; Kan hrangih a tuah mi ruangah amah cu ka thangṭhat. A zaangfahnak le a thlengaw dah lomi a duhdawtnak ruangah Israel mi pawl cu famkimzet in a thlawsuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Anmah tla cu ka minung an si; ziangtik hmanah in bum lo ding,” a ti. Curuangah an tuarnak ihsin a run a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Annih runtu cu vancungmi a si lo. Bawipa amah hrimhrim a si. A duhdawtnak le a lainatnak ruangah a runsuak a si. A liamzo mi tikcu ah a rak kilkhawi ringring hai naan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />amah an dodal ih a thlarau thianghlim cu riahsiatnak in an khahter. Curuangah Bawipa cu an ralah a cangih amah in a do hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a liamzo mi tikcu, Bawipaió riantu Moses sanlai kha an vun ciing saal ih, “Khui ah so a minung hotu pawl tifinriat ihsin a runsuaktu Bawipa cu a si? Moses hnenah cahnak huham a hleice ih a petu Bawipa cu khui ah so a si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khui ah so kumkhua ih a hmin a thannak a nasazet mi thil a tuah ih a minung pawl hmaiah tifinriat tidai a ṭhentertu Bawipa cu a um?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa in tidai thuuk sungin a hruai tikah an ke pawl cu hramlak rang ih ke bangin a hnget ih an bah dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cawrual cu hrampi ṭhatnak rawnih an hruai ṭheu vekin Bawipa in a minung pawl cu colhnak a pek a si. Cuticun a hruai ih amai hmin ṭhatnak ah a cang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , thianhlimnak le sunlawinak thawn na umnak vancung khua ihsin in run zoh hram aw. Kan hrangih helhkamnak na neih mi cu khui ah so a si? Na cahnak huham cu khui ah so a um? Khui ah so in duhdawtnak le in lainatnak cu a si? In daithlan hram hlah aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangmah cu kan Pa na si. Kan pu Abraham le Jakob hmanin in bawm thei lo; a sinan Bawipa , nang cu kan Pa na si. Nangmah cu in runsuaktu ringring na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ziangah so na lamzin ihsin in pial ter? Ziangtin so mi lungruh le na hnen ihsin a pial mi in siter siang? Nangmah a lo riantu pawl ih ruangah le na ta a si ringring mi na minung pawl ih ruangah hin ra kir saal hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kan ral pawl in na minung pawl cu an dawi hlo thluh zikte zo ih Biakinn khal an ti borhhlawh zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In uktu a si dah lo bangin na um ih kannih tla hi na minung a si dah lo bangin in tuah a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ziangah so van khi thlek tahratin na rung ṭum lo? Tlang saangpi pawl in an lo hmu dingih nangmah ṭih ah an khur thlohthlo ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meisa parih tidai a so bangin an ṭhia rero ding a si. Ra awla na ral pawl hnenah na cahnak huham langter awla miphun hmuahhmuah in an lo hmuh tikah khur rero hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Voikhat cu na ra ih kan ruah dah lo mi ṭihnungza thil pawl na tuah zo; tlang pawl in an lo hmuh tikah ṭihnak thawn an ṭhia rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An Pathian an rinsan ruangah an hrangah hi bangtuk thil a tuahtu Pathian cu zohman in an hmu dah lo, a theih khal an thei dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na duh vekih nung dingah a ciing ṭhatu le thil hman tuah tahrat ih a lung a awi tu pawl cu na lawm ṭheu a si. Kan parah na thin a heng, a sinan kan sual ringring thotho. Na thin a hengzet naan khuahlan lai ihsin kan palh ringring thotho a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan zate in mi borhhlawh kan si ṭheh; kan hnaṭuan ṭhabik khal cu fihnungzet a si ko. Kan sual ruangah thli ih semhlo mi thinghnah ro bangtuk kan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na hmin ko in thlacamtu zohman kan um lo; nangmai bomnak dil dingah zohman na hnenah kan ra lo. Kan hmuh lo dingah na relh ih kan sual ruangah in dungtun a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Bawipa nang cu kan Pa na si. Kannih cu tlak bangtuk kan si ih nang cu beel tuahtu bangtuk na si. Nangmah ih seemsuah mi kan si ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />kan parah na thinheng tuk hram hlah aw; kumkhua ih sual phurtu khal in siter siang hram hlah aw! Nangmai milai kan si ih kan parah zaangfahnak nei hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na khua thianghlim pawl cu nelrawn ah an cang zo ih Jerusalem tla hnawmpen le ramṭhing ah a cang zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kan pipu pawl ih an rak lo thangṭhatnak a thianghlim mi le a mawizet mi kan Biakinn khal meisa in a kaang ṭheh a si. Kan sunsak zetmi hmun pawl cu hnawmpen ah an cang ṭheh zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , hibangtuk thil na hmuh tikah hin na zianghman a poi lo maw si? Dai zirziar in na um ko ding maw si? Kan tuar thei nawn lo tiang in tuarter ding maw si?
  </para>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ka minung pawl ih thlacamnak let dingah ka tiar aw naón annih in thla an cam lo! Anmah ih ton dingah ka tiar aw naón annih cun a ton hman in tum lo! Ka hnenih thla a cam lomi miphun hnenah, ‘Hinah ka um, ka lo bawm ding,’ ti ih sawn dingah ka ralring naón ka hnenah thla an cam riai lo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thilsual lawnglawng lungruh zetih a tuahtu le anmah ih duhnak lawng a thluntu pawl hnenah catbaang loin ka zaa ka saan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ningzah hman thiam loin ka thin in hengter ringring. Hmuan sung ṭhumhmun ah lawki raithawinak an pekih khawvel biakṭheng parah rimhmui an ur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zan ṭhing ah mithi thlarau tong dingah lungpuk le thlaan tla ah an feh. Himi pawl in voksa an ei ih khawvel pawl ih raithawinak sahang an in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asinain midang hnenah cun, ‘In dai hlah uh, a thiangmi kan si,’ an ti. Hi vek minung pawl cu zawi cawk ding an si lo; an parih ka thinhengnak cu a mit dah lomi meisa bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Anmah hrem ding cu ka ruatcat zo ih ka thuṭhennak cu ngan ṭheh a si zo. An thil tuah mi cu pakhat hman hrelh loin ka hmu ṭheh dingih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />anmah ih sualman le an pipu pawl ih sualman cu an hlawh ding. Khawvel pawl in tlang parih an dawlmi biakṭheng parah rimhmui an ur ih in thangsiat a si. Curuangah annih cu hlanih an tuahnak vekin ka hrem ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Zohman in sabit rah ṭha cu an siatsuah dah lo; sabit rah ṭha cun sabitti an tuahsawn a si. Cuvekin ka minung pawl cu ka siatsuah ṭheh lo ding; Keimah i riantu pawl cu ka hum ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judah hrin Israel mi pawl cu ka thlawsuah dingih an tefa sin pawl in tlangpar ram cu an luah ding. Cutawkah ka hrilmi le i riantu pawl cu an um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keimah in bia dingih an tuu le an caw pawl cu tlimno umnak ram nitlaknak lamah Sharon phairawn, nisuahnak lamah Harsatnak phairawn timi ah an thlah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sikhalsehla keimah i dungtun tu, ka tlang thianghlim Zion a hnongih vanṭhatnak khuavang Gad le vansiatnak khuavang Meni a biatu nannih pawl hrangah cun cubangtuk cu a si lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka lo kawh tikah in let loih nan hnenih ka ṭong tikah in ngailo ruangah saarthih lawnglawng in nan thi ding. Ka thu el le a ṭha lomi tuah cu nanmah ih hrilmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Curuangah ka lo sim hai: Keimah i biatu le ka thu a thluntu pawl cu ei ding le baar ding tampi an nei ringring ding; a sinan nannih cu nan ril a rawng dingih nan ti a haal ding a si. Annih cu an lung a awi ding; a sinan nannih cu ningzak le hmaisia in nan um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Annih cu an thin nuam in hla an sa ding; a sinan nannih cu nan thinlung kuai in nan ṭap ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka hrilmi ka minung pawl in nan hmin cu thlalet camnak ah an hmang ding. Bawipa keimah rori in ka lo thihter ding. Sikhalsehla ka thu a thluntu pawl cu hminthar ka pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi ramsungih a um mi thlawsuah vanluhnak a diltu hmuahhmuah in rintlak a si mi Pathian ih thlawsuahnak an dil ding a si. Siatcam in thukamnak a tuahtu hmuahhmuah in rintlak a si mi Pathian hmin in an tuah ding. A liamzo mi tikcu ih harsatnak pawl cu a cem dingih hngilh ṭheh an si thlang ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Zohhnik, lei thar le van thar ka tuah rero lai a si. A liamzo mi thil pawl cu hngilh ṭheh an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kan siamthar mi parah hin lungawi aipuang ringring in um uh. Ka tuahmi Jerusalem thar cu lungawinak in a khat dingih a khuasung mi pawl cu an thin a nuam ngaingai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem khua le a minung pawl ruangah keimah khal ka lung a awi ding. Cutawkah cun ṭahnak a um lo ding; bomnak dil khal a ṭul nawnlo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nau note thih khal a umlo dingih zokhal an sankim in an nung ding. Kum zakhat a ti mi pawl cu mino ti an si ding. Cuih hlanih an thih asile keimah in daan ka tat a si, ti khihhmuhnak a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Inn an sak dingih a sungah an um ding; an sakmi inn cu zohman in an luahsak lo ding. Sabit hri an ciing dingih sabitti an in ding; midang zohman in an in sak lo ding. Thingkung bangin ka minung pawl cu an san a sau ding. An ṭuan mi rah cu tlamtling zetin an ei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An hnaṭuannak ah hlawhtlinnak an nei dingih an tefa sin pawl cu siatsuah tuahmawhnak an tonglo ding. Anmah le an tefa sin pawl cu san ih khuk tiang ka thlawsuah hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka hnen ih thlacam an ṭheh hlan hmanah an thlacamnak cu ka let ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cinghnia le tuufaate pawl cu hmunkhat ah rawl an ei tlaang dingih caw bangtuk in kiosa in fangkuang ro a ei ding. Rul tla cu ṭihnungza a si nawnlo ding. Maw Zion, ka tlang thianghlim, zianghman ṭihnungza le thilṭha lo a um nawn lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Vancung cu ka tokham a si ih leilung cu ka ke retnak a si. Curuangah ziang bangtuk inn le hmun so ka umnak dingah nan sak thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lei le van pumpi hi keimai seemsuah mi an si. Thinlung a neem mi, siir awknak thinlung a nei mi le ka thu thlun ih i ṭihzahtu pawl parah cun ka lung a awi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Minung cun anmah ih duhnak thlun in hna an ṭuan. Saserh hrangah cawcang an that, milai tla raithawinak ah an pek; tuufaate an that ih uico ih hngawng tla an tan; sangphut thawinak an pekih vok thii khal an pek. Rimhmui an ur ih milem hmaiah thla an cam. Ningsinza biaknak cu an lungawi zawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah an parah harsatnak thil poimawh ka thlenter ding, an ṭih thlohthlo mi thil poimawh ka thlen ter ding a si. Ziangahtile ka kawh tikah zohman in in awi lo; ka ṭong tikah zohman in an ngailo. Ka thu el le thil ṭha lo tuah cu anmah ih hrilmi a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipaió ṭongmi hi ngaihnik uh, nannih amah a ṭihzahtu le a thu a thluntu pawl: “Keimah in rinsan ruangah nan phunpi hrekkhat pawl cun an lo hua ih ziang hmanah an lo siarlo a si. An lo hmuhsuam ih ‘Lungawi aipuang in khua nan sak cu kan hmu duh a si. Curuangah Bawipa in a cahnak langter sehla lo hum seh,’ an ti. Sikhalsehla anmah sawn kha ningzaktu ding an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngaihnik uh! Khawpi sungih thawmvang le Biakinn ihsin aw a thangmi cu Bawipa in a ral pawl a hremnak thawmvang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ka khawpi thianghlim cu, nausuah natnak zianghman tuar lotein rinlopi ih fapa a neitu nunau nu vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cubangtuk cu zotalin an thei dah, an hmu dah maw? Miphun phunkhat hi ni khat sungah hrin a si dah maw? Hi miphun phunkhat a suah tikah Zion cu reipi a tuar a ṭul lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi ka miphun cu hrin tikcu tiang ka hruai ding naan ka suak ter lo dingah maw nan ruat?” tiah a ti. Bawipa in a sim zo a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem thawn nan lungawi uh, a hrangah nan thin nuam uh, hi khawpi a duhtu pawl! Atu ah amah thawn nan lungawi uh, a hrangih ninghannak a neitu pawl!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A lennak parah nan thin a nuam ding, a nu ih hnawi hnangam zetih a fawptu naute bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Malsawmnak le ṭhansonak cu cat loin ka lo pe ding; a kang dah lomi tiva bangin miphun tampi ih lennak cu nan hnenah a luang ding. Duhdawtnak thlum thawn a nu in a ṭaang parah a cawi ih ṭhate ih a kilkhawi mi naute bangtuk nan si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Naute hrangih hneemtu ṭhabik cu a nu a si bangtuk in Jerusalem khuasungah ka lo hneem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cu bangtuk ih a cangmi thil nan hmuh tikah nan lung a awi ding; a lo cakter dingih nan damnak khal a si ding. Cuticun Bawipa keimah in ka thu a thluntu cu ka bawm ih ka ral pawl parih ka thinhengnak ka langter zia kha nan thei ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa cu meisa thawn a ra ding. Thlipi ih thlazim parah Bawipa cu a to dingih a thin a heng tertu pawl cu a hrem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amah hmai ih mawhnak neitu leilung tlun minung pawl cu meisa le ralnam in a hrem dingih mi tampi an thi ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Raithawinak hrangah a thiangfai awter ih hmuan sungih an dawl mi biakṭheng ah a rual, a rual in a fehtu pawl, voksa le zinghnam ah a rual, a rual in a fehtu pawl, voksa le zinghnam sa le a dang ti-rawl fihnungza a ei tu pawl ih san cu a cemzik thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An thinlung ruah mi le an hnaṭuannak cu ka thei ṭheh a si. “Phun tampi le hnam tampi ih milai pawl, pumkhawm ter dingah ka ra ding. Cuti ih an ton awk khawm tikah ka thilti theizia an hmu dingih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />anmah hremtu cu keimah ka si kha an thei ding. “Sikhalsehla mihrekkhat cu ka zuah dingih, ka hminthannak, ka natsatnak le ka huham neihzia a thei dah lotu miphun pawl le lamhlatpi ih a um mi ramah ka kuat ding: Spain ram, Libia ram, conkiang saithiam pawl umnak Lidia ram, Tubal ram le Grik ramah ka kuat ding. Hi miphun pawl lakah ka natsatnak thu an sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi ram pawl ihsin nan phunpi nan unau pawl cu an rak kirpi dingih ka hrangah laksawng bangtuk an si ding. Israel mi pawl in sangphut thawinak cu bawm thiangfai thawn Biakinn ih an rak ken bangin nan hrinpi unau pawl cu Jerusalem ih ka tlang thiang parah rang, laak, kalauk, rangleng le cawleng thawn an ratpi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anmah sungin mi hrek khat cu puithiam le Levi mi ah ka tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Van thar le leilung thar tla cu ka huham thawngin a hngetmi an si ding vekin nan tefa sin le nan hmin tla cu a hmun mi an si ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thla thar puai tin le nizarh ni tinah miphun tinkim cu hi Jerusalem ah keimah be dingah an ra ding,” tiah Bawipa in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“An kir sal tikah keimah i dotu le i raltu ih ruak pawl cu an hmu ding. An ruak a ei tu tholung pawl cu an thi dah lo dingih anmah urnak meisa khal a mit dah lo ding. Miphun tinkim ih mithmuh ah fihnungza an si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
</usx>
